hadiths[1243]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar ka pani paak hai."
"5500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ka pani safed hai aur aurat ka pani peela; phir jab donon jama hon aur mard ki mani aurat ki mani par ghalib aaye to Allah ke izn se nar paida hota hai; aur jab aurat ki mani mard ki mani par ghalib aaye to Allah ke izn se maada paida hoti hai."
"5501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ka pani gaarha safed hai aur aurat ka pani patla peela hai; phir in mein se jo aage barhe bachcha us se mushabeh hota hai."
"5502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zamzam ka pani jis ke liye piya jaye us ke liye hai."
"5503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hukmaran ke maalon mein se jo tumhein Allah de baghair mangne aur lalach ke to use khao aur maal banao."
"5504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is maal mein se jo tumhein Allah de baghair mangne aur lalach ke to use lo aur maal banao ya sadqa karo; aur jo na ho to apne aap ko us ke peeche na lagao."
"5505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo mujh par iman nahi laya jo pait bhar kar soye aur us ka parosi us ke pehlu mein bhooka ho halanke wo use janta ho."
"5506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum jama nahi hoti phir Allah ke zikr aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood ke baghair muntashir hoti magar murdar se zyada badbudaar se uthti hai."
"5507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum zikr par jama nahi hoti aur us se muntashir hoti magar un se kaha jata hai: Utho bakhshe hue."
"5508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum jama nahi hoti aur Allah ke zikr ke baghair muntashir hoti magar goya wo gadhe ke murdar se muntashir hui; aur wo majlis un par hasrat hogi."
"5509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama nahi hoti jo Allah ki kitab parhti hai aur aapas mein us ka dars karti hai magar un par sukoon utarta hai, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, farishte unhein gher lete hain aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum majlis mein jama nahi hoti aur muntashir hoti hai aur Allah ka zikr nahi karti aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood nahi bhejti magar un ki majlis qayamat ke din un par hasrat hogi."
"5511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us ke liye us ki is jihad mein duniya aur aakhirat mein us ke deenaron ke siwa kuch nahi pata jo us ne naam liye."
"5512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke Uhud mere liye sona ban jaye jo mere paas teen se zyada deenar thehre siwaye deenar ke jo main qarz ke liye rok lun."
"5513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke mere paas sona ho aur mujh par teen guzrein aur mere paas us mein se kuch ho siwaye kuch ke jo main qarz ada karne mein rok lun."
"5514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke shakhs ko salam karun halanke wo namaz parh raha ho; aur agar wo mujhe salam kare to use jawab dunga."
"5515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahi ke main insaan ki naql karun halanke mere liye aisa aur aisa ho."
"5516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda bande se Allah ke liye mohabbat nahi karta magar us ka Rab use izzat deta hai."
"5517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere nazdeek Abu Bakr se bara ehsan wala koi nahi; unhon ne apni jaan aur maal se meri madad ki aur mujhe apni beti ka nikah diya."
"5518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi sood se zyada nahi karta magar us ke muamle ka anjaam kami ki taraf hota hai."
"5519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi jannat mein dakhil nahi hota jo pasand kare ke duniya ki taraf wapas aaye agarche us ke liye zameen par jo hai sab ho siwaye shaheed ke; kyunke wo tamanna karta hai ke wapas aaye aur das baar qatl ho jab wo izzat dekhta hai."
"5520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bete ya baap ne jo bachaya wo us ke asba ke liye hai jo bhi ho."
"5521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi rag nahi pharakti na aankh magar gunah se; aur Allah us se zyada door karta hai."
"5522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ne aakhirat mein se utna liya jaise sui samundar mein duboyi gayi us ke pani mein se le."
"5523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum par faqr ka darr nahi; lekin mujhe tum par kasrat ka darr hai. Aur mujhe tum par khata ka darr nahi; lekin mujhe tum par jaan-boojh ka darr hai."
"5524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nahi janta ke Tubba Nabi thay ya nahi? Aur main nahi janta ke Zulqarnain Nabi thay ya nahi? Aur main nahi janta ke hudood apne walon ke liye kaffare hain ya nahi?"
"5525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi cheez ko aise tawajjuh se nahi suna jaise achchi aawaz wale Nabi ko jo Quran khush-aawazi se buland parhta hai."
"5526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main muamle ko us se zyada jaldi wala nahi samajhta."
"5527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne takabbur nahi kiya jis ke saath us ka khadim khaye, bazaaron mein gadhe par sawaar ho aur bakri ko bandhe aur us ka doodh dohe."
"5528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum subah ko jitna roshan karo wo ajr mein azeem hai."
"5529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo takhnon se neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"5530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zyada miqdar nasha de us ki thori haram hai."
"5531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis se faraq nasha de us mein se hatheli bhar haram hai."
"5532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pachhne lagwane wale ko jo lage use paani bharne wale oont ko khilao."
"5533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni dhaar se lage use khao; aur jo apne pehlu se lage aur maar de wo gundala hua hai; pas use na khao."
"5534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi subah meri nahi hoti magar main us mein Allah taala se sau baar bakhshish mangta hun."
"5535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum ne apni biwi ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tum ne apne bete ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; jo tum ne apne khadim ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai; aur jo tum ne apne aap ko khilaya wo tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"5536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum kitne pakeeza sheher ho aur mujhe kitne mehboob ho; aur agar meri qaum mujhe tum se na nikalti to tumhare siwa kahin na rehta. Ye Makka se kaha."
"5537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabz aasman ne saya nahi kiya na gard-aalood zameen ne uthaya Abu Zarr se zyada sachche lehje wale ko."
"5538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabz aasman ne saya nahi kiya na gard-aalood zameen ne uthaya Abu Zarr se zyada sachche aur wafa-daar lehje wale ko jo Isa Ibn Maryam se mushabeh hain."
"5539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nahi samajhta ke falan aur falan hamare deen mein se kuch jante hain."
"5540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ne apni biwi ko jo diya wo sadqa hai."
"5541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghar walon ko narmi nahi di jati magar unhein faida deti hai."
"5542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein nahi deta na rokta; main taqseem karne wala hun, jahan hukm diya gaya rakhta hun."
"5543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande ke donon qadam Allah ki raah mein gard-aalood nahi hote magar Allah ne us par aag haram ki."
"5544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo ghar salan se khaali nahi jis mein sirka ho."
"5545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko kafir nahi kehta magar un mein se aik par laut-ta hai."
"5546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ne kabhi aisa khana nahi khaya jo is se behtar ho ke wo apne haath ki kamayi se khaye; aur beshak Allah ke Nabi Dawood apne haath ki kamayi se khate thay."
"5547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya aakhirat mein aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi samundar ki taraf chale aur us mein apni ungli dakhil kare; phir jo us mein se nikle wo duniya hai."
"5548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zilhajja ke das dinon mein amal us se behtar nahi aur na Allah ki raah mein jihad, siwaye shakhs ke jo apni jaan aur maal se khatra lekar nikle aur us mein se kuch lekar wapas na aaye."
"5549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pucha gaya us ke baare mein, yani qayamat, se zyada jaanne wala nahi puchne wale se; aur main tumhein us ki nishaniyon ki khabar dunga: jab laundi apni malika ko jane to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai; jab nange nangay pair logon ke sardar hon to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai; jab be-zaban maweshiyon ke charwahe imaarton mein lambe hon to ye us ki nishaniyon mein se hai. Ghaib ki paanch mein jinhein Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta: Beshak Allah ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai, aayat."
"5550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe masjdon ko uncha banane ka hukm nahi diya gaya."
"5551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya ke jab bhi peshaab karun wuzu karun; aur agar karta to sunnat hoti."
"5552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maine tumhein hukm diya use lo, aur jis se maine tumhein mana kiya us se ruko."
"5553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare liye roke wo khao."
"5554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein sawaar nahi kiya lekin Allah ne tumhein sawaar kiya; aur main Allah ki qasam Insha Allah kisi qasam par halaf nahi leta aur us ke siwa behtar dekhta magar apni qasam ka kaffara deta hun aur jo behtar hai use karta hun."
"5555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aur duniya aur main aur tasveerain."
"5556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jo main kehta hun use un se zyada sunne wale nahi, magar wo mujhe kuch jawab dene ki taqat nahi rakhte."
"5557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum hauz par mere paas aane walon mein se aik laakh mein se aik hissa nahi."
"5558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi beemari nahi utari magar us ki dawa utari."
"5559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi beemari nahi utari magar us ki shifa utari."
"5560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Taurat mein na Injeel mein Umm-ul-Quran jaisa kuch nahi utara; wo saat dohrayi jane wali aayatein hain; wo mere aur mere bande ke darmiyan taqseem hain aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga."
"5561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aasman se barkat mein se jo utarta hai magar logon mein se giroh us se kafir ho jata hai; Allah baarish utarta hai to wo kehte hain: Falan falan sitare se."
"5562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bande par naimat nahi di aur us ne us par Allah ki hamd ki magar wo hamd us naimat se behtar thi.. ..."
"5563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne bande par naimat nahi di aur us ne kaha: Alhamdulillah, magar jo us ne diya wo us se behtar tha jo us ne liya."
"5564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhara dil na-pasand kare use chhor do."
"5565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khoon bahaye aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho use khao; daant aur nakhun nahi. Aur main tumhein is ke baare mein batata hun: raha daant to haddi hai aur raha nakhun to Habsha ki chhuri hai."
"5566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein jo kuch dun na rokun; main to khazanchi hun, jahan hukm diya gaya rakhta hun."
"5567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ko utni takleef nahi di gayi jitni mujhe di gayi."
"5568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ko utni takleef nahi di gayi jitni mujhe Allah mein di gayi."
"5569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ehram bandhne wala talbiya nahi kehta na takbeer kehne wala takbeer kehta magar use jannat ki khushkhabri di jati hai."
"5570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se aik ka kiya haal hai jo apne Rab ke saamne khara hota hai aur us ke saamne thookta hai? Kiya wo pasand karta hai ke us ka saamna kiya jaye aur us ke chehre mein thooka jaye? Phir agar tum mein se koi thookay to apne bayen ya apne qadam ke neeche thookay; phir agar na paye to aise kahe, yani apne kapre mein."
"5571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jin se aaj qatl barh gaya yahan tak ke unhon ne aulad qatl ki? Khabardar, tumhare behtareen mushrikeen ke bete hain. Khabardar, aulad qatl na karo. Khabardar, aulad qatl na karo. Har jaan fitrat par paida hoti hai; wo us par rehti hai yahan tak ke us ki zaban us ki taraf se bole; phir us ke walidain use Yahudi banate hain ya Nasrani."
"5572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jinhon ne aisa aur aisa kaha? Lekin main namaz parhta hun aur sota hun, roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun aur auraton se nikah karta hun; pas jo meri sunnat se be-raghbati kare wo mujh se nahi."
"5573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jo us cheez se paaki ikhtiyar karte hain jo main karta hun? Allah ki qasam, main un mein Allah ko sab se zyada jaanne wala hun aur us se sab se zyada darne wala hun."
"5574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaumon ka kiya haal hai jo apni namazon mein apni nazrein aasman ki taraf uthate hain? Wo is se zaroor baaz aayen warna un ki nazrein uchak li jayengi."
"5575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un logon ka kiya haal hai jo namaz mein apne haathon se phenkte hain goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Kiya tum mein se aik ko kafi nahi ke apna haath apni raan par rakhe aur apne dayen aur bayen salam kare?"
"5576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mardon ka kiya haal hai jo wisal karte hain? Tum meri tarah nahi ho; Allah ki qasam, agar mere liye maheena barhaya jata to wisal karta aisa wisal jo gehrayi mein jane walon ki gehrayi chhor de."
"5577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko Dajjal se daraya; use Nooh ne daraya aur un ke baad nabiyon ne. Aur wo tum mein niklega; phir jo us ke muamle mein tum par chhupa rahe wo tum par nahi chhupega ke tumhara Rab kaana nahi aur wo dayen aankh se kaana hai goya us ki aankh ubhri hui angoor hai. Khabardar, Allah ne tum par tumhare khoon aur maal haram kiye hain jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat tumhare is sheher mein tumhare is maheene mein. Khabardar, kiya maine pahunchaya? Ae Allah, gawah reh, teen baar. Afsos tum par! Dekho, mere baad kafir ban kar wapas na aana ke tum mein se baaz baaz ki gardanein marein."
"5578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne apni ummat ko kaane jhoote Dajjal se daraya. Khabardar, wo kaana hai aur tumhara Rab kaana nahi; us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai jise har momin parhega."
"5579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja na koi khalifa janashin banaya magar us ke liye do raaz-daan thay: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta aur us par ubharta aur aik raaz-daan jo use shar ka hukm deta aur us par ubharta. Pas mehfooz wo hai jise Allah mehfooz rakhe."
"5580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja na us ke baad koi khalifa tha magar us ke liye do raaz-daan thay: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta aur munkar se rokta aur aik raaz-daan jo use kharabi mein kotahi nahi karta. Pas jo bure raaz-daan se bacha wo bacha liya gaya."
"5581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ne bakriyan charayin; aur main unhein ahle Makka ke liye qarateeron par charata tha."
"5582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo us ki zakaat ada karne tak pahunche aur zakaat de wo khazana nahi."
"5583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naaf aur ghutne ke darmiyan satr hai."
"5584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan qibla hai."
"5585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon phoonkon ke darmiyan chalis hain; phir Allah aasman se pani utarega aur wo aise ugenge jaise sabzi ugti hai. Aur insaan mein se koi cheez nahi magar bosida hoti hai siwaye aik haddi ke jo dumchi ki haddi hai; usi se paida kiya gaya aur usi se qayamat ke din jora jayega."
"5586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan jannat ke baghon mein se bagh hai."
"5587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan jannat ke baghon mein se bagh hai; aur mera mimbar mere hauz par hai."
"5588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam ki paidaish se qayamat qayam hone tak Dajjal se bara muamla nahi."
"5589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan haram hai."
"5590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke darwazon mein se do kiwaron ke darmiyan chalis saal ki musafat hai; aur us par din zaroor aayega jab wo bhara hua hoga."
"5591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein kafir ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan tez sawaar ke liye teen din ki musafat hai."
"5592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere hauz ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan Sana aur Madina ke darmiyan jitna ya Madina aur Uman ke darmiyan jitna faasla hai; us mein sone aur chandi ke aaftabe dikhte hain aasman ke taron ki tadaad ya zyada."
"5593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mujhe kiya hukm dete ho? Tum mujhe hukm dete ho ke main use hukm dun ke apna haath tumhare munh mein dale aur use kaate jaise oont kaatta hai? Apna haath aage barhao yahan tak ke wo use kaate phir use kheench lo."
"5594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala mein do ne mohabbat nahi ki magar un mein afzal wo tha jo apne saathi se zyada mohabbat karta tha."
"5595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband mein jo takhnon ke neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"5596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haji ke oont ka pair nahi uthta na haath rakhta magar Allah taala us se us ke liye neki likhta hai ya us se burayi mitata hai ya us se darja buland karta hai."
"5597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine apne baad mardon par auraton se zyada nuqsan-deh fitna nahi chhora."
"5598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Tum Ali se kiya chahte ho? Beshak Ali mujh se hai aur main us se hun; aur wo mere baad har momin ka wali hai."
"5599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj nahi nikalta aur Allah ki makhlooq mein se kuch baaqi nahi rehta magar Allah ki hamd se tasbeeh karta hai siwaye shaitanon aur Bani Adam ke bewaqoofon ke."
"5600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi halal se sadqa nahi karta aur Allah halal ke siwa qabool nahi karta magar Rehman use apne dayen se leta hai; agarche khajoor ho to Rehman ki hatheli mein barhti hai yahan tak ke pahar se bari ho jaye jaise tum mein se koi apne bachhere ya oont ke bachche ko barhata hai."
"5601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum kiya kehte ho? Agar tumhari duniya ka muamla hai to tumhara muamla; aur agar tumhare deen ka muamla hai to meri taraf."
"5602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum shaheed ke baare mein kiya kehte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki raah mein qatl. Farmaya: Phir meri ummat ke shaheed kam honge. Jo Allah ki raah mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai, jo Allah ki raah mein mare wo shaheed hai, pait wala shaheed hai, taaoon-zada shaheed hai aur doobne wala shaheed hai."
"5603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah mein do ne mohabbat nahi ki aur un ke darmiyan judayi nahi hoti magar gunah se jo un mein se aik kare."
"5604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs masjdon ko namaz aur zikr ke liye aadi nahi banata magar Allah us se khush hota hai jab se wo apne ghar se nikalta hai jaise ghair-hazir ke ghar wale apne ghair-hazir se khush hote hain jab wo un ke paas aaye."
"5605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne koi Nabi wafat nahi diya magar wahin dafn kiya gaya jahan us ki rooh qabz ki gayi."
"5606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bande ki maut kisi zameen mein nahi banayi magar us ke liye us mein hajat banayi."
"5607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum majlis mein nahi baithti jis mein wo Allah taala ka zikr nahi karti na apne Nabi par durood bhejti magar un par hasrat hoti hai; phir agar chahe unhein azaab de aur agar chahe unhein bakhsh de."
"5608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah ka zikr karti hai magar farishte unhein gher lete hain, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, un par sukoon utarta hai aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah taala ka zikr karti hai magar aasman se pukarne wala unhein pukarta hai: Utho bakhshe hue."
"5610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi baithti jo Allah taala ka zikr karti hai aur khari hoti hai yahan tak ke un se kaha jata hai: Utho, Allah ne tumhare gunah bakhsh diye aur tumhari buraiyan nekiyon se badal dein."
"5611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare seene mein khatke use chhor do."
"5612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj kisi insaan par nahi roka gaya siwaye Yusha bin Noon par un raaton mein jab wo Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf chale."
"5613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahudiyon ne tum se kisi cheez par hasad nahi kiya jitna unhon ne salam aur aameen par hasad kiya."
"5614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka haq nahi jis ke paas kuch ho jis mein wo waseeyat karna chahe ke do raatein guzare magar us ki waseeyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"5615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ka haq nahi jis ke paas kuch ho jis mein wo waseeyat kare ke teen raatein guzare magar us ki waseeyat us ke paas likhi hui ho."
"5616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ke dil mein Allah ki raah mein ghubar nahi milta magar Allah ne us par aag haram ki."
"5617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs apne ghar se ilm talash karte hue nahi nikalta magar Allah us ke liye jannat ka raasta aasan karta hai."
"5618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takhnon se peeche jo ho wo aag mein hai."
"5619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ammar ko do muamalon ke darmiyan ikhtiyar nahi diya gaya magar unhon ne un mein se zyada durust ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"5620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do bhooke bheriye bakriyon mein chhore jayen wo un ke liye us se zyada fasaad nahi karte jitna aadmi ka maal aur izzat par hirs us ke deen ke liye hai."
"5621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine bhalayi aur burayi mein aaj jaise kabhi nahi dekha; mere liye jannat aur aag tasweer ki gayin yahan tak ke maine unhein deewar ke peeche dekha."
"5622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aag jaisa nahi dekha jis se bhaagne wala soye na jannat jaisa jis ka talabgar soye."
"5623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine koi manzar nahi dekha magar qabar us se zyada haulnak hai."
"5624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aqal aur deen mein naqis se aqal wale par tum se zyada ghalib koi nahi dekha. Raha aqal ka nuqsan to do auraton ki gawahi aik mard ki gawahi hai; aur raha deen ka nuqsan to tum mein se aik Ramazan mein roza chhorti hai aur din guzarti hai namaz nahi parhti."
"5625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham ne ghabrahat mein se kuch nahi dekha; hum ne use samundar paya."
"5626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bande ko sabr se behtar aur wasee rizq nahi diya gaya."
"5627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare kiye mein se jo maine dekha wo mujh par qayam raha yahan tak ke mujhe darr hua ke tum par likh diya jayega; aur agar tum par likh diya jata to tum us par qayam na rakhte. Pas namaz parho ae logo apne gharon mein; kyunke shakhs ki behtareen namaz us ke ghar mein hai siwaye farz namaz ke."
"5628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel mujhe parosi ki waseeyat karte rahe yahan tak ke maine samjha ke wo use waris banayenge."
"5629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khaibar ke luqme ne har saal meri taraf lautna nahi chhora yahan tak ke ye meri shah-rag katne ka waqt tha."
"5630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs Allah se teen baar jannat nahi mangta magar jannat kehti hai: Ae Allah, use jannat mein dakhil kar. Aur koi Musalman shakhs Allah se teen baar aag se panaah nahi mangta magar aag kehti hai: Ae Allah, use mujh se panaah de."
"5631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara kiya haal hai ke apne haathon se ishara karte ho goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Jab tum mein se koi salam kare to apne saathiyon ki taraf mutawajjeh ho aur apne haath se ishara na kare."
"5632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din momin ke meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahi; kyunke Allah taala fahhash bad-zaban se bughz rakhta hai."
"5633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum hidayat ke baad gumrah nahi hoti jis par thi magar use jhagda diya gaya."
"5634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi qaum mein sood aur zina zahir nahi hota magar wo apne aap par Allah ki saza halal karte hain."
"5635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi par harj nahi agar wusat paye ke juma ke din ke liye apne kaam ke kapron ke siwa do kapre banaye."
"5636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi nahi jo kahe La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar, La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah magar us ki khataen mitayi jati hain agarche samundar ke jhag jaisi hon."
"5637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi Musalman nahi jo Allah se dua se dua kare magar Allah use ata karta hai ya us se us jaisi burayi pher deta hai jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare, jab tak jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine dua ki aur dua ki aur mujhe jawab nahi diya gaya."
"5638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi jaan nahi jo mare aur us ke liye Allah ke paas bhalayi ho jo pasand kare ke tumhari taraf wapas aaye aur us ke liye duniya ho siwaye Allah ki raah mein maqtool ke; kyunke wo pasand karta hai ke wapas aaye aur dobara qatl ho jab wo Allah ka sawab dekhta hai."
"5639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par saans lene wali koi jaan nahi, yani aaj, jis par sau saal aaye."
"5640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen par koi qasam nahi jis par main halaf lun aur us ke siwa behtar dekhun magar use karun."
"5641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Na use sikhaya jab wo jahil tha na use khilaya jab wo bhooka tha."
"5642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us par kiya hai agar wo us ki khaal se faida uthaye; Allah ne to us ka khana haram kiya hai."
"5643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par azl na karne mein harj nahi; kyunke Allah ne muqaddar kar diya hai jo wo qayamat ke din tak paida karne wala hai."
"5644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne koi amal nahi kiya jo us ke liye Allah ke azaab se nijaat-dahinda ho Allah ke zikr se zyada."
"5645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne namaz, aapas ki sulah aur husn-e-akhlaq se behtar kuch nahi kiya."
"5646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs ata ka darwaza sadqe ya silay se nahi kholta magar Allah taala us se us ke liye kasrat barhata hai; aur koi shakhs mangne ka darwaza nahi kholta jis se wo kasrat chahe magar Allah taala us se us ke liye kami barhata hai."
"5647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein koi darakht nahi magar us ka tana sone ka hai."
"5648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda khuloos se La ilaha illallah nahi kehta magar us ke liye aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain yahan tak ke Arsh tak pahunch jaye jab tak wo kabeera se bache."
"5649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi Nabi qabz nahi kiya magar us jagah jahan wo dafn hona pasand kare."
"5650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi jaan ke liye muqaddar nahi kiya ke use paida kare magar wo hone wali hai."
"5651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem mein jo muqaddar hua wo hone wala hai."
"5652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janwar mein se jo us ke zinda hote hue kaata jaye wo murdar hai."
"5653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo thora ho aur kafi ho wo us se behtar hai jo zyada ho aur ghaafil kare."
"5654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi jis cheez mein ho use khubsurat bana deti hai aur jis cheez se nikaal li jaye use badnuma bana deti hai."
"5655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fahhash-goi jis cheez mein bhi ho use badnuma bana deti hai aur haya jis cheez mein bhi ho use khubsurat bana deti hai."
"5656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat mein jo halaf tha use pakro; Islam mein halaf nahi."
"5657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meeras mein se jo jahiliyyat mein taqseem hui wo jahiliyyat ki taqseem par hai; aur meeras mein se jo Islam ne payi wo Islam ki taqseem par hai."
"5658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aam raaste aur jami basti mein ho use aik saal mashhoor karo; phir agar us ka talabgar aaye to use use de do; aur agar na aaye to wo tumhari hai. Aur jo veeran mein ho us mein aur dafeene mein panchwan hissa hai."
"5659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum na-pasand karo ke log tum se dekhein use tanha jab akele ho apne aap se na karo."
"5660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ne apne haath ke amal se zyada pakeeza kamayi nahi kamayi; aur aadmi ne apne aap, apne ghar walon, apne bete aur apne khadim par jo kharch kiya wo sadqa hai."
"5661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare paas kisi ka ehsan nahi magar ham ne us ka badla diya siwaye Abu Bakr ke; kyunke un ka hamare paas ehsan hai jis ka badla Allah unhein qayamat ke din dega. Aur mujhe kisi ke maal ne faida nahi diya jitna Abu Bakr ke maal ne faida diya. Aur agar main dost banata to Abu Bakr ko dost banata; khabardar, tumhare saathi Allah ke dost hain."
"5662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare is bachche ko kiya hua jo rota hai? Tum ne us ke liye nazar se dam kyun na karwaya?"
"5663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein aur buland majlison se kiya? Buland majlison se bacho. Khabardar, nahi to un ka haq ada karo: nazar jhukana, salam ka jawab dena, raasta dikhana aur achchi baat."
"5664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum par aag walon ka zewar kiya dikhta hai, yani lohe ki angoothi."
"5665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum kiya dikhte ho ke apne haath uthaye hue ho goya wo tez ghoron ki dumen hain? Namaz mein sukoon karo."
"5666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum kiya jamaaton mein dikhte ho?"
"5667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum ne taali bajana kyun zyada kiya? Jis ke paas us ki namaz mein kuch aaye wo tasbeeh kahe; kyunke jab wo tasbeeh kahe to us ki taraf mutawajjeh hota hai. Aur taali to auraton ke liye hai."
"5668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kiya! Main duniya mein aise hun jaise sawaar jo darakht ke neeche saya le phir chale aur use chhor de."
"5669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kiya aur duniya ko mujh se kiya! Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, meri aur duniya ki misaal aise sawaar jaisi hai jo garmi ke din chala aur din ki ghari darakht ke neeche saya liya phir chala aur use chhor diya."
"5670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahi mara magar wahin dafn kiya gaya jahan qabz kiya gaya."
"5671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main farishton ki kisi majlis par nahi guzra magar unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, apni ummat ko pachhne lagwane ka hukm do."
"5672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main farishton ki kisi majlis par nahi guzra magar wo sab mujh se kehte thay: Tum par pachhne lagwana lazim hai ae Muhammad."
"5673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne jis cheez ki surat badli us ki aulad ya nasal nahi hui."
"5674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne pait se bura bartan nahi bhara; Ibn Adam ke liye chand luqme kafi hain jo us ki peeth seedhi rakhein. Phir agar zaroori ho to teesra khane ke liye, teesra peene ke liye aur teesra saans ke liye."
"5675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi insaan nahi magar us ke sar mein lagam hai farishte ke haath mein; phir jab wo aajizi kare to farishte se kaha jata hai us ki lagam uthao; aur jab wo takabbur kare to farishte se kaha jata hai us ki lagam chhor do."
"5676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi apne maal ki zakaat ada nahi karta magar us ke liye qayamat ke din ganja saanp banaya jayega yahan tak ke us ki gardan ka tauq ban jaye."
"5677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qarz nahi leta jis se Allah janta hai ke wo use ada karna chahta hai magar Allah us ki taraf se use duniya mein ada karta hai."
"5678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi dua se dua nahi karta magar Allah use ata karta hai jo us ne manga ya us se us jaisi burayi rokta hai jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare."
"5679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi mujhe salam nahi kehta magar Allah meri rooh mujhe lauta deta hai yahan tak ke main use salam ka jawab dun."
"5680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein se chalis nahi jo momin ke liye bakhshish mangein magar Allah unhein us mein shafaat de."
"5681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein se koi Nabi nahi magar use nishaniyon mein se di gayin jin jaisi par insaan iman laye; aur jo mujhe di gayi wo wahi hai jo Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki; pas main ummeed rakhta hun ke qayamat ke din un mein sab se zyada pairwi wala hunga."
"5682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dilon mein se koi dil nahi magar us ke liye badal hai chand ke badal jaisa; jab chand roshan hota hai to us par badal chha jata hai aur andhera ho jata hai jab wo hat jata hai."
"5683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein se koi Musalman nahi jis ke teen faut hon jo bulooghat tak na pahunche hon magar Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega un par apni rehmat ke fazl se."
"5684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein se koi Musalman jaan nahi jise us ka Rab qabz kare jo pasand kare ke tumhari taraf wapas aaye agarche us ke liye duniya aur jo us mein hai ho siwaye shaheedon ke. Aur mera Allah ki raah mein qatl hona mujhe is se zyada mehboob hai ke mere liye oon aur mitti walon ke ghar hon."
"5685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi imam ya hakim nahi jo apna darwaza hajat-mand, tang-dast aur miskeen par band kare magar Allah aasman ke darwaze us ki tangi, hajat aur miskeeni par band karega."
"5686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jis par farz namaz hazir ho aur wo us ka wuzu, khushu aur ruku achcha kare magar wo us se pehle gunaahon ka kaffara hogi jab tak kabeera na ho; aur ye hamesha hai."
"5687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jo Musalman ki ayadat kare magar Allah sattar hazaar farishte bhejta hai jo us par durood bhejte hain din ki jis ghari mein ho shaam tak aur raat ki jis ghari mein ho subah tak."
"5688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne ghore ke liye jau saaf kare phir use us par latkaye magar Allah us ke liye har daane se neki likhta hai."
"5689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu achcha kare phir namaz parhe magar us ke liye us ke aur doosri namaz ke darmiyan bakhsh diya jata hai yahan tak ke use parhe."
"5690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo Musalman shakhs ko aisi jagah be-yaar-o-madadgar chhore jahan us ki izzat mein kami ho aur us ki hurmat tooti jaye magar Allah taala use aisi jagah be-yaar-o-madadgar chhorega jahan wo us ki madad pasand kare. Aur koi nahi jo Musalman ki aisi jagah madad kare jahan us ki izzat mein kami ho aur us ki hurmat tooti jaye magar Allah us ki aisi jagah madad karega jahan wo us ki madad pasand kare."
"5691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis ki raat mein namaz ho aur us par neend ghalib aa jaye magar Allah taala us ke liye us ki namaz ka ajr likhta hai aur us ki neend us par sadqa hoti hai."
"5692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi aurat nahi jo apne ghar ke siwa kapre utare magar us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan parda chaak ho jata hai."
"5693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ummat nahi magar us mein se baaz aag mein aur baaz jannat mein hai siwaye meri ummat ke; kyunke wo sab jannat mein hai."
"5694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ameer nahi magar us ke liye us ke ghar walon mein se do raaz-daan hain: aik raaz-daan jo use maroof ka hukm deta hai aur munkar se rokta hai aur aik raaz-daan jo use kharabi mein kotahi nahi karta. Pas jo us ke shar se bacha wo bacha liya gaya; aur wo un donon mein se jo us par ghalib ho us mein se hai."
"5695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das ka koi ameer nahi magar wo qayamat ke din jakra hua laya jayega yahan tak ke adl use khole ya zulm use halak kare."
"5696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Das ka koi ameer nahi magar wo qayamat ke din laya jayega halanke us ka haath us ki gardan se jakra hua hoga."
"5697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ameer nahi jo Musalmanon ke muamle ka zimmedar ho phir un ke liye koshish na kare aur khair-khwahi na kare magar un ke saath jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"5698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ghar walon par subah bail nahi aata magar wo zaleel hote hain."
"5699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi oont mein nahi magar us ki kohan mein shaitan hai; phir jab un par sawaar ho to Allah taala ki naimat yaad karo jo us ne tum par ki jaisa Allah ne tumhein hukm diya, phir unhein apne liye aadi banao; kyunke sawari to Allah taala deta hai."
"5700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Adam mein koi paida hone wala nahi magar use shaitan chhuta hai jab wo paida hota hai aur wo shaitan ke chhune se cheekhta hua roota hai siwaye Maryam aur un ke bete ke."
"5701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Basti ya sehra mein teen nahi jin mein namaz qayam na ki jaye magar shaitan un par ghalib aa jata hai; pas tum par jamaat lazim hai; kyunke bheriya alag ko khata hai."
"5702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi bahar nikalne wala apne ghar se ilm talash mein nahi nikalta magar farishte us ke liye apne par bichhate hain us se raazi hote hue jo wo karta hai yahan tak ke wapas aaye."
"5703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda jo dua kare us se behtar koi dua nahi: Ae Allah, main tujh se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat ka sawal karta hun."
"5704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi gunah nahi jo zyada laiq ho ke Allah taala us ke wale ke liye duniya mein saza jaldi kare us ke saath jo us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera kare zulm aur rehem torne se."
"5705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi gunah nahi jo zyada laiq ho ke Allah taala us ke wale ke liye duniya mein saza jaldi kare us ke saath jo us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera kare rehem torne, khayanat aur jhoot se. Aur beshak itaat mein sawab mein sab se jaldi rehem jorna hai yahan tak ke ghar wale badkaar hote hain aur un ke maal barhte hain aur un ki tadaad zyada hoti hai jab wo aapas mein milte hain."
"5706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi sawaar nahi jo apne safar mein Allah aur us ke zikr se tanha ho magar us ka peeche sawaar farishta hota hai; aur jo sher aur us jaisi se tanha ho us ka peeche sawaar shaitan hota hai."
"5707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis ke paas maal ho aur wo us ke maal ka haq ada na kare magar us ke liye us ki gardan mein tauq banaya jata hai jo ganja saanp hai; wo us se bhaagta hai aur wo us ka peecha karta hai."
"5708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jo mare aur us ke janaze par chalis mard khare hon jo Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karte hon magar Allah unhein us mein shafaat de."
"5709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman shakhs nahi jis ke apni aulad mein se teen mar jayen jo bulooghat tak na pahunche hon magar Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega un par apni rehmat ke fazl se."
"5710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo juma ke din paaki kare jaisa hukm diya gaya phir apne ghar se nikle yahan tak ke juma mein aaye aur khamosh rahe yahan tak ke us ki namaz poori ho jaye magar wo us se pehle juma ka kaffara hoga."
"5711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne aap mein barayi kare aur apne chalne mein itraye magar wo Allah taala se is haal mein milega ke wo us par ghusse mein hoga."
"5712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne jism mein zakhm khaye aur use sadqa kare magar Allah us se utna mita dega jitna us ne sadqa kiya."
"5713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo ilm yaad kare aur use chhupaye magar wo qayamat ke din aag ki lagam dala hua aayega."
"5714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo dua se dua kare magar us ke liye qabool ki jayegi; ya to us ke liye duniya mein jaldi ki jayegi ya us ke liye aakhirat mein zakheera ki jayegi،........ jab tak wo gunah ya rehem torne se dua na kare ya jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine apne Rab se dua ki aur us ne mujhe jawab nahi diya."
"5715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo raasta chale jis mein ilm talash kare magar Allah us ke liye jannat ka raasta aasan kare; aur jis ka amal use peeche kare us ka nasab use aage nahi barhayega."
"5716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jis par sau namaz parhein magar us ke liye bakhsh diya jayega."
"5717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo shaam ko beemar ki ayadat kare magar us ke saath sattar hazaar farishte nikalte hain jo us ke liye bakhshish mangte hain subah tak; aur jo subah us ke paas aaye us ke saath sattar hazaar farishte nikalte hain jo us ke liye bakhshish mangte hain shaam tak."
"5718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo das ya us se zyada ka zimmedar ho magar wo Allah ke paas aayega halanke us ka haath us ki gardan se jakra hua hoga; us ki neki use kholegi ya us ka gunah use jakrega. Us ka awwal malamat hai, darmiyan nadamat hai aur aakhir qayamat ke din ruswayi hai."
"5719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahi jo apne maal ki zakaat ada na kare magar Allah qayamat ke din us ki gardan mein ganja saanp banayega; aur jo apne Musalman bhai ka maal qasam se kaate wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo us par ghusse mein hoga."
"5720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi ghari nahi jo Ibn Adam par guzre jis mein wo Allah ka zikr na kare magar wo qayamat ke din us par hasrat karega."
"5721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein husn-e-akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahi."
"5722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi cheez nahi jo mujhe dikhayi na gayi ho magar maine use apne is muqaam mein dekha yahan tak ke jannat aur aag; aur meri taraf wahi ki gayi hai ke tum apni qabron mein aazmaye jaoge Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne jaisa ya us ke qareeb. Tum mein se har aik ke paas aaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Tumhara ilm is shakhs ke baare mein kiya hai? Raha momin ya yaqeen wala to kahega: Wo Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain jo hamare paas wazeh dalail aur hidayat lekar aaye; pas ham ne jawab diya, iman laye aur pairwi ki. Wo Muhammad hain, teen baar. To us se kaha jayega: Naik so; ham jaan chuke ke tum us par yaqeen rakhne wale thay. Aur raha munafiq ya shak wala to kahega: Main nahi janta; maine logon ko kuch kehte suna to maine kaha."
"5723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko koi cheez nahi pahunchti yahan tak ke kaanta jo use chubhe magar Allah us se us ke liye neki likhta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko us ke jism mein takleef dene wali koi cheez nahi pahunchti magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mita deta hai."
"5725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ko thakan, gham ya beemari mein se koi cheez nahi pahunchti yahan tak ke fikr jo use fikr ho magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mita deta hai."
"5726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein rakhi jane wali koi cheez husn-e-akhlaq se bhari nahi; aur husn-e-akhlaq wala us se roze aur namaz wale ka darja pa leta hai."
"5727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton, gaayon ya bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un ki zakaat ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se bari aur motee aaengi; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi. Jab bhi un ki pichhli guzar jayegi un ki agli us par wapas aayegi yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye."
"5728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi jo kabhi thin aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo us par apne pairon aur khuron se charhengi. Aur gaayon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne pairon se raundengi. Aur bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein un ka haq ada na kare magar wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada aaengi aur use chapte pathreelay maidan mein bithaya jayega; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi; un mein beghair seengon wali na hogi na toote seeng wali. Aur khazane ka koi maalik nahi jo us mein us ka haq ada na kare magar us ka khazana qayamat ke din ganja saanp ban kar aayega jo us ka peecha karega apna munh khole hue; phir jab wo us ke paas aayega to us se bhaagega aur us ka Rab azza wa jal use pukarega: Apna khazana lo jo tum ne chhupaya tha; kyunke main tum se ghani hun. Phir jab wo dekhega ke use us se bachna nahi to apna haath us ke munh mein dalega aur wo use oont ki tarah kaatega."
"5729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sone ya chandi ka koi maalik nahi jo us mein se us ka haq ada na kare magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to us ke liye aag ki chadarein bichhayi jayengi aur unhein jahannam ki aag mein garam kiya jayega; phir us se us ka pehlu, peshani aur peeth daaghi jayegi. Jab bhi thandi hongi us ke liye wapas layi jayengi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf. Aur oonton ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein se un ka haq ada na kare, aur un ke haq mein se un ka doodh dohana hai jis din wo pani par aayen, magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to use chapte pathreelay maidan mein litaya jayega sab se zyada halat mein jo kabhi thin; us mein se aik bachcha bhi kam nahi hoga; wo use apne khuron se raundengi aur apne munhon se kaatengi. Jab bhi us par un ki agli guzar jayegi un ki pichhli us par wapas aayegi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf. Aur gaayon ya bakriyon ka koi maalik nahi jo un mein se un ka haq ada na kare magar jab qayamat ka din hoga to use chapte pathreelay maidan mein litaya jayega; us mein se kuch kam nahi hoga; un mein mure hue seeng wali na hogi na beghair seengon wali na kati hui; wo use apne seengon se marengi aur apne khuron se raundengi. Jab bhi us par un ki agli guzar jayegi un ki pichhli us par wapas aayegi, aise din mein jis ki miqdar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye; phir wo apna raasta dekhega ya jannat ki taraf ya aag ki taraf."
"5730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi farz namaz nahi magar us se pehle do rakatein hain."
"5731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi saal nahi magar jo us ke baad hai us se bura hai yahan tak ke apne Rab se milo."
"5732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi magar us ke liye aasman mein shohrat hai; phir agar us ki shohrat aasman mein achchi ho to zameen mein rakhi jati hai; aur agar us ki shohrat aasman mein buri ho to zameen mein rakhi jati hai."
"5733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo kahe La ilaha illallah phir us par mare magar wo jannat mein dakhil hoga agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho, agarche Abu Zarr ki naak mitti-aalood ho."
"5734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jis ki apne qarz ada karne mein niyyat ho magar us ke liye Allah ki taraf se madad hai."
"5735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi momin banda nahi magar us ke liye gunah hai jo wo waqfe waqfe se karta hai ya gunah hai jis par wo qayam hai aur use nahi chhorta yahan tak ke duniya se juda ho jaye. Beshak momin aazmaish wala, tauba karne wala, bhoolne wala paida kiya gaya hai; jab yaad dilaya jaye to yaad kare."
"5736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman banda nahi jo wuzu kare aur wuzu mukammal kare phir Allah ke liye har din baarah rakatein nafl parhe farz ke siwa magar Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banayega."
"5737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman banda nahi jo apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua kare magar farishta kehta hai: Aur tumhare liye us jaisa."
"5738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo gunah kare aur wuzu kare aur paaki achchi kare phir khara ho aur do rakatein parhe phir us gunah se Allah se bakhshish mange magar Allah use bakhsh dega."
"5739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo apne haath uthaye........ Allah se sawal mange magar wo use ata karega jab tak wo jaldi na kare ke kahe: Maine manga aur manga aur mujhe kuch nahi diya gaya."
"5740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jise Allah rewar supurd kare aur wo us din mare jab mare halanke wo apne rewar se dhoka karne wala ho magar Allah ne us par jannat haram ki."
"5741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo Allah ko sajda kare magar Allah us se us ka darja buland karta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo Allah ko sajda kare magar Allah us ke liye us se neki likhta hai, us se us ki burayi mitata hai aur us ke liye us se darja buland karta hai. Pas sajde kasrat se karo."
"5743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo beemari se girne se gire magar Allah use us se paak uthaega."
"5744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo mujh par durood bheje magar farishte us par durood bhejte hain jab tak wo mujh par durood bheje; pas banda us mein se kam kahe ya zyada."
"5745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi banda nahi jo har din ki subah aur har raat ki shaam mein teen baar kahe: Allah ke naam se jis ke naam ke saath zameen mein na aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahi deti aur wo sunne wala jaanne wala hai, aur use koi cheez nuqsan pahunchaegi."
"5746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi lashkar nahi jo Allah ki raah mein jihad kare aur ghanimat paye magar wo aakhirat mein se apne ajr ka do-tehayi jaldi lete hain aur un ke liye teesra baaqi rehta hai. Phir agar wo ghanimat na payen to un ka ajr un ke liye poora hota hai."
"5747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi dil nahi magar wo Rehman ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan latka hua hai; agar chahe use qayam rakhe aur agar chahe use tehra kar de. Aur meezan Rehman ke haath mein hai; wo qaumon ko buland karta hai aur doosron ko past karta hai qayamat ke din tak."
"5748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jo Allah ka zikr karti hai magar farishte unhein gher lete hain, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, un par sukoon utarta hai aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo us ke paas hain."
"5749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jin mein gunaahon par amal ho, wo us ke karne wale se zyada izzat wale aur zyada hon, phir wo use na badlein magar Allah taala unhein us se saza mein aam karega."
"5750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahi jo majlis se khari ho jis mein wo Allah taala ka zikr nahi karti magar wo gadhe ke murdar jaisi se khari hui; aur wo majlis un par qayamat ke din hasrat hogi."
"5751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har pani se bachcha nahi hota; aur jab Allah kisi cheez ko paida karna chahe to use koi cheez nahi rokti."
"5752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi momin nahi magar main duniya aur aakhirat mein us ka zyada haqdar hun. Parho agar chaho: Nabi mominon par un ki jaanon se zyada haq rakhte hain. Phir jo momin mare aur maal chhore to us ke asba us ke waris hon jo bhi hon; aur jo qarz ya be-yaar-o-madadgar chhore wo mere paas aaye; kyunke main us ka maula hun."
"5753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi zakhmi nahi jo Allah ki raah mein zakhmi ho, aur Allah zyada jaanne wala hai jo us ki raah mein zakhmi ho, magar wo qayamat ke din aayega halanke us ka zakhm us ki halat mein hoga jis din zakhmi hua tha: rang khoon ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu."
"5754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo zikr par paak raat guzare aur raat ko ghabra kar uthe aur Allah taala se duniya aur aakhirat ke muamle mein bhalayi mange magar wo use ata karega."
"5755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo paaki kare aur paaki mukammal kare jo Allah ne us par likhi hai aur ye paanch namazein parhe magar wo un ke darmiyan ka kaffara hongi."
"5756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo wuzu kare aur apna wuzu achcha kare phir khara ho aur do rakatein parhe aur un par apne dil aur chehre se mutawajjeh ho magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"5757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo kheti kare ya paudha lagaye aur us mein se parinda, insaan ya janwar khaye magar us se us ke liye sadqa hoga."
"5758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise kaanta chubhe ya us se zyada magar us se us ke liye darja likha jayega aur us se us ki khata mitayi jayegi."
"5759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis ke liye teen gawahi dein magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi. Kaha gaya: Aur do? Farmaya: Aur do."
"5760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo Islam mein safed baal safed kare magar Allah us se us ke liye neki likhta hai aur us se us ki khata mitata hai."
"5761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo apne jism mein museebat paye magar Allah taala muhafizon ko hukm deta hai: Mere bande ke liye har din aur raat mein bhalayi mein se likho jo wo karta tha jab tak wo meri qaid mein roka hua hai."
"5762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis par ummat namaz parhe magar wo us mein shafaat karenge."
"5763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise takleef pahunche, kaanta ya us se zyada, magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mitata hai jaise darakht apne patte girata hai."
"5764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jise museebat pahunche aur wo kahe jo Allah ne use hukm diya: Beshak ham Allah ke liye hain aur beshak ham usi ki taraf wapas jane wale hain. Ae Allah, mujhe meri museebat mein ajr de aur mujhe us se behtar badla de, magar Allah use us ki museebat mein ajr dega aur Allah use us se behtar badla dega."
"5765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jis par zulm ho aur wo lade aur qatl ho magar wo shaheed qatl hua."
"5766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo beemar ki ayadat kare jis ki maut hazir na hui ho aur saat baar kahe: Main Allah Azeem se, Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab se sawal karta hun ke tumhein shifa de, magar use aafiyat di jayegi."
"5767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo subah Musalman ki ayadat kare magar us par sattar hazaar farishte durood bhejte hain shaam tak; aur agar shaam ko ayadat kare to us par sattar hazaar farishte durood bhejte hain subah tak; aur us ke liye jannat mein bagh hoga."
"5768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahi jo paudha lagaye magar jo us mein se khaya jaye wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; jo us mein se churaya jaye sadqa hoga; jo darinda khaye wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; jo parinde khayen wo us ke liye sadqa hoga; aur use koi kami nahi karta jo us ke liye sadqa ho."
"5769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman kisi Musalman ko do martaba qarz de to wo us ke liye aik martaba sadqa karne ki tarah hai."
"5770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman talbiya kahe to us ke daayein aur baayein ke patthar, darakht aur mitti bhi talbiya kahte hain, yahan tak ke zameen idhar se udhar tak khatm ho jati hai."
"5771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman faut ho jaye aur us ke janaze par chaalis aadmi khade hon jo Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik nahi thehrate to un ki shafaat qubool ki jati hai."
"5772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman ke teen bachche faut ho jayen jab tak wo gunah ki hadd ko na pahunchen, to jannat ke aath darwaze us ka istiqbal karte hain, jis se chahe dakhil ho jaye."
"5773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman Jumma ke din ya Jumma ki raat ko faut ho jaye, Allah taala use qabr ke fitne se bacha leta hai."
"5774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalman Allah ki raah mein apne maal mein se do jodi kharch kare, to jannat ke nigehban us ka istiqbal karte hain, aur sab us ko apne paas bulate hain."
"5775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do Musalman apni talwaron ke saath milen to qatil aur maqtool donon dozakh mein hain."
"5776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin do Musalmanon ke teen bachche baligh hone se pehle faut ho jayen, Allah taala unhein apni rehmat ke fazl se jannat mein dakhil kar deta hai."
"5777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do Musalman milen aur musafaha karen to juda hone se pehle un ki maghfirat kar di jati hai."
"5778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do Musalman milen, ek doosre ko salaam kare aur apna haath pakade, aur wo haath sirf Allah ke liye pakadta hai, to wo juda nahi hote yahan tak ke un ki maghfirat kar di jaye."
"5779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin do Musalmanon ke darmiyan teen bachche baligh hone se pehle faut ho jayen un ki maghfirat kar di jati hai."
"5780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin do Musalmanon ke teen bachche baligh hone se pehle faut ho jayen, Allah taala un ki rehmat ke fazl se unhein jannat mein dakhil karta hai. Un se kaha jayega: Jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Wo kahenge: Yahan tak ke hamare walidain bhi dakhil hon. Phir kaha jayega: Tum aur tumhare walidain jannat mein dakhil ho jao."
"5781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin do Musalmanon ke teen bachche baligh hone se pehle faut ho jayen to Allah taala apni rehmat ke fazl se un donon ko jannat mein dakhil kar deta hai."
"5782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ko jo bhi museebat pahunche Allah us ke badle us ke gunah maaf kar deta hai, yahan tak ke kaanta jo usay chube."
"5783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein zakhmi kiya gaya, wo qayamat ke din aayega aur us ka zakhm khoon baahta hoga; us ka rang khoon ka rang aur us ki khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi."
"5784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har bachcha fitrat par paida hota hai; phir us ke maa-baap use yahudi ya nasrani ya majusi banate hain, jaise janwar poora janwar paida karta hai. Kya tum un mein kaan kati hui koi cheez dekhte ho?"
"5785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi bachcha paida nahi hota magar Shaitan use chubhta hai aur wo Shaitan ke chubhne se cheekh kar rota hai, siwaye Maryam ke bete aur un ki maa ke."
"5786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat par Musalmanon ki ek jamaat namaz padhe jo so ke barabar pahunche aur us ke liye shafaat kare to un ki shafaat qubool ki jati hai."
"5787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat par logon ki ek jamaat namaz-e-janaza padhe to wo us ke liye shafaat karne wale hote hain."
"5788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat mare aur us ka rone wala khada ho kar kahe: Haay mere pahar, haay meri sanad, ya is tarah ki baat, to us par do farishte muqarrar kiye jate hain jo use hila kar kahte hain: Kya tu aisa hi tha?!"
"5789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi nabi aisa nahi jis ne apni ummat ko ek aankh wale jhoothe masih dajjal se dara na diya ho. Sun lo, wo ek aankh wala hai aur tumhara Rab ek aankh wala nahi; us ki peshani ke darmiyan likha hua hai."
"5790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi nabi aisa nahi jise Allah ne mujh se pehle kisi ummat mein bheja ho aur us ki ummat mein us ke hawari aur sahaba na hon jo us ki sunnat ko pakadte aur us ke amr ki pabandi karte; phir un ke baad aise khalaf aate hain jo kahte hain jo karte nahi aur karte hain jo unhein hukum nahi diya jata. Pas jo un se apne haath se jihad kare wo momin hai, jo un se apni zaban se jihad kare wo momin hai, aur jo un se apne dil se jihad kare wo momin hai; is ke aage iman mein raai ke daane ke barabar bhi kuch nahi."
"5791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi nabi bimari mein mubtala nahi hota magar use duniya aur aakhirat ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya jata hai."
"5792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi jaan aisi nahi jis ke paas Allah ke yahan koi khair ho aur wo duniya ki taraf lautna pasand kare, agarche us ke paas duniya aur us mein jo kuch hai ho, siwaye shaheed ke; kyunke wo shahadat ke fazl ko dekh kar dobara duniya mein laut kar qatl hone ki tamanna karta hai."
"5793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi jaan aisi nahi jo is haal mein marti hai ke wo gawahi deti ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun, aur ye baat yaqeen rakhne wale dil tak pahunche, magar Allah us ki maghfirat kar deta hai."
"5794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi jaan paida nahi hoti magar Allah ne us ka thikana jannat aur dozakh likh diya hai, aur us ne badnaseeb ya khushnaseeb likha hai. Arz kiya gaya: Phir kiya hum bharosa kar len? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, amal karo aur bharosa mat karo; har ek ke liye wohi aasan kiya gaya hai jis ke liye use paida kiya gaya. Pas khushnaseeb logon ke liye khushnaseebi ke amal aasan kiye jate hain aur badnaseeb logon ke liye badnaseebi ke amal aasan kiye jate hain."
"5795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj ki paida shuda koi jaan aisi nahi jis par so saal guzar jayen aur wo us waqt zinda ho."
"5796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi din aisa nahi jis mein Allah jahannam se itne bande ya bandiyan azad kare jitne arfa ke din azad karta hai; aur beshak wo qareeb hota hai, phir farishton ke saamne un par fakhr karta hai aur farmata hai: Ye log kya chahte hain?"
"5797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi din aisa nahi jis ki subah bande karte hon aur do farishte na utren; un mein se ek kahta hai: Ae Allah, kharch karne wale ko badla de; aur doosra kahta hai: Ae Allah, rokne wale ko tabahi de."
"5798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi aisa nahi jis se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam na karega, us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi tarjuman nahi hoga. Phir wo apne daayein dekhega to apne amal ke siwa kuch nahi dekhega, apne baayein dekhega to apne amal ke siwa kuch nahi dekhega, aur apne saamne dekhega to aag ke siwa kuch nahi dekhega. Pas aag se bacho agarche khajoor ka tukra ho, aur agarche achhi baat ho."
"5799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ke do thikane hain: ek jannat mein aur ek dozakh mein. Pas jab wo mar jaye aur dozakh mein dakhil ho jaye to jannat wale us ka thikana ikhtiyar kar lete hain; yahi Allah ke qaul ka matlab hai: Wo hi waris hone wale hain."
"5800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ke saath jinnat mein se uska hamsafar muqarrar kiya gaya hai aur farishton mein se bhi uska hamsafar hai. Sahaba ne arz kiya: Aap ke saath bhi? Aap ne farmaya: Mere saath bhi, magar Allah ne us par meri madad ki hai is liye wo Islam le aaya, pas wo mujhe sirf bhalai ka hukum deta hai."
"5801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek ke saath ek shaitan hai. Sahaba ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, aap ke saath bhi? Aap ne farmaya: Mere saath bhi, magar Allah ne us par meri madad ki hai is liye wo Islam le aaya."
"5802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo bhi wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare, phir khada ho kar do rakaat padhe aur un mein apne dil aur chehre se Allah ki taraf mutawajjeh rahe, to us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi aur us ki maghfirat kar di gayi."
"5803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo wuzu kare aur wuzu poora kare, phir wuzu se farigh ho kar kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, us ka koi sharik nahi, aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain, to us ke liye jannat ke aath darwaze khol diye jate hain, jis se chahe dakhil ho."
"5804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi aadmi apna wuzu ka pani qareeb karta hai, phir kulla karta hai aur thook deta hai, aur naak mein pani charhata hai aur jhata hai, magar us ke chehre, munh aur naak ke gunah beh jate hain; phir jab wo apna chehra Allah ke hukum ke mutabiq dhota hai to us ke chehre ke gunah us ki darhi ke kinaron se pani ke saath beh jate hain; phir apne haath kohniyon tak dhota hai to us ke haathon ke gunah ungliyon ke kinaron se pani ke saath beh jate hain; phir apna sar Allah ke hukum ke mutabiq masah karta hai to us ke sar ke gunah baalon ke kinaron se pani ke saath beh jate hain; phir apne paon takhnon tak Allah ke hukum ke mutabiq dhota hai to us ke paon ke gunah ungliyon ke kinaron se pani ke saath beh jate hain. Phir agar wo khada ho kar namaz padhe, Allah ki hamd aur sana kare aur us ki aisi tareef kare jo us ki shaan ke laayeq ho, aur apna dil Allah ke liye khaali kar de, to wo apne gunahon se aise saaf ho kar lautta hai jaise us din ki haalat mein tha jab us ki maa ne use jana tha."
"5805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi aurat aisi nahi jo apne aage teen bachche bheje magar wo us ke liye aag se parda ban jate hain. Ek aurat ne kaha: Aur do? Aap ne farmaya: Aur do."
"5806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae mere baap, jab main ne tumhein bulaya to tum ne mujhe jawab kyun nahi diya? Kya tum ne Allah ki is wahy mein nahi paya: Ae iman walo, Allah aur Rasool ki pukar ka jawab do jab wo tumhein us cheez ki taraf bulayen jo tumhein zindagi deti hai?"
"5807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zakaat rokne wala qayamat ke din aag mein hoga."
"5808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe kisi maal ne itna faida nahi pahunchaya jitna Abu Bakr ke maal ne pahunchaya."
"5809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa maal ko kam nahi karta; Allah bande ko maaf karne ke badle izzat hi badhata hai; aur jo Allah ke liye aajizi ikhtiyar kare Allah use buland karta hai."
"5810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis cheez se main ne tumhein mana kiya hai us se bacho, aur jis cheez ka hukum diya hai us mein se jitna tum kar sako karo; kyunke tum se pehle logon ko isi baat ne halak kiya ke wo bahut sawal karte the aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf karte the."
"5811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae khane ke maalik, ye kya hai?! Tum ne ise khane ke upar kyun nahi rakha taake log ise dekh len? Jo dhoka de wo mujh se nahi."
"5812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni namaz mein imam se pehle sar uthta hai, kya wo is baat se mehfooz hai ke Allah us ki soorat gadhe ki soorat mein badal de?!"
"5813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed ko maut ke zarb ka jo dard hota hai wo itna hi hai jitna tum mein se kisi ko chutki kane ka dard hota hai."
"5814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi jab kuch sadqa karta hai to wo saat sau shaitanon ke donon jabde khol deta hai."
"5815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman mard aur aurat par museebat aati rehti hai, us ki jaan, us ki aulad aur us ke maal mein, yahan tak ke wo Allah se milta hai aur us par koi gunah nahi hota."
"5816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi logon se sawal karta rehta hai yahan tak ke qayamat ke din aayega aur us ke chehre par gosht ka tukra bhi nahi hoga."
"5817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ye khushi nahi deta ke mere paas Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur teesra din aaye aur us mein se ek dinar bhi baqi ho, siwaye us dinar ke jo main apne qarz ke liye rakhun."
"5818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ko jo bhi takleef, bimari, gham, udasi, aziyat aur fikr pahunche, yahan tak ke kaanta chube, Allah us ke badle us ke gunah maaf kar deta hai."
"5819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas jo bhi khair ho main use tum se nahi rokunga; beshak jo iffat talab kare Allah use iffat deta hai, jo maldar banne ki koshish kare Allah use maldar karta hai, aur jo sabr kare Allah use sabr deta hai; aur kisi ko sabr se behtar aur zyada wusat wala ataa nahi kiya gaya."
"5820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhein kya cheez rok rahi hai ke tum suno jo main tumhein wasiyat karta hun? Ke tum subah aur shaam ko kaho: Ae zinda, ae qaim rehne wale, main teri rehmat ke waseele se madad maangta hun, mere tamam maamlat durust farma aur mujhe pal bhar ke liye bhi mere nafs ke hawale na kar."
"5821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi nabi ko ye zeba nahi ke kahe: Main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun."
"5822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Jameel ne is ke siwa koi bura kaam nahi kiya ke wo ghareeb tha aur Allah ne use maldar kar diya; aur Khalid ke baare mein tum log Khalid par zulm karte ho, us ne apni zirein aur hathiyar Allah ki raah mein waqf kar diye hain; aur Abbas ke baare mein, wo mujh par hai aur us ke saath utni hi aur. Ae Umar, kya tumhein maloom nahi ke aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ke barabar hota hai?"
"5823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ko nafqa do, kyunke nafqa to dena hi hai agarche khajoor ka aadha sa ho."
"5824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ko nafqa do agarche ek sa ho."
"5825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ki misal ye hai ke us ke paas ninyaanve mauten hain; agar mauten us se chook jayen to wo burhape mein padega yahan tak ke mar jaye."
"5826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukheel aur sadaqa karne wale ki misal do aadmiyon ki tarah hai jin par lohe ke do jubbe hain, un ke seene se un ke galon tak. Pas kharch karne wala jab bhi kuch kharch karta hai to wo us ke jism par khinch kar lamba hota hai yahan tak ke us ki ungliyan chhupa deta hai aur us ke nishan mit jate hain; aur bukheel jab kuch kharch karna nahi chahta to har kadi apni jagah chipak jati hai, wo use kushada karna chahta hai magar wo kushada nahi hoti."
"5827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ghar mein Allah ka zikr kiya jata hai aur jis ghar mein Allah ka zikr nahi kiya jata, un ki misal zinda aur murda ki tarah hai."
"5828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achhe hamsafar ki misal attar ki tarah hai; agar wo tumhein apni khushbu se na de to us ki mehak tumhein pahunch jati hai."
"5829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achhe aur bure hamsafar ki misal mushk wale aur lohar ki bhatti ki tarah hai; mushk wale se tum kabhi khali nahi rehte: ya to tum us se khareed lo ya us ki khushbu pa lo; aur lohar ki bhatti tumhara ghar ya kapra jala de ya tum use badbu pa lo."
"5830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazon ki misal us nadi ki tarah hai jo tum mein se kisi ke darwaze par meetha aur bahta hua ho, jis mein wo har din paanch martaba nahata ho; to kya ye us ki mail ko baqi chhodti hai?"
"5831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aalim jo logon ko bhalai sikhaata hai aur khud ko bhool jata hai, us chiragh ki tarah hai jo logon ko roshni deta hai aur khud ko jala deta hai."
"5832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki haddon par qaim rehne wale aur un mein narmi karne wale ki misal un logon ki tarah hai jo samundar mein ek kashti par qurra daal kar sawar hue; un mein se kuch log us ke oopri hisse mein aur kuch neeche ke hisse mein utar gaye. Pas neeche wale jab pani lene jate to oopar walon ke paas se guzarte, to oopar walon ne kaha: Hum tumhein oopar nahi aane denge ke tum humein takleef do. Neeche walon ne kaha: Agar hum apne hisse mein ek sorakh kar len to hum oopar walon ko takleef na den. Pas agar wo unhein un ki marzi par chhod den to sab halak ho jayen, aur agar wo un ke haath pakad len to wo bach jayen aur sab bach jayen."
"5833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dil paron ki tarah hai jise hawaon se maidanon mein palat deti hain."
"5834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sadqa karta hai phir apne sadqe ko wapas le leta hai us ki misal us kutte ki tarah hai jo ulti karta hai phir apni ulti ko wapas kha jata hai."
"5835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm seekhta hai phir us se bayan nahi karta, us ki misal us khazane ki tarah hai jo khazana jama karta hai aur us mein se kharch nahi karta."
"5836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna diya hua wapas le leta hai us ki misal kutte ki tarah hai jo ulti karta hai phir apni ulti khata hai; pas jab dene wala wapas le to use rok diya jaye aur bataya jaye ke us ne kya wapas liya, phir jo us ne diya tha wo wapas kar diya jaye."
"5837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aalim jo logon ko bhalai sikhaata hai aur khud ko bhool jata hai, us batti ki tarah hai jo logon ko roshni deti hai aur khud ko jala deti hai."
"5838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni qaum ki na-haq madad karta hai us ki misal us oont ki tarah hai jo kuen mein gir gaya ho aur apni dum ke bal kheencha ja raha ho."
"5839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us momin ki misal jo Quran padhta hai utraj ki tarah hai, jis ki khushbu achhi aur maza achha; momin jo Quran nahi padhta us ki misal khajoor ki tarah hai, maza achha magar khushbu nahi; fajir jo Quran padhta hai us ki misal rehan ki tarah hai, khushbu achhi magar maza kara; fajir jo Quran nahi padhta us ki misal indrayan ki tarah hai, maza kara aur khushbu nahi; achhe hamsafar ki misal mushk wale ki tarah hai, agar us ki kuch bhi tumhein na mile to us ki khushbu pahunch jati hai; aur bure hamsafar ki misal bhatti wale ki tarah hai, agar us ki kali siyahi tumhein na pahunche to us ka dhuan pahunch jata hai."
"5840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us momin ki misal jo Quran padhta hai utraj ki tarah hai, jis ki khushbu achhi aur maza achha; momin jo Quran nahi padhta us ki misal khajoor ki tarah hai, khushbu nahi magar maza meetha; munafiq jo Quran padhta hai us ki misal rehan ki tarah hai, khushbu achhi magar maza kara; munafiq jo Quran nahi padhta us ki misal indrayan ki tarah hai, khushbu nahi aur maza kara."
"5841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal khet ki narm booti ki tarah hai jise hawa kabhi jhuka deti hai aur kabhi seedha kar deti hai; aur munafiq ki misal deodar ke darakht ki tarah hai jo hamesha qaim rehta hai yahan tak ke ek martaba sookh kar gir jata hai."
"5842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal khet ki tarah hai, hawa use jhukati rehti hai aur momin par museebat aati rehti hai; munafiq ki misal deodar ke darakht ki tarah hai jo hilta nahi yahan tak ke ek dum kat jata hai."
"5843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal khet ki narm booti ki tarah hai, jis taraf se hawa aati hai use jhuka deti hai, phir jab hawa rukti hai to wo seedhi ho jati hai; isi tarah momin museebat se jhukta hai. Aur fajir deodar ki tarah hai, sakht aur seedha, yahan tak ke Allah taala jab chahe use kaat deta hai."
"5844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal bali ki tarah hai jo kabhi seedhi hoti hai aur kabhi gir jati hai; aur kafir ki misal deodar ki tarah hai jo hamesha seedha rehta hai yahan tak ke gir jata hai aur use khabar bhi nahi hoti."
"5845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal bali ki tarah hai jo kabhi jhukti hai aur kabhi seedhi hoti hai."
"5846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal shehad ki makkhi ki tarah hai: agar khaye to paak khaye, agar daal de to paak daale, aur agar kisi gili lakdi par baithe to use na tode; aur momin ki misal sone ki salakh ki tarah hai; agar us par phoonk maro to surkh ho jati hai aur agar tolo to us mein kami nahi hoti."
"5847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal shehad ki makkhi ki tarah hai jo paak ke siwa kuch khati nahi aur paak ke siwa kuch nahi daalti."
"5848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misal khajoor ke darakht ki tarah hai; us mein se jo cheez bhi lo tumhein nafa pahunchati hai."
"5849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momino ki misal un ki muhabbat, rehmat aur hamdardi mein jism ki tarah hai; jab us ka koi uzv dard karta hai to poora jism bhi jaag kar aur bukhar mein us ki pukar karta hai."
"5850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein jihada karne wale ki misal, aur Allah behtar janta hai kaun us ki raah mein jihad karta hai, roza rakhne wale, raat bhar khade rahne wale, Allah ke aage jhukne wale, ruku karne wale aur sajda karne wale ki tarah hai."
"5851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein mujahid ki misal, aur Allah behtar janta hai kaun us ki raah mein jihad karta hai, us roza rakhne wale aur raat bhar khade rahne wale ki tarah hai jo na roze se thakta hai na sadqe se, yahan tak ke wo wapas aaye; aur Allah taala ne us ki raah ke mujahid ke liye ye zimma liya hai ke agar use wafat de to use jannat mein dakhil kare, ya use ajr ya ghanimat ke saath salaamat wapas laaye."
"5852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon, yahudiyon aur nasraniyon ki misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne kuch logon ko shaam tak kaam karne par mazdoor rakha; unhon ne dopahar tak kaam kiya, phir kaha: Hum tumhari us ujrat ki zaroorat nahi jo tum ne humare liye muqarrar ki aur jo kaam hum ne tumhare liye kiya, wo chhodte hain. Us ne un se kaha: Aisa na karo, apna baqi kaam poora karo aur apni poori ujrat lo. Unhon ne inkar kiya aur use chhod diya. Phir us ne un ke baad doosre mazdoor rakhe aur kaha: Apne din ka baqi hissa kaam karo aur tumhein wohi ujrat milegi jo main ne un ke liye muqarrar ki thi. Unhon ne kaam kiya yahan tak ke asr ki namaz ka waqt aaya to unhon ne kaha: Jo kaam hum ne kiya wo tumhara aur jo ujrat tum ne humare liye muqarrar ki wo bhi tumhari, hum chhodte hain. Us ne kaha: Apna baqi kaam poora karo, kyunke din mein thoda sa hi baqi hai. Unhon ne inkar kiya. Phir us ne kuch logon ko rakha jo us ke din ke baqi hisse mein kaam karen; unhon ne apne din ka baqi hissa kaam kiya yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho gaya aur unhon ne donon giroh ki poori ujrat pa li. Yahi un ki misal hai aur us noor ki misal hai jo unhon ne qubool kiya."
"5853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misal us bakri ki tarah hai jo do rewarhon ke darmiyan idhar udhar bhaagi phirti hai; kabhi is taraf jati hai kabhi us taraf, use maloom nahi ke kis ki pairwi kare."
"5854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki misal barish ki tarah hai, maloom nahi us ka awwal behtar hai ya aakhir."
"5855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne jo hidayat aur ilm de kar mujhe bheja hai us ki misal bohat barish ki tarah hai jo zameen par barasti hai; us mein se kuch zameen saaf hoti hai jo pani qubool kar leti hai aur bahut ghaas aur chara ugaati hai; us mein se kuch sakht zameen hoti hai jo pani rok leti hai, phir Allah us se logon ko nafa deta hai, wo us se peete, sairab karte aur jaanwar chhate hain; aur us ka ek hissa aisi zameen par bhi barsata hai jo chapti hai, na pani rok sakti hai na ghaas uga sakti hai. Yahi us ki misal hai jo Allah ke deen mein samajh rakhta hai aur Allah ne jo mujhe de kar bheja hai us se use nafa pahunchta hai, wo khud seekhta hai aur doosron ko sikhaata hai; aur us ki misal jo is par sar hi nahi uthata aur Allah ki us hidayat ko qubool nahi karta jo main le kar aaya hun."
"5856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisi ke saamne oont ki kathi ka pichhla hissa sutra ki tarah ho to us ke saamne se guzarne wala usay koi nuqsan nahi pahunchata."
"5857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabiyon ke darmiyan meri misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne ghar banaya, use achha, mukammal aur khoobsurat banaya aur us mein ek eent ki jagah chhod di jo us ne nahi rakhi; log us imarat ke ird gird phirne lage aur us par hairat karne lage aur kahene lage: Kaash ye eent ki jagah poori ho jati. Pas nabiyon mein main us eent ki jagah hun."
"5858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri aur tumhari misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne aag jalaayi; jab us ne us ke aas paas roshni ki to patange aur ye janwar jo aag mein girte hain girne lage, aur wo unhein rokte raha magar wo us par ghalib aaye aur us mein girte gaye. Yahi meri aur tumhari misal hai: Main tumhein aag se rokta hun, ke aao aag se door ho jao, magar tum mujh par ghalib aate ho aur us mein girte ho."
"5859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri aur tumhari misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne aag jalaayi to patange aur tiddiyan us mein girne lagin aur wo unhein us se hata raha tha; aur main tumhein aag se rokta hun magar tum mere haath se nikal jate ho."
"5860","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri misal aur us cheez ki misal jo Allah ne mujhe de kar bheja hai us aadmi ki tarah hai jo kisi qaum ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae meri qaum, main ne apni aankhon se lashkar dekha hai aur main nanga daraane wala hun, pas bhaag jao, bhaag jao. Us ki qaum ke ek giroh ne us ki baat maani aur raat ke andhere mein aahista aahista nikal gaye aur bach gaye; aur un mein se ek giroh ne us ki takzib ki, wo apni jagah par hi rahe, subah hote hi lashkar ne un par hamla kiya aur unhein halak kar diya aur jarh se uda diya. Yahi us ki misal hai jo meri baat maane aur us ki pairwi kare jo main le kar aaya, aur us ki misal jo meri nafarmani kare aur us haq ko jhutlaye jo main le kar aaya."
"5861","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab ka aadi but parast ki tarah hai."
"5862","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni behen ko hukum do ke sawar ho jaye..... beshak Allah apni behen ke apne nafs ko azab dene se be-niyaz hai."
"5863","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ek aadmi ko raaste par pade darakht ki ek tehni mili to us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main ise Musalmanon se hata dunga taake ye unhein takleef na de; pas use jannat mein dakhil kar diya gaya."
"5864","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Isra ki raat main mala-e-ala ke paas se guzra aur Jibreel Allah taala ke khauf se purani poshaak ki tarah the."
"5865","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Isra ki raat main Musa alaihis-salam ke paas se guzra, wo apni qabr mein khade namaz padh rahe the."
"5866","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukum do ke wo logon ko namaz padhayen."
"5867","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachche ko namaz ka hukum do jab wo saat saal ka ho jaye, aur jab das saal ka ho jaye to us par namaz ke liye maaro."
"5868","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bachchon ko saat saal ke hote hi namaz ka hukum do, aur das saal ke hote hi namaz ke liye unhein maaro, aur sone ke bistar alag kar do........ ..."
"5869","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se kaho ke wo baat kare, chhaon mein baith jaye aur apna roza poora kare."
"5870","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se kaho, agar us mein koi khair hogi to wo khud kar degi; aur apni biwi ko apni laundi ki tarah mat maaro."
"5871","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maldar ka sawal qayamat ke din us ke chehre par daagh hai."
"5872","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaram paane wala aur jis se aaram paya jaye: momin banda duniya ki thakan aur takleef se Allah taala ki rehmat ki taraf aaram pata hai; aur fajir bande se bande, mulk, darakht aur janwar aaram paate hain."
"5873","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijrat apne logon ke liye mukammal ho chuki; main tum se Islam aur jihad par bayat leta hun."
"5874","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh se kulla karo kyunke us mein chiknaai hai."
"5875","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maldar ka taalna zulm hai; pas jab tum mein se kisi ko maldar ke hawalay kiya jaye to use chahiye ke wusool kare."
"5876","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maldar ka taalna zulm hai; aur jab tumhein kisi maldar ke hawalay kiya jaye to us ki pairwi karo."
"5877","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachche ke saath aqiqa hai; pas us ki taraf se khoon bahao aur us se aziyat door karo."
"5878","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki panah ke main aisa kahun ke log kahen ke main apne sahaba ko qatl karta hun? Ye shakhs aur us ke sahaba Quran padhte hain jo un ke galon se aage nahi guzarta; wo deen se is tarah nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai."
"5879","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muadh bin Jabal Allah ke halal aur haram ko sab se zyada janne wale hain."
"5880","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muadh bin Jabal qayamat ke din ulama se ek teer ki doori aage honge."
"5881","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mauton ka maidan saath se sattar saal ke darmiyan hai."
"5882","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aisi tasbeehein jo kahen wale ko na-umeed nahi karti: har farz namaz ke baad tees teehatis tasbeeh, tees teehatis tahmeed aur chauntis takbeer."
"5883","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khair sikhaane wale ke liye har cheez maghfirat maangti hai yahan tak ke samundar ki machhliyan bhi."
"5884","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghaib ki kunjiyan paanch hain jinhein Allah taala ke siwa koi nahi janta: koi nahi janta kal kya hoga siwaye Allah taala; koi nahi janta ke arham mein kya hai siwaye Allah taala; koi nahi janta ke qayamat kab aayegi siwaye Allah taala; koi jaan nahi janti ke wo kis zameen par maregi siwaye Allah taala; aur koi nahi janta ke barish kab aayegi siwaye Allah taala."
"5885","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz ki kunji paaki hai, us ki tehrim takbeer hai aur us ki tehleel salam hai."
"5886","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein saf mein khade hone ka maqam saath saal ki ibadat se afzal hai."
"5887","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah un ke gharon aur qabron ko aag se bhar de, jis tarah unhon ne humein namaz-e-wusta se masroof kar diya yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho gaya."
"5888","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Imran ko us ki haddiyon ke maghz tak iman se bhar diya."
"5889","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maloon hai wo jo aurat ke pichhle raaste se aaye."
"5890","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maloon hai wo jo Allah ke chehre ke waseele se sawal kare; aur maloon hai wo jis se Allah ke chehre ke waseele se sawal kiya jaye phir wo sawal karne wale ko na de, jabke us ne koi haq-batil ki baat nahi maangi."
"5891","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maloon hai wo jo apne baap ko gaali de; maloon hai wo jo apni maa ko gaali de; maloon hai wo jo Allah ke siwa kisi aur ke liye zibah kare; maloon hai wo jo zameen ki hadd badle; maloon hai wo jo andhe ko raaste se hata de; maloon hai wo jo janwar ke saath zina kare; maloon hai wo jo qaum-e-Lut ka amal kare."
"5892","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din sab se sakht azab un logon ko hoga jo ye tasveerein banate hain."
"5893","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein mujh se sab se zyada muhabbat karne wale wo log honge jo mere baad aayenge; un mein se har ek tamanna karega ke kaash wo apne ahl-o-maal ke saath mujhe dekh leta."
"5894","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishanon mein se hai be-sharmi aur be-sharmi ka phailna, rishton ka tootna, amanatdar ko khayanat karne wala samajhna aur khayanat karne wale ko amanatdar samajhna."
"5895","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishanon mein se hai ke log masjidon mein fakhr karenge."
"5896","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishanon mein se hai ke aadmi masjid mein guzre aur us mein do rakaat namaz na padhe, aur aadmi sirf usi ko salam kare jise wo janta ho,.... ..."
"5897","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal amalon mein se hai momin ke dil ko khush karna: us ka qarz ada karna, us ki hajat poori karna, us ki koi takleef door karna."
"5898","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke qareeb hone mein se hai chaand ka bada nazar aana."
"5899","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke qareeb hone mein se hai ke chaand naya nazar aaye to kaha jaye ke do raat ka hai; masjidon ko raaste bana liya jaye; aur achanak maut aam ho jaye."
"5900","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se bade gunahon mein se Allah ke saath shirk karna aur jhooti qasam khana hai."
"5901","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki mein se hai ke tum apne baap ke dost ke saath sulook karo."
"5902","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khajoor aur kachche khajoor se sharaab banti hai."
"5903","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gehun se sharaab banti hai, khajoor se sharaab banti hai, jau se sharaab banti hai, kishmish se sharaab banti hai aur shehad se sharaab banti hai."
"5904","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namazon mein ek aisi namaz hai ke jo use chhod de goya us ke ghar walon aur maal ko lutwa diya gaya; yani Asr ki namaz."
"5905","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghairat kuch aisi hai jise Allah pasand karta hai aur kuch aisi hai jise Allah napasand karta hai. Pas jo pasand hai wo shak ke maqam par ghairat hai, aur jo napasand hai wo be-shak ghairat hai."
"5906","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitrat mein se hain: kulla karna, naak mein pani charhana, miswak karna, moonchein katna, nakhun tarashna, baghal ke baal ukhedna, zaer-e-naaf baal mundwana, ungliyon ki pothon ko dhona, istinja ke baad pani chhidakna aur khatna karwana."
"5907","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitrat mein se hai zaer-e-naaf ke baal mundwana, nakhun tarashna aur moonchein katna."
"5908","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabaair mein se hai aadmi ka apne walidain ko gaali dena: wo aadmi ke baap ko gaali deta hai to wo us ke baap ko gaali deta hai, aur wo us ki maa ko gaali deta hai to wo us ki maa ko gaali deta hai."
"5909","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Allah taala ki taraf se hai, us ke Rasool ki taraf se nahi: Allah ne seeder ke darakht kaatne wale par lanat ki hai."
"5910","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazi se wuzu aur mani se ghusl."
"5911","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke Islam ki khoobi mein se hai ke wo un cheezon ko chhod de jo us ke kaam ki nahi."
"5912","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne ghar se apni masjid ki taraf nikalta hai to ek qadam par ek neki likhi jati hai aur doosre par ek burai mitai jati hai."
"5913","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare khulafa mein ek khalifa hoga jo maal ko donon haathon se baantega, ginti nahi karega."
"5914","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari behtar khushbu mushk hai."
"5915","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ki behtareen guzran wale logon mein se wo aadmi hai jo Allah ki raah mein apne ghoray ki lagam thaame hue ho; jab bhi wo koi shor ya khauf ki baat sune to us par sawar ho kar udta hai, qatl aur maut ke maqamon ko dhoondta hai; aur wo aadmi jo bakriyon ke rewar mein in ghatiyon mein se kisi ghati ki choti par ya in wadiyon mein se kisi wadi ke andar ho, namaz qaim kare, zakaat de aur apne Rab ki ibadat kare yahan tak ke yaqeen (maut) a jaye; wo logon se sirf bhalai mein hi rehta hai."
"5916","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se bure logon mein se wo hain jinhein qayamat aayegi aur wo zinda honge."
"5917","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se bure logon mein se do-rukh wala hai: jo in ke paas ek chehre ke saath aata hai aur un ke paas doosre chehre ke saath."
"5918","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise wo mayyat dhoye us par ghusl hai aur jise wo uthaye us par wuzu hai; yani mayyat."
"5919","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitne yahan se aaye, aur aap ne mashriq ki taraf ishara kiya, aur sakhti aur dilon ki kathorai oont aur gaay ki dumo ke neeche baalon wale dehatiyon mein, Rabi'a aur Mudar mein hai."
"5920","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum mein se wo hain jinke peeche Isa bin Maryam namaz padhenge."
"5921","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah is maal mein se kuch de baghair us ke maange, to use qubool kar lena chahiye, kyunke wo rizq hai jo Allah ne us ki taraf bheja hai."
"5922","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne Abbas ko sataya us ne mujhe sataya; beshak aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ke barabar hota hai."
"5923","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalmanon ko un ke raaste mein takleef de us par un ki lanat wajib ho jati hai."
"5924","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne Ali ko sataya us ne mujhe sataya."
"5925","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laye, namaz qaim kare, zakaat de aur Ramzan ke roze rakhe, us par Allah ka haq hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare, chahe wo Allah ki raah mein hijrat kare ya apni us zameen mein baitha rahe jahan wo paida hua."
"5926","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gumshuda janwar ko apne paas rakhe wo khud gumrah hai jab tak us ka elan na kare."
"5927","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khana khareede to use wasool karne se pehle na beche."
"5928","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dudh chhupaye hue janwar ya jis ka doodh rok liya gaya ho khareede, use teen din ka ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to use rakh le aur agar chahe to wapas kar de aur us ke saath ek sa khajoor de, gehun nahi."
"5929","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khajoor ka baagh khareede us ki pollination ke baad to us ka phal bechne wale ka hai, siwaye is ke ke khareedar shart kar le; aur jo ghulam khareede aur us ka maal ho to us ka maal bechne wale ka hai, siwaye is ke ke khareedar shart kar le."
"5930","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm is liye talab kare ke us se ulama par fakhr kare, ya is se bewaqoofon se jhagda kare, ya logon ke dil us ki taraf maayel hon, to us ka thikana aag hai."
"5931","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo betiyon mein se kisi cheez se aazmaya jaye aur un par sabr kare, to wo us ke liye aag se parda ban jati hain."
"5932","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo in betiyon mein se kisi cheez se aazmaya jaye aur un ke saath achha sulook kare, to wo us ke liye aag se parda ban jati hain."
"5933","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise koi naimat ata ki jaye aur wo uska zikr kare to us ne uska shukr kiya, aur agar use chhupaye to us ne us ki naimat ka inkar kiya."
"5934","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne Musalman bhai ki ayadat ke liye aaye wo jannat ke baghon mein chalta rahega yahan tak ke baith jaye; phir jab baith jaye to rehmat us par chha jati hai. Agar subah aaye to shaam tak sattar hazaar farishte us par durood bhejte hain, aur agar shaam ko aaye to subah tak sattar hazaar farishte us par durood bhejte hain."
"5935","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma mein aaye use ghusl karna chahiye."
"5936","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo masjid mein kisi cheez ke liye aaye to wohi us ka hissa hai."
"5937","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare saath koi bhalai kare to us ka badla do; agar badla dene ke liye kuch na pao to us ke liye dua karo."
"5938","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janwar ke saath zina kare use qatl kar do aur janwar ko bhi us ke saath qatl kar do."
"5939","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo najoomi ya kahin ke paas aaye aur us ne jo kaha us ki tasdeeq ki to us ne us cheez ka inkar kiya jo Muhammad par nazil hui."
"5940","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo najoomi ke paas aaye aur us se kuch pooche to us ki chaalis raat ki namaz qubool nahi hoti."
"5941","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bistar par jaye aur niyat kare ke raat ko uth kar namaz padhega, phir us ki aankh lag jaye yahan tak ke subah ho jaye, to us ke liye wohi likha jata hai jo us ne niyat ki thi, aur us ka sona us ke Rab ki taraf se us par sadqa hai."
"5942","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo najoomi ke paas aaye aur us ne jo kaha us ki tasdeeq ki, ya haiza aurat ke paas aaye, ya aurat ke pichhle raaste se aaye, to wo us cheez se bari ho gaya jo Muhammad par nazil hui."
"5943","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is ghar (Kaaba) mein aaye aur koi be-haya baat na kare aur koi gunah na kare, to wo aise wapas hota hai jaise us ki maa ne use jana tha."
"5944","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhare paas aaye jab tum sab ek aadmi par muttahid ho aur wo tumhari jamaat ki lathi todna aur tumhari wahdat ko bikhairna chahe, to use qatl kar do."
"5945","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki umar saath saal ho gayi us ke liye Allah ne umar ke baare mein koi uzr baqi nahi chhoda."
"5946","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kutte palle siwaye kheti ke kutte ya shikar ke kutte ke, us ke ajr se har din ek qeeraat kam hota hai."
"5947","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu Allah ke hukum ke mutabiq poora kare to paanch farz namazain us ke darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara ban jati hain."
"5948","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ke paas aaye aur us se lada jaye aur wo lade aur qatl ho jaye to wo shaheed hai."
"5949","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein apni sulb se teen bachche kho de aur unhein Allah ke hawalay kar de, us ke liye jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"5950","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise tum ne bhalai ke saath yaad kiya us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi, aur jise tum ne burai ke saath yaad kiya us ke liye aag wajib ho gayi; tum zameen par Allah ke gawah ho."
"5951","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke sultan ki izzat kare, Allah qayamat ke din us ki izzat karega."
"5952","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zameen par deewar gher le to wo zameen us ki hai."
"5953","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ansar se muhabbat kare Allah use pasand karega, aur jo Ansar se bugz kare Allah use napasand karega."
"5954","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Hasan aur Husain se muhabbat kare us ne mujh se muhabbat ki, aur jo un se bugz kare us ne mujh se bugz kiya."
"5955","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke us ka aamaal nama use khush kare to use zyada istighfar karna chahiye."
"5956","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke us ke rizq mein kushadgi di jaye aur us ki umar mein barkat di jaye to use apne rishton ko jodna chahiye."
"5957","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke log us ke liye khade hon, to use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"5958","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke wo iman ka maza paye to use chahiye ke kisi aadmi se sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare."
"5959","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez ke baare mein poochna chahe to pooch le; Allah ki qasam, mujh se tum kisi cheez ke baare mein nahi poochoge magar main tumhein us ki khabar dunga jab tak main apni is jagah par hun. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, abhi is deewar ke saamne meri namaz ke dauran mujhe jannat aur jahannam dikhaye gaye, aur main ne aaj ke jaisa khair-o-shar ka manzar nahi dekha."
"5960","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne baap se us ki qabr mein rishta jodna chahe to us ke marne ke baad us ke bhaiyon se rishta jode."
"5961","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke Quran taza padhe jaise nazil hua, to use Umm Abd ki qirat par padhe."
"5962","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pasand kare ke wo aise shaheed ko dekhe jo zameen par chalta hai to use Talha bin Abdullah ko dekhe."
"5963","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ali se muhabbat kare us ne mujh se muhabbat ki, aur jo Ali se bugz kare us ne mujh se bugz kiya."
"5964","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah se milne ko pasand kare Allah bhi us se milne ko pasand karta hai, aur jo Allah se milne ko napasand kare Allah bhi us se milne ko napasand karta hai."
"5965","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye muhabbat kare, Allah ke liye bugz kare, Allah ke liye de aur Allah ke liye roke, us ne iman mukammal kar liya."
"5966","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujh se muhabbat kare use chahiye ke Usama se muhabbat kare."
"5967","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ghora bandhe, Allah par iman aur us ke wade ki tasdeeq ke saath, to qayamat ke din us ka pet bharna, pyas, gobar aur peshab us ke mizan mein nekiyan honge."
"5968","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mahine ki satrah, unees aur ikees tareekh ko pachhna lagwaye, use har bimari se shifa milti hai."
"5969","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni sulb se teen bachche Allah ke liye de aur un ka sawab Allah se umeed rakhe wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. Ek aurat ne kaha: Aur do? Aap ne farmaya: Aur do."
"5970","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare is deen mein koi nayi cheez shuru kare jo us mein se nahi, to wo rad hai."
"5971","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Hajj aur Umrah donon ka ihram bandhe to us ke liye ek tawaf aur ek saee kafi hai, aur wo halal nahi hoga yahan tak ke apna Hajj mukammal kare, phir donon se halal hoga."
"5972","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teerandazi achhi tarah seekhe phir use chhod de to us ne Allah ki naimaton mein se ek naimat chhod di."
"5973","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein neki kare use Islam se pehle ke amal ka muakhza nahi hoga, aur jo Islam mein burai kare use awwal aur aakhir donon ka muakhza hoga."
"5974","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mara hua banjar zameen zinda kare us ke liye us mein ajr hai aur jo kuch us mein se koi khane wali cheez khaye wo us ke liye sadqa hai."
"5975","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo banjar zameen abad kare to wo us ki hai."
"5976","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mara hua banjar zameen zinda kare to wo us ki hai, aur kisi zalim ke dawe ka koi haq nahi."
"5977","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Madina walon ko dara de Allah use dara dega."
"5978","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Madina walon ko dara de us ne mujhe dara diya."
"5979","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quran ka saatwan hissa le le wo behtar hai."
"5980","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ka maal is niyat se le ke ada karna chahe Allah us ki taraf se ada karega, aur jo use tabah karne ki niyat se le Allah use tabah karega."
"5981","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qarz le aur us ki niyat ada karne ki ho Allah us ki madad karta hai."
"5982","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quran sikhaane ke badle ek kamaan le, Allah qayamat ke din us ke gale mein us ke badle jahannam ki aag ki kamaan daal dega."
"5983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zameen mein se koi cheez na-haq le use qayamat ke din us ke saath saat zameenon tak dhansa diya jayega."
"5984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zameen mein se koi cheez zulm se le, qayamat ke din wo us ki mitti utha kar hashr ke maidan mein aayega."
"5985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalmanon ke raaste se koi takleef dene wali cheez hata de, Allah us ke liye ek neki likhta hai; aur jis ke liye Allah ke yahan ek neki likhi ho use jannat mein dakhil karega."
"5986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qarz le aur us ke ada karne ki niyat rakhe, Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf se ada karega."
"5987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne baap ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf apna nisbat kare, ya apne aaqa ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf apna nisbat kare, to us par qayamat tak Allah ki lagataar lanat hai."
"5988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne baap ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf apna daawa kare wo jannat ki khushbu nahi payega, halanke jannat ki khushbu paanch sau saal ki musafat se pawai jati hai."
"5989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jaan boojh kar apne baap ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf daawa kare to us par jannat haram hai."
"5990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni cheez ke siwaye kisi aur cheez ka daawa kare wo hum mein se nahi aur use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"5991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ki ek rakaat pa le use chahiye ke doosri rakaat bhi padh le."
"5992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah ki namaz ki ek rakaat sooraj nikalne se pehle pa le us ne subah ki namaz pa li, aur jo Asr ki namaz ki ek rakaat sooraj ghurub hone se pehle pa le us ne Asr ki namaz pa li."
"5993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo imam ke saath namaz ki ek rakaat pa le us ne namaz pa li."
"5994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ki namaz ki ek rakaat pa le ya kisi aur namaz ki, to us ki namaz mukammal ho gayi."
"5995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr tulu hone se pehle Arafat pa le us ne Hajj pa liya."
"5996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna maal kisi muflis ke paas us ki asal haalat mein pa le wo doosron se zyada us ka haqdar hai."
"5997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare saath ye namaz (Fajr) pa le aur us se pehle raat ya din mein Arafat aa chuka ho, us ne apne ihram ke baal waghaira ka kaam mukammal kar liya aur us ka Hajj poora ho gaya."
"5998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz ki ek rakaat pa le us ne namaz pa li."
"5999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ki namaz ki ek rakaat pa le us ne namaz pa li."
"6000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz ki ek rakaat pa le us ne wo namaz pa li."
"6001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Isa bin Maryam ko pa le use chahiye ke mera salam pahunchaye."
"6002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baarah saal azan de us ke liye jannat wajib ho jati hai, aur us ki azan ke badle har din saat nekiyan likhi jati hain aur iqamat ke badle tees."
"6003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Hajj ka irada kare use jaldi karni chahiye."
"6004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Hajj ka irada kare use jaldi karni chahiye, kyunke bimari lag sakti hai, gumshuda cheez kho sakti hai aur hajat pesh aa sakti hai."
"6005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo roza rakhna chahe use chahiye ke kuch sehar kare."
"6006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janna chahe ke us ke paas Allah ke yahan kya hai to use dekhna chahiye ke Allah ka us ke paas kya hai."
"6007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Madina walon ke saath burai ka irada kare Allah use aise gala de jaise namak pani mein ghulta hai."
"6008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ghora bandhe phir apne haath se us ka chara de, us ke liye har daane ke badle ek neki hai."
"6009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne deen se murtad ho jaye use qatl kar do."
"6010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ko Allah ke ghazab ke saath razi kare Allah use logon ke hawalay kar deta hai, aur jo Allah ki razamandi ke liye logon ko naraz kare Allah us ke liye logon ki takleef kafi kar deta hai."
"6011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo us ke maal ka na-haq irada kiya jaye aur wo lade aur qatl ho jaye to wo shaheed hai."
"6012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz mein takabbur se apna tehband latka de, Allah us se halal aur haram donon mein be-taalluq hai."
"6013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo istijmar kare to use teen martaba kare."
"6014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo achhi sunnat jari kare aur us par amal kiya jaye to us ke liye poora ajr hai aur jinhon ne us par amal kiya un ke ajr ke barabar bhi, aur un ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi; aur jo buri sunnat jari kare aur us par amal kiya jaye to us par poora wabal hai aur un ke wabal ke barabar bhi, aur un ke wabal mein kuch kami nahi."
"6015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Madina mein mar sake to wahan mare, kyunke main wahan marne wale ke liye shafaat karunga."
"6016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo kar sake ke us ke aur us ke qibla ke darmiyan koi na aaye to use aisa hi karna chahiye."
"6017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo kar sake ke aag se bache agarche khajoor ke tukre ke zariye, to use aisa kar lena chahiye."
"6018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo kar sake ke us ke paas nek amal ka zakheera ho to use aisa kar lena chahiye."
"6019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo apne bhai ko nafa pahuncha sake to use nafa pahunchana chahiye."
"6020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki panah maange use panah do, aur jo tum se Allah ke chehre ke waseele se sawal kare use do."
"6021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum se Allah ki panah maange use panah do, jo tum se Allah ke waseele se sawal kare use do, jo tumhein bulaye us ki dawat qubool karo, aur jo tumhare saath bhalai kare us ka badla do; agar badla dene ke liye kuch na pao to us ke liye dua karo yahan tak ke tum samjho ke tum ne us ka badla ada kar diya."
"6022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo iffat talab kare Allah use iffat deta hai, jo maldar banne ki koshish kare Allah use maldar karta hai; aur jo logon se sawal kare aur us ke paas paanch auqiya ke barabar ho to us ne israr se sawal kiya."
"6023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise hum kisi kaam par muqarrar karen aur us ke liye rizq de den, phir us ke baad jo kuch le wo ghulul khayanat hai."
"6024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jise hum kisi kaam par muqarrar karen aur wo hum se sui ke dhaage ke barabar ya us se zyada koi cheez chhupaye, to wo qayamat ke din khayanat ka maal le kar aayega."
"6025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jise hum kisi kaam par muqarrar karen use chahiye ke thoda ya zyada jo mile le kar aaye; pas jo us se liya jaye wo le aur jis se mana kiya gaya ho us se ruk jaye."
"6026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo momin mard aur momin aurton ke liye maghfirat maange, Allah us ke liye har momin mard aur aurat ke badle ek neki likhta hai."
"6027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maldar banne ki koshish kare Allah use maldar karta hai, jo iffat talab kare Allah use iffat deta hai, jise kifayat ki talab ho Allah us ki kifayat karta hai; aur jo sawal kare aur us ke paas ek auqiya ki qeemat ho to us ne israr se sawal kiya."
"6028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ki baat chup ke sune jabke wo us se naraz hon, us ke kaanon mein pighla hua see sa charhaya jayega; aur jo apni aankhon ko khwab mein woh dikhwaye jo us ne dekha nahi, use ek jau ke daane ko girah lagane ka hukum diya jayega."
"6029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise amanat di jaye us par us ke baghair taqseer zaya hone ki koi zimmadari nahi."
"6030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat ko jaage aur apni biwi ko jagaye, phir donon mil kar do rakaat padhein, to us raat wo zikr karne walon aur zikr karne waliyon mein likhe jate hain."
"6031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez mein salam kare to use maloom naap, maloom wazan aur maloom muddat tak peshgi kare."
"6032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Islam laaye aur us ke paas koi cheez ho to wo us ki hai."
"6033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ke haath par Islam laaye to us ki wala us ke liye hai."
"6034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki taraf lohe ke hathiyar se ishara kare to farishte us par lanat karte hain, agarche wo us ke baap aur maa ke bhai ho."
"6035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo doodh chhupaya hua janwar khareede use teen din ka ikhtiyar hai; agar wo wapas kare to us ke saath ek sa khana de, gehun nahi."
"6036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo doodh chhupaya hua janwar khareede use do mein se behtar ikhtiyar hai: agar chahe to rakh le aur agar chahe to wapas kar de aur us ke saath ek sa khajoor de, gehun nahi."
"6037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo doodh chhupaya hua janwar khareede use teen din ka ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to rakh le aur agar chahe to wapas kar de aur us ke saath ek sa khajoor de."
"6038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi zaroorat ke maal mein se apne munh se khaye aur chhupane wala na ho to us par kuch nahi; aur jo us mein se kuch nikaal le to us par do guni jurmana aur saza hai; aur jo us se kuch chura le us ke baad ke wo anaj ke khalyan mein rakh diya jaye, aur wo dhaal ki qeemat ko pahunche to us par haath kaatna hai; aur jo us se kam chura le to us par do guni jurmana aur saza hai."
"6039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gunah kare phir us gunah ki hadd qaim ki jaye to wo us ka kaffara ban jati hai."
"6040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise koi fikr, gham, bimari ya sakhti pahunche aur wo kahe: Allah mera Rab hai, uska koi sharik nahi, to Allah us se wo door kar deta hai."
"6041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise faqa pahunche aur wo logon ke paas shikayat le jaye to us ki faqa poori nahi hoti; aur jo Allah ke paas le jaye to Allah use jald maldari ata karne ke qareeb hai, ya to maut ko taal kar ya foran maldari de kar."
"6042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se subah uthaye apne ghar mein aman ke saath, apne jism mein tandurust, aur us ke paas din bhar ka khana ho, to goya us ke liye poori duniya la kar rakh di gayi."
"6043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aaram ke liye kisi jagah let jaye aur us mein Allah ka zikr na kare, to qayamat ke din us par nuqsan hoga; aur jo kisi majlis mein baithe aur us mein Allah ka zikr na kare, to qayamat ke din us par nuqsan hoga."
"6044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat kare us ne Allah ki itaat ki, aur jo meri nafarmani kare us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki; aur jo ameer ki itaat kare us ne meri itaat ki, aur jo ameer ki nafarmani kare us ne meri nafarmani ki."
"6045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah khana khilaye use chahiye ke kahe: Ae Allah, is mein barkat de aur humein is se behtar khila; aur jise Allah doodh pilaye use chahiye ke kahe: Ae Allah, is mein barkat de aur ise zyada kar; kyunke khane aur peene ki koi cheez doodh ke barabar nahi hoti."
"6046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ke ghar mein baghair ijazat jhaanke aur wo us ki aankh phod den, to us par na diyat hai na qisas."
"6047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ke ghar mein baghair ijazat jhaanke to un ke liye jaayaz ho gaya ke us ki aankh phod den."
"6048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ke ghar mein baghair ijazat jhaanke aur wo us ki aankh phod den to us ka khoon raayegan hai."
"6049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zulm ke saath kisi jhagde mein madad kare wo Allah ke ghazab mein rehta hai yahan tak ke us se baaz aaye."
"6050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek momin ghulam azad kare to wo us ke liye aag se fidya ban jata hai."
"6051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek Musalman ghulam azad kare, Allah us ke har uzv ke badle aag se us ke har uzv ko azad kar deta hai, yahan tak ke us ki sharamgah ke badle us ki sharamgah ko."
"6052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghulam mein apna hissa azad kare aur us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat tak pahunche, to ghulam ki munasib qeemat lagayi jaye, phir apne sharikon ko un ke hisse diye jayen aur ghulam us ki taraf se azad ho jaye; warna jitna us ne azad kiya utna hi azad hoga."
"6053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghulam mein se kuch hissa azad kare to us par us ki poori azadi us ke maal se wajib hai; agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam ki munasib qeemat lagayi jaye, phir us se mehnat karwayi jaye baghair us par zyada bojh daale."
"6054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghulam azad kare aur us ke paas maal ho to us ka maal ghulam ka hai, siwaye is ke ke aaqa apne maal ki shart kar de to wo us ka hoga."
"6055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise narmi ka hissa diya gaya us ke liye khair ka hissa diya gaya, aur jise narmi se mehroom kiya gaya us ke liye khair se mehroom kiya gaya."
"6056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise kuch ata kiya jaye aur wo badla dene ke liye kuch pa le to use us se badla de; aur jise na mile to use us ki tareef kare; pas agar us ne us ki tareef ki to us ne us ka shukr kiya, aur agar use chhupaya to us ne us ka inkar kiya; aur jo apne paas na hone wali cheez ka libaas pehne wo dohre jhoot ka libaas pehneta hai."
"6057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi zameen ko abaad kare jo kisi ki nahi hai to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"6058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ko umra ke taur par koi cheez de to wo us ki aur us ki aulad ki hai; us ki aulad mein se jo us ka waris ho us ko paata hai."
"6059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ko umra de to wo dene wale ke liye us ki zindagi aur maut donon mein rahega; aur ruqba na karo, pas jo ruqba kare to wo miras ke raaste par chala jayega."
"6060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ko koi cheez umra de to wo us ki zindagi mein aur us ki maut ke baad bhi us ki hai."
"6061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paon Allah ki raah mein ghubaar aalood honge Allah use aag par haram kar dega."
"6062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare, phir Jumma mein aaye, jitni taqdeer ho namaz padhe, phir khamosh rahe yahan tak ke imam apna khutba khatm kare, phir us ke saath namaz padhe, to us ke darmiyan aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain aur teen din zyada."
"6063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare, janabat ka ghusl, phir pehle waqt mein rawana ho to goya us ne ek oont qurban kiya; jo doosre waqt mein rawana ho to goya us ne ek gaay qurban ki; jo teesre waqt mein rawana ho to goya us ne seengh wala mendha qurban kiya; jo chauthay waqt mein rawana ho to goya us ne ek murghi qurban ki; jo paanchwein waqt mein rawana ho to goya us ne ek anda qurban kiya; phir jab imam nikalta hai to farishte zikr sunne ke liye hazir ho jate hain."
"6064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare aur achha ghusl kare, paaki hasil kare aur achhi tarah paaki kare, apne behtar kapre pehne aur Allah ne jo khushbu ya tel us ke liye likha ho laga le, phir masjid aaye aur koi bekar baat na kare aur do aadmiyon ke darmiyan na jaaye, Allah us ke darmiyan aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf kar deta hai."
"6065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare wo agle Jumma tak paaki mein rahta hai."
"6066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare, miswak kare, apne paas khushbu ho to lagaye, apne behtar kapre pehne, phir ghar se nikal kar masjid aaye aur logon ki gardanein na phande, phir jitni Allah ne chahi ho namaz padhe, phir jab imam nikalta hai to khamosh ho jaye aur namaz khatm hone tak baat na kare, to ye us ke darmiyan aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan ka kaffara ban jata hai."
"6067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare, apni biwi ki khushbu ho to laga le, apne achhe kapre pehne, phir logon ki gardanein na phande aur waaz ke waqt bekar baat na kare, to ye us ke darmiyan aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan ka kaffara hai; aur jo bekar baat kare aur logon ki gardanein phande to us ke liye sirf zohr ki namaz hai."
"6068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baghair ilm ke fatwa de to us ka gunah us par jis ne us se fatwa liya; aur jo apne bhai ko aisi baat ka mashwara de jis mein wo janta ho ke is ke siwaye doosri baat mein rasta hai, to us ne us se khayanat ki."
"6069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghair-mustanad fatwa de to us ka gunah us par jis ne us se fatwa liya."
"6070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramzan mein bhool kar roza khol de to us par na qaza hai na kaffara."
"6071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ka sauda us ki darkhwast par wapas kar de, Allah taala us ki khalish door kar dega."
"6072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qaidi ke baare mein gawahi qaim kare us ke liye us ka salb hai."
"6073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mushrikeen ke saath rehne lage us se zimma baari ho gaya."
"6074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sitara shanaasi ka ilm le us ne jadu ki ek shakh le, jitna zyada kiya utna zyada."
"6075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zulm se zameen ka koi tukra le le, wo Allah se aise milega ke Allah us par ghazabnaak hoga."
"6076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ka haq apni qasam se kaat le, Allah ne us par aag wajib kar di aur jannat haram kar di, agarche wo peelu ki ek tehni ho."
"6077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kutte palle siwaye maweshi ke kutte ya shikari kutte ke, us ke amal se har din do qeeraat kam hote hain."
"6078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aisa kutta palle jo na shikar ka ho, na maweshi ka, na kheti ka, to us ke ajr se har din do qeeraat kam hote hain."
"6079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aisa kutta palle jo na kheti aur na doodh ka nafa deta ho, us ke amal se har din ek qeeraat kam hota hai."
"6080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do baar chandi qarz de wo ek baar sadqa karne ke barabar hai."
"6081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dawa ke liye daagh lagwaye ya jhaad-phook karwaye wo tawakkul se bari ho gaya."
"6082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo bhool kar khaye ya piye use roza na tode, kyunke wo rizq hai jo Allah ne usay diya."
"6083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ke haq par ek luqma khaye Allah use jahannam se waisa hi khilayega; jo kisi Musalman ke haq par kapra pehne Allah use jahannam se waisa hi pehnaayega; aur jo kisi Musalman par shohrat aur dikhawa ke liye koi maqam le Allah qayamat ke din use shohrat aur dikhawa ke maqam par khada karega."
"6084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo lehsun ya pyaz khaye use chahiye ke ham se alag rahe, hamari masjid se alag rahe aur apne ghar mein baith jaye."
"6085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah ko Madina ke donon patthari ilaqon ke darmiyan ke saat khajoor khaye, us din shaam tak zeher usay nuqsan nahi deta."
"6086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khana khaye phir kahe: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe ye khana khilaya aur baghair meri taqat aur quwwat ke mujhe rizq diya, us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain; aur jo kapra pehne phir kahe: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe ye kapra pehnaya aur baghair meri taqat aur quwwat ke mujhe rizq diya, us ke aage peeche ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gosht khaye use wuzu karna chahiye."
"6088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ke saath khajoor khaye to do mila kar na khaye siwaye is ke ke wo ijazat de den."
"6089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo in sabziyon mein se khaye: lehsun, pyaz aur gandhana, to wo hamare qareeb na aaye hamari masjidon mein, kyunke farishte un cheezon se takleef paate hain jin se insan takleef paate hain."
"6090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is khabees darakht mein se kuch khaye to wo hamare qareeb masjid mein na aaye. Ae logon, mujhe Allah ki halal ki hui cheez haram karne ka haq nahi, lekin ye aisa darakht hai jis ki badbu ko main napasand karta hun."
"6091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is khabees darakht mein se khaye wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye, kyunke farishte un cheezon se takleef paate hain jin se insan takleef paate hain."
"6092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is khabees darakht mein se khaye wo hamari namaz ki jagah ke qareeb na aaye yahan tak ke us ki badbu khatm ho jaye."
"6093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaye wo masjidon ke qareeb na aaye."
"6094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaye wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye aur lehsun ki badbu se humein takleef na de."
"6095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaye wo hamare qareeb na aaye aur hamare saath namaz na padhe."
"6096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is darakht, yani lehsun, mein se khaye wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye."
"6097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ko naraz kar ke Allah ki razamandi talab kare Allah us ke liye logon ki takleef kafi kar deta hai; aur jo Allah ko naraz kar ke logon ki razamandi talab kare Allah use logon ke hawalay kar deta hai."
"6098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalmanon ke raaste se takleef ki cheez hata de us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai, aur jis se ek neki qubool ki jaye wo jannat mein dakhil hota hai."
"6099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare hukkam mein se jo tumhein gunah ka hukum de to us ki itaat na karo."
"6100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakhe to us ke amal se har din ek qeeraat kam hota hai, siwaye kheti ke kutte ya maweshi ke kutte ke."
"6101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ki imamat kare aur waqt par namaz ada kare aur namaz poora kare to us ke liye bhi ajr hai aur un ke liye bhi; aur jo us mein kuch kami kare to wo us par hai, un par nahi."
"6102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ki imamat kare jabke wo us se naraz hon to us ki namaz us ke galon se aage nahi guzarti."
"6103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ko us ke khoon ki aman de phir use qatl kar de, to main us qatil se bari hun, agarche maqtool kafir ho."
"6104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne baap ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf nisbat kare ya apne aaqa ke siwaye kisi aur ko wali banaye, to us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai."
"6105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo lut maar kare wo hum mein se nahi."
"6106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de ya us ka qarz maaf kar de, Allah use apne saye mein rakhega us din jab us ke saye ke siwa koi saya nahi."
"6107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de ya us ka qarz maaf kar de, Allah qayamat ke din use apne arsh ke saye ke neeche rakhega us din jab us ke saye ke siwa koi saya nahi."
"6108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ko mohlat de us ke liye qarz ada hone se pehle har din ke badle utna hi sadqa hai; phir jab qarz ka waqt a jaye aur wo use mohlat de to us ke liye har din ke badle do guna sadqa hai."
"6109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein do jodi kharch kare use jannat ke darwazon se pukara jayega: Ae Allah ke bande, ye khair hai. Pas jo namaz wala ho use namaz ke darwaze se bulaya jayega, jo jihad wala ho use jihad ke darwaze se, jo roza rakhne wala ho use Rayyan ke darwaze se, aur jo sadqa dene wala ho use sadqe ke darwaze se. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kya koi aisa bhi hoga jise in tamam darwazon se bulaya jaye? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur mujhe umeed hai ke tum unhi mein se hoge."
"6110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein kharch kare us ke liye saat sau guna likha jata hai."
"6111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke sultan ki zameen mein be-izzati kare Allah use be-izzat karega."
"6112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quraysh ki be-izzati kare Allah use be-izzat karega."
"6113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chhat par baghair parde ke raat guzare us se zimma bari ho gaya."
"6114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat guzare aur us ke haath mein gosht ki badbu ho aur usay koi safed daagh lag jaye to wo apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"6115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat guzare aur us ke haath mein gosht ki badbu ho aur usay kuch ho jaye to wo apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"6116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek hi saude mein do saude kare to us ke liye un donon mein se kam qeemat hai, warna wo sood hai."
"6117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo phal beche phir us par aafat aa jaye to wo apne bhai ke maal mein se kuch na le; kyunke tum mein se koi apne Musalman bhai ka maal kaise khaye?!"
"6118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni qurbani ki khaal beche to us ki qurbani nahi."
"6119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghar beche phir us ki qeemat ko waisa hi ghar nahi banaye, us mein barkat nahi di jati."
"6120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se ghar ya zameen beche to use maloom ho ke wo aisa maal hai jis mein barkat nahi di jayegi, siwaye is ke ke wo us ki qeemat ko waisa hi kar le."
"6121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo pehle salam kare wo Allah aur us ke Rasool se zyada qareeb hai."
"6122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo salam se pehle kalaam shuru kare use jawab na do."
"6123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dehat mein rahe wo sakht ho jata hai."
"6124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dehat mein rahe wo sakht ho jata hai, jo shikar ke peechhe lage wo ghaafil ho jata hai, aur jo sultanon ke darwazon par jaye wo fitne mein pad jata hai."
"6125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badal de use qatl kar do."
"6126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein teer phenke us ke liye jannat mein ek darja hai."
"6127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye agarche chidya ke ghar ke barabar ya us se chhoti, Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye agarche chidya ke ande ke ghar ke barabar, Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye masjid banaye jis mein Allah ka zikr kiya jaye, Allah us ke liye jannat mein waisa hi ghar banata hai."
"6131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo masjid banaye Allah ki razamandi ke liye, Allah us ke liye jannat mein waisa hi ghar banata hai."
"6132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki taraf tauba kare is se pehle ke us ki jaan gale tak pahunche, Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai."
"6133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sooraj maghrib se nikalne se pehle tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai."
"6134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze ke saath jaye yahan tak ke us par namaz padhe us ke liye ek qeeraat ajr hai; aur jo janaze ke saath chale yahan tak ke use dafn kiya jaye us ke liye do qeeraat ajr hai; aur qeeraat Uhud ke barabar hai."
"6135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze ke saath jaye yahan tak ke us par namaz padhe aur us se farigh ho us ke liye do qeeraat hain; aur jo us ke saath jaye yahan tak ke us par namaz padhe us ke liye ek qeeraat hai; us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, wo mizan mein Uhud se zyada bhaari hai."
"6136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze ke saath jaye yahan tak ke us se farigh ho us ke liye do qeeraat hain; aur agar us se farigh hone se pehle wapas aa jaye to ek qeeraat."
"6137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze ke saath jaye aur us par namaz padhe phir wapas aa jaye us ke liye ek qeeraat ajr hai; aur jo us ke saath jaye aur namaz padhe phir baith rahe yahan tak ke us se farigh ho aur use dafn kiya jaye us ke liye do qeeraat ajr hain, aur un mein se har ek Uhud se bada hai."
"6138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ke janaze ke saath iman aur sawab ki niyat se jaye aur us ke saath rahe yahan tak ke us par namaz padhe aur dafn se farigh ho, to wo do qeeraat ajr le kar wapas hota hai, har qeeraat Uhud ke barabar; aur jo us par namaz padhe phir dafn hone se pehle wapas aa jaye to wo ek qeeraat ajr le kar wapas hota hai."
"6139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jhoota khwab bayan kare usay qayamat ke din do jaun ke darmiyan girah lagane ka bojh diya jayega aur wo un ke darmiyan girah nahi laga sakega."
"6140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baghair kisi zaroorat ke lagataar teen Jumma chhod de, Allah us ke dil par mohar laga deta hai."
"6141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo saampon ko un ke peechha karne ke dar se chhod de wo hum mein se nahi; jab se hum ne un se jang ki hai, hum ne un se kabhi sulah nahi ki."
"6142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teerandazi seekhne ke baad us se be-raghbati se chhod de to wo naimat hai jiska us ne inkar kiya."
"6143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teen Jumma ko haqeer samajh kar chhod de, Allah us ke dil par mohar laga deta hai."
"6144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baghair uzr teen Jumma chhod de wo munafiqon mein likha jata hai."
"6145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye aajizi se kapra pehna chhod de jabke us par qudrat ho, Allah qayamat ke din tamam makhlooq ke saamne usay bulayega yahan tak ke usay iman ka jo libaas chahe pehna dega."
"6146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Asr ki namaz chhod de us ka amal barbaad ho jata hai."
"6147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maal chhod mare wo us ke warison ka hai, aur jo aulad chhod mare to wo Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf hai; aur main us ka waris hun jis ka koi waris na ho, main us ki taraf se khoon bharta hun aur us ka waris hota hun; aur maa ka bhai us ka waris hai jis ka koi waris na ho, wo us ki taraf se khoon bharta hai aur uska waris hota hai."
"6148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shadi kare us ne apna aadha iman mukammal kar liya, pas use chahiye ke baqi aadhe mein Allah se dare."
"6149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi qaum ki mushabibat ikhtiyar kare wo unhi mein se hai."
"6150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo har roz subah saat ajwa khajoor khaye us din use na zeher nuqsan deta hai na jadu."
"6151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne jism mein se kuch sadqa kare usay utna hi diya jata hai."
"6152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek khajoor ke barabar halal kamai se sadqa de, aur Allah halal ke siwa qubool nahi karta, to Allah use apne daayein haath se qubool karta hai phir us ke maalik ke liye aise barhata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne bhains ke bachhre ko barhata hai yahan tak ke wo pahar ke barabar ho jata hai."
"6153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilaj kare aur uska tibb maloom na ho to wo zimmadar hai."
"6154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar mein wuzu kare phir masjid-e-Quba aaye aur us mein namaz padhe to us ke liye Umrah ke barabar ajr hai."
"6155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar mein paaki kare phir Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar ki taraf chale taake Allah ke farz namazon mein se koi farz ada kare, to us ke qadmon mein se ek gunah girata hai aur doosra darja buland karta hai."
"6156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat ko neend se jaage aur jaagte hi kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai, wo zindagi deta hai aur maut deta hai, us ke haath mein khair hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai; Allah paak hai, tamam tareef Allah ke liye, Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Allah sab se bada hai, aur Allah ki madad ke baghair na gunah se bachne ki taqat hai na neki karne ki quwwat; phir kahe: Ae Allah, meri maghfirat farma, ya dua kare, to us ki dua qubool hoti hai; phir agar wo uth kar wuzu kare aur namaz padhe to us ki namaz qubool ki jati hai."
"6157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne nafs mein bada ban jaye aur apni chaal mein akad kar chale, wo Allah se aise milega ke Allah us par ghazabnaak hoga."
"6158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm is liye seekhe ke us se ulama par fakhr kare, ya bewaqoofon se jhagda kare, ya logon ke chehre us ki taraf maayel kare, Allah use jahannam mein dakhil karega."
"6159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aisa ilm seekhe jis se Allah ki razamandi maangi jati hai magar wo use sirf duniya ka badla paane ke liye seekhe, wo qayamat ke din jannat ki khushbu nahi payega."
"6160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qibla ki taraf thooke wo qayamat ke din apna thook apni donon aankhon ke darmiyan le kar aayega; aur jo is khabees sabzi mein se khaye wo hamari masjid ke qareeb na aaye."
"6161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujh par aisi baat kahe jo main ne nahi kahi, use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"6162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye aajizi ikhtiyar kare Allah use buland karta hai."
"6163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir jaye aur dekhe ke log namaz padh chuke hain, Allah use un ke ajr ke barabar ajr deta hai, aur un ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi karta."
"6164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare, phir kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain, to us ke liye jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, jis se chahe dakhil ho."
"6165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir do rakaat padhe aur un mein bhool na kare, Allah us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar deta hai."
"6166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir do rakaat padhe aur un mein apne dil aur chehre se Allah ki taraf mutawajjeh rahe, us ke liye jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"6167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain; Ae Allah, mujhe tauba karne walon mein aur paak rehne walon mein shamil kar, to us ke liye jannat ke aath darwaze khol diye jate hain, jis se chahe dakhil ho."
"6168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain, to us ke liye jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, jis se chahe dakhil ho."
"6169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare, us ke gunah us ke jism se nikal jate hain yahan tak ke us ke nakhunon ke neeche se bhi nikal jate hain."
"6170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare aur wuzu se farigh ho kar kahe: Ae Allah, tu paak hai, teri hi tareef hai, main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun, to ye ek kaghaz par likha jata hai, phir us par mohar lagai jati hai aur qayamat tak nahi todi jati."
"6171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare to naak jhare aur jo istijmar kare to odd number kare."
"6172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kare jaise hukum diya gaya aur namaz padhe jaise hukum diya gaya, us ke pichhle amal ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz ke liye wuzu kare aur wuzu poora kare phir farz namaz ki taraf chale aur logon ke saath usay padhe, Allah us ke gunah maaf kar deta hai."
"6174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is jaisa wuzu kare phir masjid aaye aur do rakaat padhe phir baithe, us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain; aur tum maghroor na bano."
"6175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere is wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare phir khada ho kar do rakaat padhe aur un mein apne nafs se koi baat na kahe, us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere is wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare phir do rakaat padhe aur un mein apne nafs se koi baat na kahe, us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is tarah wuzu kare phir masjid ki taraf nikle aur use sirf namaz hi ubhare, us ke guzre hue gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is tarah wuzu kare us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain aur us ki namaz aur masjid ki taraf chalna nafil sawab ban jata hai."
"6179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din wuzu kare aur achha wuzu kare phir Jumma mein aaye, qareeb baith kar sune aur khamosh rahe, us ke darmiyan aur agle Jumma ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain aur teen din zyada; aur jis ne kankariyan chhuin us ne bekar kaam kiya."
"6180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din wuzu kare to ye achha hai aur behtar hai, aur jo ghusl kare to ghusl behtar hai."
"6181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne aaqa ke siwaye kisi aur ko wali banaye us ne Islam ki rassi apni gardan se utaar di."
"6182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne aaqa ki ijazat ke baghair kisi qaum ko wali banaye us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai; Allah qayamat ke din us se na koi farz qubool karega na nafil."
"6183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sunnat ki baarah rakaaton par hamesha paband rahe Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai: zohr se pehle chaar rakaat, us ke baad do rakaat, maghrib ke baad do rakaat, isha ke baad do rakaat aur Fajr se pehle do rakaat."
"6184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri is masjid mein aaye aur sirf is liye aaye ke koi bhalai seekhe ya sikhaaye, wo Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wale ke darje mein hai; aur jo yahan kisi aur maqsad se aaye wo us aadmi ke darje mein hai jo doosre ka saamaan dekhta hai."
"6185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki ibadat ke liye aaye, us ke saath kisi ko sharik na kare, namaz qaim kare, zakaat de, Ramzan ke roze rakhe aur kabaair se bache, to us ke liye jannat hai. Logon ne kaha: Kabaair kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke saath shirk karna, kisi Musalman ki jaan qatl karna aur maidan-e-jang se bhaagna."
"6186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mushrik ke saath uthne-baithne aur rehne ko ikhtiyar kare wo us jaisa hai."
"6187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna tehband kheench kar chale aur us se sirf takabbur ka irada rakhe, Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"6188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo takabbur se apna kapra kheench kar chale Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"6189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo fikron ko ek hi fikr bana de, aakhirat ka fikr, Allah us ke baqi tamam fikron ke liye kafi ho jata hai; aur jo duniya ke maamlat mein fikron mein bikhra rahe Allah ko koi parwah nahi ke wo kis wadi mein halak ho."
"6190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ke darmiyan qazi bana diya jaye us ne baghair chhuri ke zibah kar liya."
"6191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo daud ke din ghore na-jaayaz taur par daud mein lagwaye wo hum mein se nahi."
"6192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi majlis mein baithe aur us mein bahut shor sharaba ho, phir us majlis se uthne se pehle kahe: Ae Allah, tu paak hai, ae hamare Rab, teri hi hamd hai, main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun, to us majlis mein jo kuch hua wo maaf kar diya jata hai."
"6193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein mujahid ko tayyar kare us ne khud jihad kiya, aur jo Allah ki raah mein mujahid ke ghar walon ki achhi tarah dekh bhal kare us ne khud jihad kiya."
"6194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein mujahid ko tayyar kare us ke liye mujahid ke ajr ke barabar ajr hai, aur mujahid ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi hoti."
"6195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zohr se pehle chaar rakaat aur us ke baad chaar rakaat ki hifazat kare use aag par haram kar diya jata hai."
"6196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki haddon mein se kisi hadd ko apni shafaat se rok de us ne Allah ke amr ki mukhalifat ki; aur jo qarz le kar mare, us ka qarz dinar aur dirham se nahi balke nekiyon aur buraiyon se ada hoga; aur jo jaan boojh kar batil mein jhagra kare wo Allah ke ghazab mein rehta hai yahan tak ke us se baaz aaye; aur jo kisi momin ke baare mein aisi baat kahe jo us mein nahi, Allah use jahannam ki peep mein daal dega yahan tak ke wo apni baat se rujoo kare, aur wo rujoo karne wala nahi hoga."
"6197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye Hajj kare aur us mein be-haya baat na kare aur gunah na kare, wo aise wapas hota hai jaise us din jab us ki maa ne use jana tha."
"6198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is ghar ka Hajj kare.... use chahiye ke uska aakhri waqt ghar ka tawaf ho."
"6199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri taraf se aisi hadith bayan kare jise wo jhoota samajhta ho, to wo jhooton mein se ek hai."
"6200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kuen khode us ke liye apne maweshi ke liye chaalis gaz ka charagah hai."
"6201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Surah Kahf ke shuru ki das ayaat yaad rakhe use dajjal ke fitne se bachaya jata hai."
"6202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne munh aur apni sharamgah ki hifazat kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo amanat ki qasam khaye wo hum mein se nahi."
"6204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke siwa kisi aur ki qasam khaye us ne shirk kiya."
"6205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere is mimbar ke paas jhooti qasam khaye use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le, agarche wo peelu ki ek hari tehni ke liye ho."
"6206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur insha Allah kahe to use ikhtiyar hai, agar chahe to aage badhe aur agar chahe to chhod de, us par koi gunah nahi."
"6207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jhooti qasam khaye jis se wo kisi Musalman ka maal kaat le aur us mein gunahgar ho, wo Allah se aise milega ke Allah us par ghazabnaak hoga."
"6208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye phir us ke siwaye behtar baat dekhe to use chahiye ke wohi behtar kaam kare aur apni qasam ka kaffara de."
"6209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur kahe: Insha Allah, to us ne istisna kar liya."
"6210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur kahe: Insha Allah, to use ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to aage badhe aur agar chahe to chhod de."
"6211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur kahe: Insha Allah, to use ikhtiyar hai; agar chahe to aage badhe aur agar chahe to chhod de, us par gunah nahi."
"6212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye aur kahe: Insha Allah, to us par koi gunah nahi."
"6213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jhooti qasam apne Musalman bhai ka maal kaatne ke liye jaan boojh kar khaye use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"6214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaye to use Kaaba ke Rab ki qasam khani chahiye."
"6215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo rishta todne ki qasam khaye ya aisi baat ki qasam khaye jo munasib na ho, to us ki neki ye hai ke wo us qasam par aage na badhe."
"6216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se qasam khaye aur apni qasam mein kahe: Lat aur Uzza ki qasam, to use chahiye ke fauran kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi; aur jo apne saathi se kahe: Aa, jua khelen, to use chahiye ke kuch sadqa kare."
"6217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare khilaf hathiyar uthaye wo hum mein se nahi."
"6218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare khilaf hathiyar uthaye wo hum mein se nahi, aur jo humein dhoka de wo hum mein se nahi."
"6219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka hisab liya jayega wo azab diya jayega."
"6220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka qayamat ke din hisab liya jayega wo azab diya jayega. Aisha ne kaha: Kya Allah ye nahi farmata: Pas us ka aasan hisab liya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Wo hisab nahi hai, wo to peshi hai, lekin jis ka hisab mein jaanch partal ki jayegi wo halak ho jayega."
"6221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo darre ke raat ke aakhir mein nahi uth sakega use chahiye ke shuru raat mein witr padh le; aur jo umeed rakhe ke raat ke aakhir mein uthega use chahiye ke aakhir raat mein witr padhe, kyunke raat ke aakhir ki namaz mein farishte hazir hote hain aur ye afzal hai."
"6222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo darre wo raat ke pehle hisse mein chale, aur jo raat ke pehle hisse mein chale wo manzil tak pahunch jata hai. Sun lo, Allah ka sauda mehnga hai; sun lo, Allah ka sauda jannat hai."
"6223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ki biwi ya us ke ghulam ko kharab kare wo hum mein se nahi."
"6224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka khatma roze par ho wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo nikal kar is masjid, masjid-e-Quba aaye aur us mein namaz padhe us ke liye Umrah ke barabar ajr hai."
"6226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze ke saath us ke ghar se nikle aur us par namaz padhe phir us ke saath jaye yahan tak ke dafn kiya jaye us ke liye do qeeraat ajr hain, har qeeraat Uhud ke barabar; aur jo us par namaz padhe phir wapas aa jaye us ke liye Uhud ke barabar ajr hai."
"6227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo itaat se nikal jaye aur jamaat se juda ho kar mare wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega; aur jo andhe jhande ke neeche lade, asabiyat ke liye ghazabnaak ho, asabiyat ki taraf bulaye ya asabiyat ki madad kare aur qatl ho, to us ka qatl jaahiliyat ka qatl hai; aur jo meri ummat ke khilaf khada ho aur us ke nek aur bad donon ko maare aur kisi momin ka lihaz na kare aur kisi ahad wale ka ahad poora na kare, wo mujh se nahi aur main us se nahi."
"6228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar se paaki ki haalat mein farz namaz ke liye nikle us ka ajr hajj ke ihram bandhne wale ke ajr ke barabar hai; aur jo chasht ki namaz ke liye nikle aur use sirf wohi ubhare us ka ajr Umrah karne wale ke ajr ke barabar hai; aur ek namaz ke baad doosri namaz jis ke darmiyan koi laghw na ho, Illiyyin mein likhi jati hai."
"6229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo itaat ka haath chhod de wo qayamat ke din Allah se aise milega ke us ke paas koi daleel nahi hogi; aur jo mare aur us ki gardan mein kisi ki bayat na ho wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega."
"6230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah ne do thikanon mein se ek ke liye paida kiya use us amal ki taufeeq deta hai."
"6231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo bazaar mein dakhil ho kar kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai, wo zindagi deta hai aur maut deta hai, wo zinda hai use maut nahi aati, us ke haath mein khair hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to Allah us ke liye das lakh nekiyan likhta hai, us ke das lakh gunah mita deta hai, us ke das lakh darje buland karta hai aur us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baagh mein dakhil ho use chahiye ke khaye aur chhupane ka maal na banaye."
"6233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is masjid mein dakhil ho aur us mein thooke ya balgham phenke use chahiye ke khod kar dafn kar de; agar aisa na kar sake to apne kapre mein thooke phir usay le kar nikal jaye."
"6234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hidayat ki taraf bulaye us ke liye us ke pairwi karne walon ke ajr ke barabar ajr hai, is se un ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi hoti; aur jo gumrahi ki taraf bulaye us par us ke pairwi karne walon ke gunah ke barabar gunah hai, is se un ke gunah mein kuch kami nahi hoti."
"6235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ke liye us ki peeth peeche dua kare, us par muqarrar farishta kahta hai: Ameen, aur tumhein bhi waisa hi mile."
"6236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khane ki dawat diya jaye jabke wo roze se ho to use chahiye ke qubool kare; phir agar chahe to khaye aur agar chahe to chhod de."
"6237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo walima ya us jaisi kisi dawat mein bulaya jaye use qubool karna chahiye."
"6238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teen aulad dafn kare Allah us par aag haram kar deta hai."
"6239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi bhalai ka rasta bataye us ke liye amal karne wale ke barabar ajr hai."
"6240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ki us ki gheebat se hifazat kare, Allah par haq hai ke use aag se azad kare."
"6241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz ke baad zibah kare us ki qurbani mukammal hui aur us ne Musalmanon ki sunnat pai."
"6242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle zibah kare to wo apne liye zibah karta hai, aur jo namaz ke baad zibah kare us ki qurbani mukammal hui aur us ne Musalmanon ki sunnat pai."
"6243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo roze ki haalat mein qai aaye to us par qaza nahi; aur jo qai karwaye to use qaza karni chahiye."
"6244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ka us ke aib ke saath zikr kare us ne us ki gheebat ki."
"6245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere paas zikr kiya jaye aur mujh par durood na padhe us ne jannat ka rasta kho diya."
"6246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere paas zikr kiya jaye use chahiye ke mujh par durood padhe, kyunke jo ek martaba mujh par durood padhta hai Allah us par das martaba rehmat bhejta hai."
"6247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo saamp dekhe aur us ke peechha karne ke dar se use qatl na kare wo hum mein se nahi."
"6248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi museebat zada ko dekhe aur kahe: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe bacha liya us se jis mein tum mubtala ho aur mujhe apni bahut si makhlooq par fazilat di, to use wo museebat nahi pahunchegi."
"6249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ameer se aisi baat dekhe jo usay na-pasand ho use chahiye ke us par sabr kare, kyunke jo jamaat se ek balisht juda ho kar mare wo jaahiliyat ki maut marega."
"6250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se koi burai dekhe use chahiye ke apne haath se badle; agar na kar sake to apni zaban se; agar na kar sake to apne dil se, aur ye iman ka sab se kamzoor darja hai."
"6251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se Zil-Hijjah ka chaand dekhe aur qurbani ka irada rakhe use chahiye ke apne baal aur nakhun na kaate yahan tak ke qurbani kar de."
"6252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe dekhe to wo main hi hun, kyunke Shaitan meri soorat nahi bana sakta."
"6253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe dekhe us ne haq dekh liya, kyunke Shaitan meri shakal ikhtiyar nahi kar sakta."
"6254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe us ne haq dekh liya; beshak Shaitan meri soorat nahi apna sakta."
"6255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe wo mujhe jaagte hue bhi dekhega, aur Shaitan meri soorat nahi bana sakta."
"6256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe us ne mujhe dekh liya, kyunke Shaitan ko meri soorat ikhtiyar karna nahi chahiye."
"6257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe us ne mujhe dekh liya, kyunke Shaitan meri soorat nahi bana sakta."
"6258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat ye ihtilam dekhe aur us se mani nikle to use ghusl karna chahiye."
"6259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din aur raat sarhad par pahra de us ke liye ek maheene ke roze aur qiyam ke barabar ajr hai; aur jo sarhad par pahre ki haalat mein mare us ke liye bhi waisa hi ajr jari rahega, usay rizq diya jayega aur qabr ke fitne se mehfooz rahega."
"6260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek chakkar chale usay qayamat ke din us mein jo ghubaar laga us ke barabar mushk milegi."
"6261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo reham kare agarche chidya ke zibah par, Allah qayamat ke din us par reham karega."
"6262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ko bachaye Allah qayamat ke din us ke chehre se aag door kar dega."
"6263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ki hifazat kare wo us ke liye aag se parda ban jata hai."
"6264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise shugun ne apni hajat se rok diya us ne shirk kiya."
"6265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raaste se patthar hata de us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai, aur jis ke paas ek neki ho wo jannat mein dakhil hota hai."
"6266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baarah rakaat padhe us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jata hai."
"6267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein dushman ko teer maare aur us ka teer dushman tak pahunche, chahe lage ya na lage, to wo ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai."
"6268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein teer maare to wo us ke liye ek azad ghulam ke barabar hai."
"6269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi momin ko kufr ka taana mare to ye us ke qatl ke barabar hai."
"6270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat mein ham par hamla kare wo hum mein se nahi."
"6271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi qaum ki ziyarat kare to un ki imamat na kare, un hi mein se ek aadmi imamat karaye."
"6272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ki zameen us ki ijaazat ke baghair boe to us ke liye us ka kharch hai aur us ki fasal mein us ka kuch hissa nahi."
"6273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kheti boe phir us mein se koi parinda ya khane wali cheez khaye to wo us ke liye sadqa hai."
"6274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zina kare us se iman nikal jata hai; phir agar tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai."
"6275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah se teen martaba jannat maange jannat kahti hai: Ae Allah, use jannat mein dakhil kar; aur jo teen martaba jahannam se panah maange jahannam kahti hai: Ae Allah, use jahannam se bacha."
"6276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sachche dil se Allah se shahadat maange Allah use shaheedon ke darjat tak pahuncha deta hai agarche wo apne bistar par mare."
"6277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne dil se sachcha ho kar Allah se raah-e-khuda mein qatl hona maange Allah use shaheed ka ajr deta hai agarche wo apne bistar par mare."
"6278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon se un ka maal zyada karne ke liye maange wo jahannam ke angaare maang raha hai, pas chahe kam maange ya zyada."
"6279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon se sawal kare jabke us ke paas itna ho jo usay kifayat kare, wo qayamat ke din aayega aur us ka sawal us ke chehre par kharaashon ki tarah hoga. Poocha gaya: Maldari kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Pachaas dirham ya us ke barabar sona."
"6280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi cheez ka sawal kare jabke us ke paas kifayat ka maal ho to wo jahannam ke angaare zyada kar raha hai. Logon ne kaha: Kifayat kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jitna us ke subah aur shaam ke khane ke liye kafi ho."
"6281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo baghair faqa ke sawal kare goya wo angaare khata hai."
"6282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sawal kare aur us ke paas chaalis dirham hon wo israr karne wala hai."
"6283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sawal kare aur us ke paas ek auqiya ki qeemat ho us ne israr kiya."
"6284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm ke baare mein poocha jaye aur wo use chhupaye, Allah qayamat ke din us ke munh par aag ki lagam lagayega."
"6285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere sahaba ko gaali de us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai."
"6286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo har namaz ke baad tees teehatis tasbeeh, tees teehatis tahmeed aur tees teehatis takbeer kare, ye ninyaanve hain, aur sau poore karne ke liye kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain agarche wo samundar ke jhaag ke barabar hon."
"6287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein apne Musalman bhai ka aib chhupaye Allah qayamat ke din us ka aib chhupayega."
"6288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo iman ki mithas paana chahe use chahiye ke kisi aadmi se sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare."
"6289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke Allah aur us ke Rasool us se muhabbat karen use chahiye ke mushaf mein Quran padhe."
"6290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke Allah us ki dua sakhti aur gham ke waqt qubool kare use chahiye ke khushi ke waqt zyada dua kare."
"6291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke Allah us ka rizq badhaye aur us ki umar lambi kare use chahiye ke rishta jode."
"6292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke Isa ki aajizi dekhe use Abu Dharr ko dekhe."
"6293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke qayamat ke din aise dekhe jaise us ne aankhon se dekha ho use padhna chahiye: Jab sooraj lifta diya jayega, aur Jab aasman phat jayega, aur Jab aasman shaq ho jayega."
"6294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki neki usay khush kare aur burai usay ghamgheen kare wo momin hai."
"6295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chori kare aur us ki chori ki cheez kisi ghair-muttaham aadmi ke paas mile, to agar chahe to us ki qeemat le le aur agar chahe to apne saathi ka peechha kare."
"6296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dehat mein rahe wo sakht ho jata hai, jo shikar ke peechhe lage wo ghaafil ho jata hai, aur jo sultan ke paas jaye wo fitne mein pad jata hai."
"6297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm talash karne ke liye kisi raaste par chale Allah us ke liye jannat ke raaston mein se ek rasta aasan kar deta hai; aur farishte ilm talash karne wale ke liye apne paron ko bichha dete hain us ke kaam se khush ho kar; aur aalim ke liye aasman aur zameen mein jo hain aur pani ke andar machhliyan bhi maghfirat maangti hain; aur aalim ki fazilat abid par aise hai jaise poore chaand ki raat ka chaand baqi sitaraon par; aur ulama nabiyon ke waris hain; aur nabiyon ne dinar aur dirham ka waris nahi chhoda, unhon ne ilm ka waris chhoda; pas jo usay le le us ne poora hissa le liya."
"6298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm talash karne ke liye kisi raaste par chale Allah us ke liye jannat ka rasta aasan kar deta hai."
"6299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ham par talwar kheench le wo hum mein se nahi."
"6300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo azan sune aur na aaye, us ki namaz nahi, siwaye kisi uzr ke."
"6301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dajjal ke baare mein sune use chahiye ke us se door rahe; Allah ki qasam, aadmi us ke paas aayega aur wo apne ko momin samajhta hoga magar wo us ki pairwi karega, us shakook ki wajah se jo us ke saath bheje jayenge."
"6302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo masjid mein koi gumshuda cheez dhoondte hue sunay to use chahiye ke kahe: Allah tujhe wapas na de, kyunke masjidein is liye nahi banayin."
"6303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo riya kaari se apna amal sunaye Allah use sunwa dega, aur jo dikhawa kare Allah us ka dikhawa zahir kar dega."
"6304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo riya kaari se apna amal sunaye Allah use sunwa dega, aur jo dikhawa kare Allah us ka dikhawa zahir kar dega; aur jo mukhalifat kare Allah qayamat ke din us par sakhti karega."
"6305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein achhi sunnat jari kare us ke liye us ka ajr aur us ke baad amal karne walon ka ajr hai, un ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi; aur jo Islam mein buri sunnat jari kare us par us ka wabal aur us ke baad amal karne walon ka wabal hai, un ke wabal mein kuch kami nahi."
"6306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo achhi sunnat jari kare jis par us ke baad amal kiya jaye, us ke liye us ka ajr aur un ke ajr ke barabar hai, un ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi; aur jo buri sunnat jari kare aur us ke baad us par amal kiya jaye, us par us ka wabal aur un ke wabal ke barabar hai, un ke wabal mein kuch kami nahi."
"6307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein baal safed kare wo qayamat ke din us ke liye noor hoga."
"6308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein baal safed kare wo qayamat ke din us ke liye noor hoga."
"6309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sharaab piye use kodo; agar dobara piye to kodo; agar teesri baar piye to kodo; agar chauthi baar piye to use qatl kar do."
"6310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein sharaab piye phir us se tauba na kare, use aakhirat mein haram kar diya jayega."
"6311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein sharaab piye wo aakhirat mein nahi piyega."
"6312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sharaab piye us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai; phir agar dobara piye to us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar tauba kare Allah qubool karta hai; phir agar dobara piye to us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar tauba kare Allah qubool karta hai; phir agar chauthi baar piye to us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti, phir agar tauba kare bhi to Allah us ki tauba qubool nahi karta aur use nehar-e-khabal se pilayega."
"6313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sharaab piye aur nasha ho jaye us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar wo mar jaye to aag mein dakhil hoga; agar tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai; phir agar dobara piye aur nasha ho jaye to us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar wo mar jaye to aag mein dakhil hoga; aur agar tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai; phir agar dobara piye aur nasha ho jaye to us ki chaalis subah ki namaz qubool nahi hoti; agar wo mar jaye to aag mein dakhil hoga; aur agar tauba kare Allah us ki tauba qubool karta hai; phir agar dobara piye to Allah par haq ho jata hai ke qayamat ke din use radghat-ul-khabal se pilaye, jo jahannam walon ka arq hai."
"6314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chandi ke bartan mein piye goya wo apne pet mein jahannam ki aag ko ghot raha hai."
"6315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sone ya chandi ke bartan mein piye to wo apne pet mein jahannam ki aag bharta hai."
"6316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki shafaat kare aur wo us ke liye tohfa de aur wo qubool kar le, us ne sood ke bade darwazon mein se ek darwaza khol liya."
"6317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze mein shamil ho yahan tak ke us par namaz padhe us ke liye ek qeeraat hai; aur jo us mein shamil ho yahan tak ke dafn kiya jaye us ke liye do qeeraat hain jaise do bade pahar."
"6318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, Allah us par aag haram kar deta hai."
"6320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain, aur Isa us ke bande, us ke Rasool, us ki laundi ke bete, us ka kalma jo us ne Maryam ki taraf bheja aur us ki taraf se rooh hai, aur jannat haq hai, jahannam haq hai aur ba's haq hai, to Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega us ke amal ke bawajood, jannat ke aath darwazon mein se jis se chahe."
"6321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamari is namaz mein shamil ho aur hamare saath khada rahe yahan tak ke hum rawana hon, aur us se pehle raat ya din mein Arafat mein waqoof kar chuka ho, us ka Hajj mukammal hua aur us ne apna ihram khol liya."
"6322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni talwar nikaal le phir rakh de to uska khoon raayegan hai."
"6323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamesha roza rakhe us ne na roza rakha na iftar kiya."
"6324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo har maheene teen din roze rakhe us ne poora saal roza rakha."
"6325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramzan ke roze iman aur ihtisab ke saath rakhe us ke pichhle aur aage ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramzan ke roze iman aur ihtisab ke saath rakhe us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramzan ke roze rakhe phir Shawwal ke chhe roze rakhe to goya us ne hamesha roza rakha."
"6328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Eid ke baad chhe din roze rakhe to poora saal ka roza hua; jis ne neki ki us ke liye das guna hai."
"6329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us din ke badle us ke chehre se jahannam ki garmi ko sattar saal door kar deta hai."
"6330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us se jahannam ko sau saal ki musafat door kar deta hai."
"6331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us ka chehra jahannam se sattar saal door kar deta hai."
"6332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us ka chehra aag se sattar saal door kar deta hai."
"6333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us ke aur aag ke darmiyan khandaq bana deta hai jaisa aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan hai."
"6334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us din ke badle us ke chehre ko aag se sattar saal door kar deta hai."
"6335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Arfa ke din roza rakhe Allah us ke do saal ke gunah maaf karta hai: ek guzra saal aur ek aane wala saal."
"6336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni sawari se gir kar mare wo shaheed hai."
"6337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do thandi namazain (Fajr aur Asr) padhe wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr padhe wo Allah ke zimme mein hai, pas Allah tum se apne zimme ki kisi cheez ka mutalba na kare."
"6339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr padhe wo Allah ke zimme mein hai; pas Allah tum se apne zimme ki koi cheez na maange, kyunke jo Allah apne zimme se us se koi cheez maangega use pakad lega, phir use munh ke bal jahannam ki aag mein daal dega."
"6340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chasht ki chaar rakaat padhe aur zohr se pehle chaar rakaat padhe, us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jata hai."
"6341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Isha jamaat ke saath padhe goya us ne aadhi raat qiyam kiya; aur jo Fajr jamaat ke saath padhe goya us ne poori raat namaz padhi."
"6342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Isha jamaat ke saath padhe wo aadhi raat ke qiyam ke barabar; aur jo Isha aur Fajr jamaat ke saath padhe wo poori raat ke qiyam ke barabar."
"6343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr padhe wo shaam tak Allah ke zimme mein hai."
"6344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr padhe wo Allah ke zimme mein hai, pas Allah tum se apne zimme ki koi cheez na maange."
"6345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr padhe wo Allah ke zimme mein hai aur uska hisab Allah par hai."
"6346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr jamaat ke saath padhe phir baith kar Allah ka zikr kare yahan tak ke sooraj nikal aaye phir do rakaat padhe, us ke liye poori poori poori hajj aur umrah ka ajr hai."
"6347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Subah ki ek rakaat padhe phir sooraj nikal aaye to use Subah ki namaz poori padhni chahiye."
"6348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz padhe aur use poora na kare us mein us ki tasbeehon se izafa kiya jata hai yahan tak ke wo poori ho jaye."
"6349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz padhe aur us mein Ummul Quran (Surah Fatiha) na padhe to wo adhoori hai, adhoori hai, adhoori hai, poori nahi."
"6350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamari namaz padhe, hamari qibla ki taraf rukh kare aur hamara zibah kiya hua khaye, wo Musalman hai jis ke liye Allah ka zimma aur us ke Rasool ka zimma hai; pas Allah ke zimme mein khayanat na karo."
"6351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamari namaz padhe aur hamari qurbani kare us ne qurbani pa li; aur jo namaz se pehle qurbani kare us ki qurbani nahi."
"6352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz padhe us ke liye ek qeeraat hai; phir agar dafn mein shamil ho us ke liye do qeeraat hain; qeeraat Uhud ke barabar hai."
"6353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz padhe us ke liye ek qeeraat hai; aur jo us ka intezar kare yahan tak ke use lahad mein rakh diya jaye us ke liye do qeeraat hain; aur do qeeraat do bade paharon ke barabar hain."
"6354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo masjid mein janaze par namaz padhe us ke liye kuch ajr nahi."
"6355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz padhe aur us ke saath na jaye us ke liye ek qeeraat hai; aur agar us ke saath jaye to do qeeraat."
"6356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis par sau Musalman namaz padhein us ki maghfirat kar di jati hai."
"6357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah das martaba aur shaam das martaba mujh par durood padhe use qayamat ke din meri shafaat milegi."
"6358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek martaba mujh par durood padhe Allah us par das martaba rehmat bhejta hai."
"6359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek martaba mujh par durood padhe Allah us par das rehmat bhejta hai, us ke das gunah mita deta hai aur us ke das darje buland karta hai."
"6360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo din raat mein baarah rakaat nafil padhe Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek kapre mein namaz padhe use chahiye ke us ke donon kinaron ko ek doosre ke khilaf karke lapete."
"6362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo din raat mein baarah rakaat padhe us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jata hai: zohr se pehle chaar, us ke baad do, maghrib ke baad do, isha ke baad do aur Fajr se pehle do."
"6363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khada ho kar namaz padhe wo afzal hai; jo baith kar padhe us ke liye khade wale ke aadhe ajr hai; aur jo let kar padhe us ke liye baithne wale ke aadhe ajr hai."
"6364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zohr se pehle chaar aur us ke baad chaar rakaat padhe Allah use aag par haram kar deta hai."
"6365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke liye chaalis din jamaat ke saath namaz padhe aur pehli takbeer pa le us ke liye do barait likhi jati hain: aag se baraat aur nifaq se baraat."
"6366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz padhe aur baith kar namaz ka intezar kare wo namaz mein hi rehta hai yahan tak ke wo namaz usay mil jaye jo wo padhne wala hai."
"6367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khamosh rahe wo bach gaya."
"6368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke saath koi bhalai ki jaye aur wo karne wale se kahe: Allah tumhein khair de, us ne tareef mein poora haq ada kar diya."
"6369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo koi kaam hamare amr ke khilaf kare wo rad hai."
"6370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tasveer banaye Allah qayamat ke din usay us se azab dega yahan tak ke wo us mein rooh phoonke aur wo phoonkne wala nahi; aur jo jhoota khwab bayan kare usay do jaun ke darmiyan girah lagane ka bojh diya jayega aur wo girah lagane wala nahi; aur jo logon ki baat un se chhup kar sune jabke wo us se bhaagte hon, qayamat ke din us ke kaanon mein pighla hua see daala jayega."
"6371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein tasveer banaye usay qayamat ke din us mein rooh phoonkne ka bojh diya jayega aur wo phoonkne wala nahi."
"6372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dushmani kare Allah us se dushmani karega, aur jo mukhalifat kare Allah us par sakhti karega."
"6373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle qurbani kare to wo apne liye zibah karta hai; aur jo namaz ke baad zibah kare us ki qurbani mukammal hui aur us ne Musalmanon ki sunnat pai."
"6374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zulm se kisi ko kore maare qayamat ke din us ka badla liya jayega."
"6375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko aisi hadd maare jo us ne nahi ki, ya usay thappar maare, to us ka kaffara use azad karna hai."
"6376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko zulm se maare qayamat ke din us ka qisas liya jayega."
"6377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maal kharch karne mein kanjoosi kare aur raat ki ibadat se bachta ho use chahiye ke Subhan Allah wa bihamdihi ka wird kare."
"6378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghar tang kare ya raasta kaat de ya kisi momin ko sataye us ka koi jihad nahi."
"6379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Baitullah ka saat tawaf kare aur do rakaat padhe wo ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai."
"6380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is ghar ka ek hafta tawaf kare aur usay poora kare wo ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai; wo ek qadam na rakhta hai aur na uthata hai magar Allah us se ek gunah mita deta hai aur us ke liye ek neki likhta hai."
"6381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sachche dil se shahadat talab kare use ata ki jati hai agarche use shahadat na mile."
"6382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm is liye talab kare ke us se ulama par fakhr kare, ya bewaqoofon se jhagda kare, ya logon ke chehre us ki taraf maayel kare, wo aag mein hai."
"6383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm is liye talab kare ke us se ulama ka muqabla kare, ya bewaqoofon se jhagda kare, ya logon ke chehre us ki taraf maayel kare, Allah use aag mein dakhil karega."
"6384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo haq talab kare use chahiye ke iffat ke saath talab kare, chahe wo poora mile ya na mile."
"6385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ek balisht zameen par zulm kare use saat zameenon ka tauq pehnaya jayega."
"6386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ammar se dushmani kare Allah us se dushmani karega, aur jo Ammar se bugz kare Allah us se bugz karega."
"6387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi beemar ki ayadat kare ya apne bhai ki Allah ke liye ziyarat kare, use ek pukarnewala pukarega: Tum paak ho jao, tumhara chalna paak ho, aur tum ne jannat mein ghar bana liya."
"6388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi beemar ki ayadat kare jis ki maut ka waqt nahi aaya, aur us ke paas saat martaba kahe: Main Allah Azeem se, Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab se sawal karta hun ke tumhein shifa de, to Allah use us bimari se aafiyat de dega."
"6389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi beemar ki ayadat kare wo jannat ke baghon mein rehta hai yahan tak ke wapas aaye."
"6390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki panah maange us ne aise ki panah maangi jo panah dene wala hai."
"6391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo do ladkiyon ki parwarish kare yahan tak ke wo baligh ho jayen, main aur wo jannat mein aise honge, aur aap ne do ungliyan mila kar batayin."
"6392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke saamne rehan ki tehni pesh ki jaye use wapas na kare, kyunke wo uthane mein halki aur khushbu mein achhi hai."
"6393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke saamne khushbu pesh ki jaye use wapas na kare, kyunke wo uthane mein halki aur khushbu mein achhi hai."
"6394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo taweez latkaye us ne shirk kiya."
"6395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teerandazi seekhe phir chhod de wo hum mein se nahi."
"6396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm sikha de us ke liye us par amal karne wale ka ajr hai, amal karne wale ke ajr mein kuch kami nahi."
"6397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri ummat mein sattar saal tak zinda rahe us ke liye Allah ne umar ke baare mein koi uzr baqi nahi chhoda."
"6398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo aisa amal kare jis par hamara amr nahi wo rad hai."
"6399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah masjid ki taraf jaye aur shaam ko jaye Allah us ke liye jannat mein mehman nawazi tayyar karta hai, jab bhi subah jaye aur shaam ko jaye."
"6400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo paudha lagaye aur us mein se koi insan ya Allah ki makhlooq mein se koi khaye to wo us ke liye sadqa hai."
"6401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein jang kare aur us ki niyat sirf ek oont ki rassi ke siwa kuch na ho, to usay wohi milega jis ki niyat ki."
"6402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat ko dhoye use ghusl karna chahiye, aur jo use uthaye use wuzu karna chahiye."
"6403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat ko dhoye aur us ka satr chhupaye Allah us ke gunah chhupa dega; aur jo use kafan pehnaaye Allah use sundus pehnaayega."
"6404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mayyat ko dhoye use ghusl karna chahiye."
"6405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din ghusl kare aur achhi tarah ghusl kare, phir sawere chale aur pehle waqt mein pahunche, paidal chale aur sawari na kare, imam ke qareeb baith kar sune aur khamosh rahe aur bekar baat na kare, to us ke liye apne ghar se masjid tak har qadam ke badle ek saal ke roze aur qiyam ka ajr hai."
"6406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dhoka de wo hum mein se nahi."
"6407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo humein dhoka de wo hum mein se nahi."
"6408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo humein dhoka de wo hum mein se nahi, aur makr aur fareb aag mein hai."
"6409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo oont ya bakri mein khayanat kare wo qayamat ke din use apne kandhon par utha kar aayega."
"6410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jamaat se ek balisht juda ho us ne Islam ki rassi apni gardan se utaar di."
"6411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki rooh us ke jism se aise nikle ke wo teen cheezon se paak ho: takabbur, qarz aur khayanat, to wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maa aur us ke bachche ke darmiyan judaai karwaye Allah qayamat ke din us ke aur us ke piyaron ke darmiyan judaai kar dega."
"6413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein nikle phir mare ya qatl ho jaye, ya us ka ghora ya oont us ki gardan tor de, ya use koi saamp dang le, ya wo apne bistar par Allah ki kisi bhi maut se mare, to wo shaheed hai aur us ke liye jannat hai."
"6414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo roza rakhne wale ko iftar karaye ya mujahid ko tayyar kare us ke liye us ke barabar ajr hai."
"6415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo roza rakhne wale ko iftar karaye us ke liye us ke barabar ajr hai, siwaye is ke ke roza rakhne wale ke ajr mein kuch kami hoti hai."
"6416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ek oont ke do dudh dene ke waqt ke barabar jang kare us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi; aur jo apne dil se sachcha ho kar Allah se Allah ki raah mein qatl hona maange phir mare ya qatl ho jaye to us ke liye shaheed ka ajr hai; aur jo Allah ki raah mein zakhmi ho ya koi takleef pahunche to wo qayamat ke din sab se zyada khoon baahta hua aayega, us ka rang zafaran ka rang aur khushbu mushk ki khushbu hogi; aur jo Allah ki raah mein koi phora nikal aaye us par shahidon ki mohar hogi."
"6417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is liye lade ke Allah ka kalma buland ho wo Allah ki raah mein hai."
"6418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah ko kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke liye Ismail ki aulad se ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar ajr hai, us ke liye das nekiyan likhi jati hain, das gunah mita diye jate hain, das darje buland kiye jate hain, aur wo shaam tak Shaitan se mehfooz rehta hai; aur agar shaam ko kahe to subah tak us ke liye waisa hi hai."
"6419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghar se nikalte waqt kahe: Bismillah, main ne Allah par bharosa kiya, Allah ki taufeeq ke baghair na gunah se bachne ki taqat hai na neki ki quwwat, to us se kaha jata hai: Tumhein kafi kar diya gaya aur bacha liya gaya, aur Shaitan us se door ho jata hai."
"6420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kahe main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun us ne jhoot kaha."
"6421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kahe ke main Islam se bari-uz-zimma hun, agar wo jhoota hai to wo waisa hi ho jayega jaisa us ne kaha, aur agar wo sachcha hai to wo kabhi Islam ki taraf salaamat wapas nahi aayega."
"6422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo azan sunte waqt kahe: Main bhi gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain; main Allah ke Rab hone, Muhammad ke Rasool hone aur Islam ke deen hone par raazi hua, Allah us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar deta hai."
"6423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo azan sunte waqt kahe: Ae Allah, is mukammal dawat ke Rab aur is qaim hone wali namaz ke Rab, Muhammad ko waseela aur fazilat ata farma aur usay us maqam-e-mahmood par pahuncha jiska tu ne wada kiya hai, to qayamat ke din us ke liye meri shafaat halal ho jati hai."
"6424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah ya shaam ko kahe: Ae Allah, tu mera Rab hai, tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tu ne mujhe paida kiya aur main tera banda hun, main apni taqat bhar tere ahad aur wade par qaim hun, main apne kiye hue amal ke shar se teri panah maangta hun, main tere upar apni naimat ka iqrar karta hun aur apne gunah ka bhi iqrar karta hun, pas meri maghfirat farma, kyunke tere siwa koi gunah maaf nahi karta, to jo us din ya us raat mare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo subah aur shaam ko sau martaba kahe: Subhan Allahil Azeem wa bihamdihi, to qayamat ke din koi aisa nahi aayega jo is se behtar le kar aaye, siwaye us ke jo waisa hi kahe ya us se zyada kahe."
"6426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shaam ko teen martaba kahe: Bismillahil-lazi la yadurru ma'asmihi shai'un fil-ardi wa la fis-sama'i wa huwas-sami'ul-alim, to usay subah tak achanak koi bala nahi pahunchegi; aur jo subah ko teen martaba kahe to usay shaam tak achanak koi bala nahi pahunchegi."
"6427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shaam ko teen martaba kahe: A'uzu bikalimatillahit-tammati min sharri ma khalaq, to us raat use koi saamp ka danka nahi nuqsan dega."
"6428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kahe: Main Allah ke Rab hone, Islam ke deen hone aur Muhammad ke Nabi hone par raazi hua, us ke liye jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"6429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kahe: Subhan Allahil Azeem wa bihamdihi, us ke badle us ke liye jannat mein ek khajoor ka darakht lagaya jata hai."
"6430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kahe: Subhan Allah wa bihamdihi, Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, ashhadu an la ilaha illa anta, astaghfiruka wa atubu ilaika, to agar wo ise kisi zikr ki majlis mein kahe to wo us par lagai jane wali mohar ki tarah hoti hai, aur agar kisi laghw ki majlis mein kahe to wo us ka kaffara ban jati hai."
"6431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau martaba Subhan Allah wa bihamdihi kahe us ke gunah mit jate hain agarche samundar ke jhaag ke barabar hon."
"6432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din imam ke khutbe ke waqt apne saathi se kahe: Khamosh raho, us ne laghw kiya."
"6433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ikhlas ke saath kahe Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi kahe, usay zindagi mein ek din nafa pahunchega, chahe us se pehle jo kuch pahunchna ho pahunch jaye."
"6435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo das martaba kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to wo Ismail ki aulad se ek ghulam azad karne wale ki tarah hai."
"6436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo das martaba kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke liye ek jaan azad karne ke barabar ajr hai."
"6437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau martaba kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi sharik nahi, us ke liye badshahi hai, us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke liye das ghulam azad karne ke barabar ajr hai, us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi jati hain, sau gunah mitaye jate hain, aur wo us din shaam tak Shaitan se mehfooz rahta hai; aur koi us se behtar le kar nahi aata siwaye us ke jo is se zyada amal kare."
"6438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi kahe aur us cheez ka inkar kare jis ki Allah ke siwa ibadat ki jati hai, us ka maal aur khoon haram ho jata hai aur uska hisab Allah azz wa jal par hai."
"6439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat ko das ayaat padhe wo ghaflaton mein se nahi likha jata; jo sau ayaat padhe wo qaniteen mein likha jata; aur jo hazaar ayaat padhe wo muqantireen mein likha jata."
"6440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Ramzan mein iman aur ihtisab se qiyam kare us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Shab-e-Qadr mein iman aur ihtisab se qiyam kare us ke pichhle gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo andhe jhande ke neeche qatl ho, asabiyat ki madad kare aur asabiyat ke liye ghazabnaak ho, to us ka qatl jaahiliyat ka qatl hai."
"6443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghalti se qatl ho jaye us ki diyat sau oont hain: tees bint-e-makhad, tees bint-e-laboon, tees hiqqa aur das bani laboon."
"6444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai."
"6445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai, jo apne khoon ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai, jo apne deen ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai aur jo apne ahl-o-maal ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai."
"6446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein mazloom ho kar qatl ho us ke liye jannat hai."
"6447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni mazloomiyat ki hifazat mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai."
"6448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ahl-e-zimma mein se kisi aadmi ko qatl kare wo jannat ki khushbu nahi payega, halanke us ki khushbu sattar saal ki musafat se pawai jati hai."
"6449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein qatl ho wo shaheed hai, jo Allah ki raah mein mare wo shaheed hai, jo taoon mein mare wo shaheed hai, jo pet ki bimari se mare wo shaheed hai aur jo doob kar mare wo shaheed hai."
"6450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo andhere mein qatl ho jaye, ya un ke darmiyan patthar ya kore se maar ho, to us ki diyat ghalti ki diyat hai; aur jo jaan boojh kar qatl ho us ka qisas hai; pas jo us ke darmiyan aaye to us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai."
"6451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo andhe pan mein qatl ho, un ke darmiyan patthar ya kore se ya lathi se maar ho, to wo ghalti hai aur us ki diyat ghalti ki diyat hai; aur jo jaan boojh kar qatl ho us ka qisas hai; aur jo us ke darmiyan aaye us par Allah ki lanat aur ghazab hai, us se na farz qubool hoga na nafil."
"6452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kafir ko qatl kare us ke liye uska salb hai."
"6453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qatl ho jaye us ke waris ko do mein se behtar ikhtiyar hai: ya qisas le ya diyat le."
"6454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo momin ko qatl kare phir us ke qatl par khush ho, Allah us se na farz qubool karega na nafil."
"6455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jaan boojh kar qatl kare wo maqtool ke warison ke hawalay kiya jayega; agar wo chahein to qatl kar dein aur agar chahein to diyat le lein; aur wo tees hiqqa, tees jaza aur chaalis khalifa hain, aur jis par wo sulah kar lein wo un ka hai."
"6456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ahad wale ko us ke ahad ke baghair qatl kare Allah us par jannat haram kar deta hai."
"6457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ahad wale ko qatl kare wo jannat ki khushbu nahi payega, halanke us ki khushbu chaalis saal ki musafat se pawai jati hai."
"6458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi ahad wale ki jaan ko us ke haq ke baghair qatl kare Allah us par jannat haram kar deta hai, ke wo us ki khushbu bhi na sun sake."
"6459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne aap ko lohe se qatl kare us ka lohe ka hathiyar us ke haath mein hoga jise wo apne pet mein chubhota rahega jahannam ki aag mein hamesha hamesha; aur jo zeher pi kar apni jaan de wo usay jahannam ki aag mein ghoont ghoont piyega hamesha hamesha; aur jo pahar se gir kar apni jaan de wo jahannam ki aag mein girta rahega hamesha hamesha."
"6460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chipkali ko pehli zarb mein qatl kare us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi jati hain; jo doosri zarb mein qatl kare us ke liye itni itni nekiyan hain; aur jo teesri zarb mein qatl kare us ke liye itni itni nekiyan hain."
"6461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise us ka pet qatl kar de use qabr mein azab nahi diya jayega."
"6462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam par zina ka buhtan lagaye, qayamat ke din us par hadd qaim ki jayegi siwaye is ke ke wo waisa hi ho jaisa us ne kaha."
"6463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam par buhtan lagaye jabke wo us ki baat se paak ho, qayamat ke din usay hadd ki saza di jayegi siwaye is ke ke wo waisa hi ho jaisa us ne kaha."
"6464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo har farz namaz ke baad Ayat-ul-Kursi padhe, usay jannat mein dakhil hone se sirf maut rok sakti hai."
"6465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Surah Baqarah ke aakhri do ayaat raat ko padhe us ke liye wo kafi hain."
"6466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun padhe to wo us ke liye Quran ke chauthai ke barabar hai, aur jo Qul huwallahu ahad padhe to wo us ke liye Quran ke tehai ke barabar hai."
"6467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quran padhe use chahiye ke us ke badle Allah se maange, kyunke aise log aayenge jo Quran padh kar logon se maangenge."
"6468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat mein sau ayaat padhe us ke liye us raat ka qiyam likha jata hai."
"6469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki kitaab ka ek harf padhe us ke liye us mein ek neki hai, aur ek neki das guna hai; main ye nahi kahta ke Alif Laam Meem ek harf hai, balke Alif ek harf, Laam ek harf aur Meem ek harf hai."
"6470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din Surah Kahf padhe us ke liye do Jummon ke darmiyan ke noor se roshni ho jati hai."
"6471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumma ke din Surah Kahf padhe us ke liye us ke aur Bait-ul-Ateeq ke darmiyan noor roshan ho jata hai."
"6472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Qul huwallahu ahad gyarah martaba padhe Allah us ke liye jannat mein ghar banata hai."
"6473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Qul huwallahu ahad padhe to goya us ne Quran ka tehai padha."
"6474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Hajj aur Umrah ko mila kar kare us ke liye donon ke liye ek tawaf kafi hai."
"6475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo rishta tode ya jhooti qasam khaye wo apna anjaam marne se pehle dekh lega."
"6476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo seeder ka darakht kaate Allah us ka sar aag mein jhuka dega."
"6477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi jagah baithe aur us mein Allah ka zikr na kare to us par Allah ki taraf se nuqsan hoga; aur jo kisi jagah let jaye aur us mein Allah ka zikr na kare to us par Allah ki taraf se nuqsan hoga."
"6478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko sau auqiya par mukatib kare aur wo das auqiya ke siwa ada kar de phir aajiz ho jaye to wo ghulam rahega."
"6479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka aakhri kalaam Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi ho wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke aur kisi qaum ke darmiyan ahad ho use chahiye ke na girah lagaye na kholay yahan tak ke us ki muddat poori ho jaye ya un ki taraf barabari se ahad phenk de."
"6481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qasam khane wala ho use chahiye ke Allah ke siwa kisi ki qasam na khaye."
"6482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni qurbani namaz se pehle zibah kar chuka ho use chahiye ke us ke badle doosri zibah kare; aur jis ne zibah nahi kiya use chahiye ke Allah ka naam le kar zibah kare."
"6483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle zibah kar chuka ho use chahiye ke dobara zibah kare."
"6484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo narm, aasan aur mulayam ho Allah us par aag haram kar deta hai."
"6485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo masjid mein namaz ka intezar kare wo namaz mein hai jab tak uska wuzu na toot jaye."
"6486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamara aamil ho aur us ki biwi na ho use chahiye ke biwi hasil kare; agar us ka khadim na ho to khadim hasil kare; agar us ka ghar na ho to ghar hasil kare; jis ne is ke siwaye kuch liya wo khayanat karne wala ya chor hai."
"6487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka imam ho to imam ki qirat us ki taraf se qirat hai."
"6488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki teen betiyan hon aur wo un par sabr kare, unhein khilaye, pilaye aur apni kamai se kapra pehnaaye, to wo qayamat ke din us ke liye aag se parda ban jati hain."
"6489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qurbani karna chahe to jab Zil-Hijjah ka chaand nikle use chahiye ke apne baal aur nakhun mein se kuch na kaate yahan tak ke qurbani kar de."
"6490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maaldaar ho aur qurbani na kare wo hamari namaz ki jagah ke qareeb na aaye."
"6491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka kisi baagh mein sharik ho use chahiye ke apna hissa na beche yahan tak ke apne sharik ke saamne pesh kar de."
"6492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka kisi ghar ya khajoor ke baagh mein sharik ho use jaayaz nahi ke apne sharik ki ijazat ke baghair beche; agar wo raazi ho to le le aur agar na chahe to chhod de."
"6493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas baal hon use chahiye ke un ki izzat kare."
"6494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas maal ho use chahiye ke us ka asar zahir kare."
"6495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas khajoor ya zameen ho use chahiye ke apne sharik ke saamne pesh kiye baghair na beche."
"6496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke do chehre hon duniya mein, us ke qayamat ke din do zabanen aag ki hongi."
"6497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas ziyada sawari ho use chahiye ke us se us ki madad kare jis ke paas sawari na ho; aur jis ke paas ziyada khana ho use chahiye ke us ki madad kare jis ke paas khana na ho."
"6498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se maaldaar ho use chahiye ke shadi kare, kyunke ye nazar ko neechi rakhta hai aur sharamgah ki hifazat karta hai; aur jis ke paas kuch na ho use roza rakhna chahiye, kyunke roza us ki shahwat ko todta hai."
"6499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se Jumma ke baad namaz padhe use chahiye ke chaar rakaat padhe."
"6500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, jab wo kisi maamle mein hazir ho to use chahiye ke bhalai ki baat kare ya khamosh rahe; aur aurton ke baare mein wasiyat qubool karo, kyunke aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai aur pasli mein sab se zyada tedhi us ka oopri hissa hai; agar tum use seedha karne jao to use tod doge, aur agar chhod do to wo tedhi hi rahegi; pas aurton ke baare mein wasiyat qubool karo."
"6501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne padosi ke saath achha sulook kare; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke bhalai ki baat kare ya khamosh rahe."
"6502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare; us ki mehman nawazi ek din raat hai aur mehman nawazi teen din hai, is ke baad jo kuch ho wo sadqa hai; aur us ke liye halal nahi ke wo us ke paas thehre yahan tak ke use tang kar de."
"6503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke barabar ke badle ke siwa kuch na le; yani sone ke badle sona."
"6504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apne padosi ko na sataye; aur aurton ke saath bhalai ki wasiyat qubool karo."
"6505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke hammam mein tahband ke baghair na jaye."
"6506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke tahband ke baghair hammam mein na jaye, aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apni biwi ko hammam mein na bheje, aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke aisi dastarkhwan par na baithe jis par sharaab ka daura ho."
"6507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apna pani kisi aur ki fasal par na daale; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke kisi qaidi aurat ke paas us ke paak hone se pehle na jaye; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke maal-e-ghanimat ko taqseem se pehle na beche; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke Musalmanon ke maal-e-ghanimat ka janwar na sawar, pas jab wo use kamzor kar de to usay wapas us mein chhod de; aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke Musalmanon ke maal-e-ghanimat ka kapra na pehne, pas jab wo use purana kar de to usay wapas us mein chhod de."
"6508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke apna pani kisi doosre ki aulad mein na daale."
"6509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho use chahiye ke reshmi kapra aur sona na pehne."
"6510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki fikr aakhirat ho Allah us ki maldari us ke dil mein rakh deta hai, us ke bikhre kaam jama kar deta hai, aur duniya us ke paas na-chahte aati hai; aur jis ki fikr duniya ho Allah us ki faqa us ki aankhon ke saamne kar deta hai, us ke kaam bikhair deta hai, aur duniya se use utna hi milta hai jitna us ke liye likha hai."
"6511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ke paas apne bhai ki koi izzat ya maal ki mazloomiyat ho use chahiye ke aaj hi us se maaf karwa le is se pehle ke us din se badla liya jaye jis din na dinar hoga na dirham; pas agar us ke paas nek amal hoga to us ki mazloomiyat ke barabar us se le liya jayega, aur agar us ke paas nek amal na hoga to us ke saathi ki buraiyan us par daal di jayengi."
"6512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zameen ho aur wo bechna chahe use chahiye ke apne padosi ke saamne pesh kare."
"6513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zameen ho use chahiye ke khud boe ya apne bhai se bowaye, aur use tehai, chauthai ya muqarrar khane ke badle kiraye par na de."
"6514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki zameen ho use chahiye ke usay boe; agar na kar sake aur aajiz ho jaye to use apne Musalman bhai ko mufat de aur kiraye par na de; agar aisa na kare to apni zameen rakhe."
"6515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki do biwiyan hon aur wo ek ki taraf jhuk jaye, wo qayamat ke din aise aayega ke us ka pehlu tedha hoga."
"6516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki fikr aakhirat ho Allah us ke bikhre kaam jama kar deta hai, us ki maldari us ke dil mein rakh deta hai aur duniya us ke paas zaleel ho kar aati hai; aur jis ki fikr duniya ho Allah us ke maamle bikhair deta hai, us ki faqa us ki aankhon ke saamne kar deta hai aur use duniya se utna hi milta hai jitna Allah ne us ke liye likha hai."
"6517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ilm ko us ke ahl se chhupaye, qayamat ke din us ke munh par aag ki lagam lagai jayegi."
"6518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghusse ko pii jaye jabke wo usay nafiz karne par qadir ho, Allah qayamat ke din tamam makhlooq ke saamne usay bulayega yahan tak ke usay hoor-ul-ain mein se jis se chahe shadi karwa dega."
"6519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jaan boojh kar mujh par jhoot bole use chahiye ke apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"6520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne khwab mein jhoot bole use qayamat ke din ek jau ki girah lagane ka bojh diya jayega."
"6521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo haddi toot jaye, bimari ho jaye ya lang ho jaye to wo halal ho gaya aur us par aane wale saal doosra Hajj hai."
"6522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ghusse ko pii jaye jabke usay nafiz karne par qadir ho, Allah qayamat ke din tamam makhlooq ke saamne usay bulayega yahan tak ke usay hoor-ul-ain mein se jis se chahe shadi karwa dega."
"6523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jiska main maula hun uska Ali maula hai."
"6524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jiska main wali hun uska Ali wali hai."
"6525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein resham pehne wo aakhirat mein nahi pehnega."
"6526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shohrat ka kapra pehne Allah qayamat ke din use waisa hi kapra pehnaayega phir us mein aag bhadkayega."
"6527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko thappar maare ya usay maare to us ka kaffara use azad karna hai."
"6528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo nard khele goya us ne apna haath suar ke gosht aur khoon mein daal liya."
"6529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo nard khele us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"6530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo talaq ya azadi ke saath khel kare to wo waisa hi hai jaisa us ne kaha."
"6531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah se aise mile ke us ke saath kisi ko sharik na kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaab bin Ashraf ka kaam kaun karega? Us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ko sataya hai."
"6533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni moonchein na kaate wo hum mein se nahi."
"6534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat ko Fajr se pehle roze ki niyat na kare us ka roza nahi."
"6535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat ko roze ki niyat na kare us ka roza nahi."
"6536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo naalen na paaye use moze pehnne chahiye aur unhein takhnon se neeche kaat de."
"6537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo naalen na paaye use moze pehnne chahiye aur jo tehband na paaye use pajama pehnna chahiye; yani muhrim."
"6538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr se pehle roze ka irada jama na kare us ka roza nahi."
"6539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jhoot ki baat aur us par amal karna na chhode, Allah ko us ke khane peene chhodne ki koi zaroorat nahi."
"6540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo hamare chhote par reham na kare aur hamare bade ka haq na pehchane wo hum mein se nahi."
"6541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ka shukr na kare wo Allah ka shukr nahi karta."
"6542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Fajr ki do rakaat na padh sake use chahiye ke sooraj nikalne ke baad padhe."
"6543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jis haalat par mare Allah usay usi haalat mein uthayega."
"6544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein sarhad par pahre ki haalat mein mare Allah us ka wohi nek amal jari rakhta hai jo wo karta tha, us par rizq jari rakhta hai, fitne se mehfooz rakhta hai aur qayamat ke din usay ghabrahat se mehfooz ho kar uthata hai."
"6545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein sarhad par pahre ki haalat mein mare Allah use qabr ke fitne se mehfooz rakhta hai."
"6546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mare aur us par dinar ya dirham ka qarz ho wo us ki nekiyon se ada kiya jayega, kyunke wahan na dinar hoga na dirham."
"6547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mare aur us par roze baqi hon us ke wali us ki taraf se roze rakhe."
"6548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mare aur na jang kare aur na apne dil mein jang ka irada kare, wo nifaq ki ek shakh par marega."
"6549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mare aur sharaab ka aadi ho, wo Allah se aise milega jaise but parast."
"6550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is halat mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik na kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is halat mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik na kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga, aur jo is halat mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik thehrata ho wo jahannam mein dakhil hoga."
"6552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is halat mein mare ke wo janta ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kankariyan chhue us ne laghw kiya."
"6554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni sharamgah ko chhue use wuzu karna chahiye."
"6555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni sharamgah ko chhue use wuzu karna chahiye."
"6556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jamaat ke saath farz namaz ke liye chale wo hajj ke barabar hai; aur jo nafil namaz ke liye chale wo nafil Umrah ke barabar hai."
"6557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne kisi mahram rishtedar ka maalik ban jaye wo azad hai."
"6558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo koi doodh dene wala janwar inayat kare jo subah sadqa ban kar jaye aur shaam sadqa ban kar aaye, us ke subah aur shaam ke doodh ka sawab hai."
"6559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chandi ka tohfa de, ya doodh ka tohfa de, ya mashkizey ka tohfa de, to wo ek jaan azad karne ke barabar hai."
"6560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo extra pani ya ghaas rok le Allah qayamat ke din us se apna fazl rok lega."
"6561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne wird se ya us ke kisi hisse se so jaye phir Fajr aur Zohr ke darmiyan padh le, Allah us ke liye aise likhta hai jaise us ne raat ko padha ho."
"6562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna witr chhod kar so jaye ya use bhool jaye use chahiye ke yaad aane par padh le."
"6563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apna witr chhod kar so jaye use chahiye ke subah hote hi padh le."
"6564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo raat guzare aur us ke haath mein gosht ki badbu ho aur us ne use na dhoya ho, phir usay kuch ho jaye, to wo apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"6565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo nazar maane ke Allah ki itaat karega use chahiye ke us ki itaat kare; aur jo nazar maane ke Allah ki nafarmani karega use chahiye ke us ki nafarmani na kare."
"6566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise faqa pahunche aur wo logon ke paas le jaye to us ki faqa poori nahi hoti; aur jise faqa pahunche aur wo Allah ke paas le jaye to Allah use jald ya der se rizq dene ke qareeb hai."
"6567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi jagah utre aur kahe: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah maangta hun har us cheez ke shar se jo us ne paida ki, to usay koi cheez nuqsan nahi deti yahan tak ke wo apni jagah se rawana ho jaye."
"6568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujh par durood padhna bhool jaye wo jannat ka rasta kho deta hai."
"6569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz bhool jaye use chahiye ke yaad aane par padh le, kyunke Allah ne farmaya: Aur meri yaad ke liye namaz qaim kar."
"6570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni namaz mein se kuch bhool jaye use chahiye ke baith kar do sajde kare."
"6571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz bhool jaye ya us se so jaye us ka kaffara ye hai ke yaad aane par padh le."
"6572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo namaz bhool jaye use chahiye ke yaad aane par padh le; us ke siwaye koi kaffara nahi."
"6573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo roze ki haalat mein bhool kar khaye ya piye use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare, kyunke Allah ne usay khilaya aur pilaya."
"6574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki peeth peeche madad kare Allah duniya aur aakhirat mein us ki madad karega."
"6575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni qaum ki na-haq madad kare wo us oont ki tarah hai jo kuen mein gir gaya ho aur apni dum ke bal kheencha ja raha ho."
"6576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne qarz khwah ko mohlat de ya us ka qarz maaf kar de wo qayamat ke din arsh ke saye mein hoga."
"6577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi momin ki duniya ki takleef door kare Allah qayamat ke din us ki takleef door karega; jo tangdast ke saath narmi kare Allah duniya aur aakhirat mein us ke saath narmi karega; jo kisi Musalman ka aib chhupaye Allah duniya aur aakhirat mein us ka aib chhupayega; Allah bande ki madad mein rehta hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein rahe; jo ilm talash karne ke liye raaste par chale Allah us ke liye jannat ka rasta aasan karega; aur jab kuch log Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama ho kar Allah ki kitaab padhein aur us ka zikr karein to un par sukoon utarta hai, rehmat unhein dhank leti hai, farishte unhein gher lete hain aur Allah apne paas un ka zikr karta hai; aur jise us ke amal ne peeche kar diya us ka nasab use aage nahi kar sakta."
"6578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka hisab liya jayega wo azab diya jayega."
"6579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ka hisab jaancha jayega wo halak ho jayega."
"6580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis par noha kiya jaye use us nohe ke badle azab diya jayega."
"6581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai se saal bhar juda rahe to ye goya us ne us ka khoon bahaya."
"6582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye apne oont ko kaun gaali de raha hai? Us se utar jao, humare saath koi maloon shamil na ho; apni jaanon ko bad-dua na do, apni aulad ko bad-dua na do, apne maalon ko bad-dua na do; Allah se aisi ghadi na maango jis mein wo maange ga to qubool kar le."
"6583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo khajoor pa le use chahiye ke us se iftar kare; aur jise na mile use pani se iftar kare, kyunke wo paak hai."
"6584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo koi janwar pa le jise us ke maalik charane se aajiz ho kar chhod gaye hon, phir use le kar zinda kar le, to wo us ka hai."
"6585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo maaldaar ho use chahiye ke hibr ki chadar mein kafan diya jaye."
"6586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo luqta pa le use chahiye ke do aadil gawah bana le, na chhupaye na khel kare; phir agar us ka maalik mile to use wapas kar de, warna wo Allah ka maal hai jo wo jise chahe deta hai."
"6587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo is waswasay mein mubtala ho use chahiye ke teen martaba kahe: Hum Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laye, kyunke is se wo waswasa door ho jata hai."
"6588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise tum janwar ke saath zina karte pao use qatl kar do aur janwar ko bhi qatl kar do."
"6589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise tum qaum-e-Lut ka amal karte pao to fail aur mafool donon ko qatl kar do."
"6590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo saf ko jode Allah use jod de, aur jo saf ko kaate Allah use kaat de."
"6591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sharaab ko rakh de, is jumle ka baqi hissa zaya ho gaya hai, aur jo us ke peene ka aadi ho use khabal pilaya jayega."
"6592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo takabbur se apna tehband zameen par ghasit kar chale use aag mein ghasit kar chala jayega."
"6593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah us ke donon jabdon ke darmiyan ki cheez aur us ke donon paon ke darmiyan ki cheez ke shar se bacha le wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"6594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo qazi bana diya jaye us ne baghair chhuri ke zibah kar liya."
"6595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Musalmanon ke maamlat mein se koi zimmedari le phir apne logon ki milawat, un ki hajat, un ki faqa aur un ki tangi se parda kare, Allah qayamat ke din us ki milawat, hajat, faqa aur tangi se parda karega."
"6596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se koi amal ka zimmedar bane aur Allah us ke saath khair ka irada rakhe to us ke liye ek nek wazir bana deta hai; agar wo bhool jaye to wazir usay yaad dilata hai aur agar yaad rakhe to wazir us ki madad karta hai."
"6597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon par reham na kare Allah us par reham nahi karta."
"6598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo reham na kare us par reham nahi kiya jata."
"6599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo reham na kare us par reham nahi kiya jata, aur jo maaf na kare use maaf nahi kiya jata."
"6600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo reham na kare us par reham nahi kiya jata, jo maaf na kare use maaf nahi kiya jata, aur jo tauba na kare us ki tauba qubool nahi hoti."
"6601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ka shukr na kare wo Allah ka shukr nahi karta."
"6602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhari khidmat karne walon mein tumhare mutabiq hon unhein wohi khilao jo tum khate ho aur wohi pehnao jo tum pehnte ho; aur jo tumhare mutabiq na hon unhein bech do aur Allah ki makhlooq ko azab na do."
"6603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere liye ek cheez ki zimmedari le le main us ke liye jannat ki zimmedari lunga: logon se kuch na maange."
"6604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere liye zimmedari le le ke logon se kuch na maangega main us ke liye jannat ki zimmedari lunga."
"6605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere liye us ke donon jabdon aur donon paon ke darmiyan ki cheez ki zimmedari le le main us ke liye jannat ki zimmedari lunga."
"6606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo narmi ko haram kare wo tamam khair se mehroom ho jata hai."
"6607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere zimme ke ahad ko tode main us ka dushman hun, aur jis se main jhagra karun main us par ghalib aata hun."
"6608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo jannat mein dakhil hoga wo us mein aish karega, kabhi ghamgheen nahi hoga, us ke kapre purane nahi honge aur us ki jawani khatm nahi hogi."
"6609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo dikhawa kare Allah us ka dikhawa zahir kar dega, aur jo shohrat ke liye sune Allah us ki sunwai kar dega."
"6610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah jis ke saath khair ka irada rakhe use museebat mein mubtala karta hai."
"6611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah jis ke saath khair ka irada rakhe use deen mein samajh ata karta hai."
"6612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah jis ke saath khair ka irada rakhe use deen mein samajh ata karta hai; main to baantne wala hun aur Allah deta hai; aur ye ummat Allah ke amr par qaim rahegi, un ke mukhalif un ka kuch nahi bigaad sakenge yahan tak ke Allah azz wa jal ka amr aa jaye."
"6613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quraysh ki zillat chahe Allah use zaleel karega."
"6614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tangdast ke saath narmi kare Allah duniya aur aakhirat mein us ke saath narmi karega."
"6615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tum mein se nabeeth piye use chahiye ke usay akela kishmish, akela khajoor ya akela kachcha khajoor se banaye."
"6616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Marar ki ghati par chadhe us se utna gunah utar jata hai jitna Bani Israel se utara gaya tha."
"6617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mere liye us ke donon jabdon aur donon paon ke darmiyan ki cheez ki zimmedari le le main us ke liye jannat ki zimmedari lunga."
"6618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri nafarmani kare us ki itaat kaise karun? Kya Allah mujhe zameen walon par amanatdar thehrata hai aur tum mujhe amanatdar nahi samajhte?! Beshak is ki aulad mein se aise log honge jo Quran padhenge jo un ke galon se aage nahi guzarta; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai; wo Musalmanon ko qatl karenge aur buton walon ko chhod denge. Agar main unhein pa lun to main unhein qaum-e-Aad ki tarah qatl karunga."
"6619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki hajat mein lage Allah us ki hajat mein lagega."
"6620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mina utarne ki jagah hai jo pehle pahunche us ki."
"6621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera ye mimbar jannat ki nadiyon mein se ek nadi par hai."
"6622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kal hamara utarna, insha Allah, Bani Kinana ki wadi ke kinare hoga jahan unhone kufr par qasam khai thi."
"6623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iraq ne apna dirham aur apna qafiz rok liya, Shaam ne apna mudd aur dinar rok liya, Misr ne apna ardeb aur dinar rok liya; tum wapas wahan pahunche jahan se shuru kiya tha, wapas wahan pahunche jahan se shuru kiya tha, wapas wahan pahunche jahan se shuru kiya tha."
"6624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do hirs karne wale kabhi nahi bharte: ilm talab karne wala aur duniya talab karne wala."
"6625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logon, amalon mein itna karo jitni tum mein taqat hai; Allah ki qasam, Allah sawab dena nahi chhodta yahan tak ke tum thak jao."
"6626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Aisha, ruk jao! Allah be-haya baat aur be-sharmi ko pasand nahi karta."
"6627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Aisha, aahista! Tum par narmi lazmi hai aur sakhti aur be-sharmi se bacho."
"6628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Khalid, aahista! Usay gaali na do; us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, us ne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar maqs wala bhi aisi tauba kare to us ki maghfirat kar di jaye."
"6629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina walon ka ehram Zul-Hulaifa se aur doosre raaste ke liye Juhfa se; Iraq walon ka ehram Zat-e-Irq se; Najd walon ka ehram Qarn se; aur Yemen walon ka ehram Yalamlam se hai."
"6630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare mawali hum mein se hain."
"6631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achanak maut gham ka pakadna hai."
"6632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banjar zameen Allah aur us ke Rasool ki hai; pas jo us mein se kuch zinda kare wo us ki hai."
"6633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa bin Imran Allah ke chune hue hain."
"6634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband ki jagah pindli ke aadhe tak aur us ke pathay tak hai; agar tum inkar karo to us se neeche, aur agar phir inkar karo to pindli ke peeche, aur takhnon ka tehband mein koi haq nahi."
"6635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein kore ke barabar jagah duniya aur us mein jo kuch hai us se behtar hai."
"6636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein ek lamha khade rehna Hajar-e-Aswad ke paas shab-e-qadr ke qiyam se behtar hai."
"6637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ka mawla unhi mein se hota hai."
"6638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghodon mein barkat un ki surkhi aur safedi mein hai."
"6639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar ka murda janwar halal hai aur us ka pani paak hai."
"6640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pani paak hai, usay koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"6641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pani ko koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"6642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar mein jahaz par jaane wala jise qai aaye us ke liye shaheed ka ajr hai, aur doobne wale ke liye do shahidon ka ajr hai."
"6643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muazzin ki us ki awaaz ke pahunchne tak maghfirat kar di jati hai aur us ka ajr us ke saath namaz padhne walon ke ajr ke barabar hai."
"6644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muazzin ki us ki awaaz ke pahunchne tak maghfirat hoti hai aur har tar aur khushk us ki gawahi deta hai; aur namaz mein hazir hone wale ke liye pachees namaz likhi jati hain aur un ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf kar diye jate hain."
"6645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muazzin qayamat ke din sab logon se zyada lambi gardan wale honge."
"6646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muazzin Musalmanon ki namaz aur un ki hajat ke amanatdar hain."
"6647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muazzin Musalmanon ke iftar aur sehri ke amanatdar hain."
"6648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ka bhai hai; pas kisi momin ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai ke saude par sauda kare ya apne bhai ke paighaam par paighaam bheje yahan tak ke wo chhod de."
"6649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin jab jannat mein aulad ki tamanna karega to us ka hamal, wiladat aur umar ek hi lamhe mein hoga jaise wo chahega."
"6650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazboot momin Allah ke yahan kamzor momin se behtar aur zyada pyara hai, aur har ek mein khair hai; jo tumhein nafa de us ki hirs karo, Allah se madad maango aur aajiz na bano; aur agar tumhein koi museebat pahunche to ye na kaho ke agar main aisa karta to aisa hota, balke kaho: Allah ne taqdeer ki aur jo us ne chaha kiya; kyunke agar main aisa karta to Shaitan ke amal ka darwaza kholta hai."
"6651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo momin jo logon se milta hai aur un ki takleef par sabr karta hai wo us momin se behtar hai jo logon se nahi milta aur un ki takleef par sabr nahi karta."
"6652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin har haal mein behtar hai; us ki jaan us ke pehlu se nikal jati hai aur wo Allah ki hamd karta rehta hai."
"6653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin saada dil aur sakhi hota hai, aur fajir makkar aur kamina hota hai."
"6654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ke liye imarat ki tarah hai, us ka ek hissa doosre ko mazboot karta hai."
"6655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ka aaina hai."
"6656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin momin ka aaina hai aur momin momin ka bhai hai, wo us ki kami ko poora karta hai aur us ke peechhe se us ki hifazat karta hai."
"6657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ke gunah museebaton ke zariye kaffara hote rehte hain."
"6658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin wo hai jise log apne maalon aur jaanon ke baare mein amanatdar samajhein; aur muhajir wo hai jo gunahon aur khataon ko chhod de."
"6659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ahl-e-iman ke darmiyan jism ke sar ki tarah hai; momin ahl-e-iman ke liye aise dard mehsoos karta hai jaise jism ko sar mein jo takleef ho us se dard hota hai."
"6660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ek aant mein khata hai aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai."
"6661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin mil-jul kar rehta hai; us mein koi khair nahi jo khud nahi milta aur doosron se nahi milta."
"6662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin mil-jul kar rehta hai aur doosron se mil-jul kar rehta hai; us mein koi khair nahi jo khud nahi milta aur doosron se nahi milta; aur logon mein sab se behtar wo hai jo logon ke liye sab se zyada nafa mand ho."
"6663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ek pet mein peeta hai aur kafir saat peton mein peeta hai."
"6664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ghairat karta hai aur Allah ki ghairat sab se zyada hai."
"6665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin peshani ke pasine ke saath marta hai."
"6666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momino ke khoon barabar hain, aur wo doosron ke khilaf ek haath ki tarah hain; un mein se kam martaba wala bhi un ke zimme ki pairwi kar sakta hai. Sun lo, koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahi kiya jayega aur na kisi ahad wala apne ahad ki muddat mein. Jo nayi baat shuru kare us ka wabal usi par hai; aur jo nayi baat shuru kare ya nayi baat shuru karne wale ko panah de us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai."
"6667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ek aadmi ki tarah hain; agar us ka sar dard kare to poora jism bukhar aur jaag kar us ki pukar karta hai."
"6668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ek aadmi ki tarah hain; agar us ka sar dard kare to poora dard karta hai aur agar us ki aankh dard kare to poora dard karta hai."
"6669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin narm aur mulayam hain jaise naak wala oont; agar lagam di jaye to maan jaye aur agar kisi chattan par bithaya jaye to baith jaye."
"6670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Quran ka mahir hai wo karam farmanewale paak farishton ke saath hoga; aur jo usay padhta hai aur us mein atakta hai aur us par mushkil hota hai us ke liye do ajr hain."
"6671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aadmi jo fakhr aur muqabla karte hain un ki dawat qubool nahi ki jati aur un ka khana nahi khaya jata."
"6672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khareedar aur bechne wale ko juda hone tak ikhtiyar hai, siwaye is ke ke sauda ikhtiyar ka ho; aur us ke liye halal nahi ke apne saathi ko chhod de is dar se ke wo sauda wapas kar de."
"6673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khareedar aur bechne wale ko juda hone tak ikhtiyar hai, siwaye is ke ke sauda ikhtiyar ke saath ho; pas agar sauda ikhtiyar ke saath ho to sauda wajib ho gaya."
"6674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khareedar aur bechne wale mein se har ek ko doosre par ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon, siwaye ikhtiyar ke saude ke."
"6675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne paas na hone wali cheez se apne aap ko bhara hua dikhaye wo dohre jhoot ka libaas pehne wala hai."
"6676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo meri ummat ke ikhtilaf ke waqt meri sunnat ko thaam le wo angare ko daba kar rakhne wale ki tarah hai."
"6677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki shauhar ki wafat ho gayi ho wo surkh kapre na pehne, na khushbu wale kapre, na zewar, na mehndi lagaye aur na surma."
"6678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Majlisein amanat ke saath hoti hain."
"6679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujahid wo hai jo apne nafs se Allah ke liye jihad kare."
"6680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muhrim aurat na naqab pehne aur na dastane."
"6681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khula karne waliyan munafiq hain."
"6682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mudda-aleh par qasam lazmi hai siwaye is ke ke us par gawahi qaim ho jaye."
"6683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina Urdu ke do pahadon ke darmiyan haram hai; pas jo us mein koi nayi baat shuru kare ya nayi baat shuru karne wale ko panah de us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai, Allah qayamat ke din us se na farz qubool karega na nafil; aur Musalmanon ka zimma ek hai, us ki pairwi un mein se kam martaba wala bhi kar sakta hai; pas jo kisi Musalman ko be-aman kare us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai, Allah qayamat ke din us se na farz qubool karega na nafil; aur jo apne baap ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf daawa kare ya apne aaqa ke siwaye kisi aur ki taraf nisbat kare us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai, Allah qayamat ke din us se na farz qubool karega na nafil."
"6684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina Urdu ke do pahadon ke darmiyan haram hai; us ki ghaas na kaati jaye, us ka shikar na daraaya jaye, us ki luqta sirf us ke liye uthai jaye jo us ka elan kare, kisi aadmi ke liye jaayaz nahi ke us mein ladhne ke liye hathiyar le, aur us se koi darakht na kaata jaye siwaye is ke ke koi aadmi apne oont ko charaye."
"6685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina is se is tak haram hai, us ke darakht na kaate jayen aur us mein koi nayi baat na shuru ki jaye; jo us mein nayi baat shuru kare ya nayi baat shuru karne wale ko panah de us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki lanat hai, Allah qayamat ke din us se na farz qubool karega na nafil."
"6686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina haram aur pur-aman hai."
"6687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran mein jhagda karna kufr hai."
"6688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi namaz mein hai jab tak us ka intezar kare."
"6689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne mahboob ke saath hoga."
"6690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat chhupane wali cheez hai; pas jab wo ghar se nikalti hai to Shaitan usay niharta hai."
"6691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurat apne aakhri shauhar ki hoti hai."
"6692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muzdalifa pura waqoof ki jagah hai."
"6693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mizr, yani jau ki sharaab, pura haram hai.... ..."
"6694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawal ye hai ke tum apne donon haath kandhon ke barabar uthao; istighfar ye hai ke ek ungli se ishara karo; aur iltija ye hai ke donon haath poore phaila do."
"6695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawal chehre ke kharaash hain jo aadmi apne chehre par karta hai; pas jo chahe apne chehre par unhein baqi rakhe aur jo chahe chhod de, siwaye is ke ke aadmi kisi sultan se maange ya aisi baat mein maange jis se koi chara na ho."
"6696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do gaali dene wale shaitan hain jo ek doosre par cheekhte aur jhoot bolte hain."
"6697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do gaali dene walon ne jo kuch kaha us ka wabal shuru karne wale par hai yahan tak ke mazloom hadd se aage badh jaye."
"6698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mustahaza aurat apne haiz ke dinon mein namaz chhod de, phir ghusl kare aur namaz padhe, aur har namaz ke waqt wuzu kare."
"6699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mustahaza aurat ek haiz se doosre haiz tak ghusl kare."
"6700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis se mashwara liya jaye wo amanatdar hai."
"6701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis masjid ki bunyad taqwa par rakhi gayi wo meri ye masjid hai."
"6702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid har momin ka ghar hai."
"6703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushk sab se achhi khushbu hai."
"6704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai."
"6705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai; kisi Musalman ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai ko aisa maal beche jis mein aib ho magar wo usay bayan kar de."
"6706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, na us se khayanat karta hai, na us se jhoot bolta hai, na use be-yaar chhodta hai; har Musalman par doosre Musalman ka khoon, maal aur izzat haram hai; taqwa yahan hai, aur aap ne dil ki taraf ishara kiya; aadmi ke bura hone ke liye ye kafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhe."
"6707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, na us par zulm karta hai na use dushman ke hawalay karta hai; jo apne bhai ki hajat mein lage Allah us ki hajat mein lagega; jo kisi Musalman ki takleef door kare Allah us ke badle qayamat ke din us ki takleef door karega; aur jo kisi Musalman ka aib chhupaye Allah qayamat ke din us ka aib chhupayega."
"6708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman se jab qabr mein sawal kiya jayega to wo gawahi dega ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; yahi Allah taala ka qaul hai: Allah iman walon ko duniya ki zindagi aur aakhirat mein pukhta qaul par qaim rakhta hai."
"6709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman bache rahein."
"6710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman bache rahein; aur momin wo hai jise log apne khoon aur maalon ke baare mein amanatdar samajhein."
"6711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman bache rahein, aur muhajir wo hai jo Allah ki mana ki hui cheezon ko chhod de."
"6712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke khoon barabar hain, un mein se kam martaba wala bhi un ke zimme ki pairwi kar sakta hai, un mein se door wala bhi un ki taraf se panah de sakta hai, aur wo doosron ke khilaf ek haath hain; un ka mazboot kamzor ki taraf se badla lega aur un ka tez chalne wala baithne wale ki taraf se; koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahi kiya jayega aur na koi ahad wala apne ahad ki muddat mein."
"6713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman teen cheezon mein sharik hain: ghaas, pani aur aag."
"6714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman apni sharton par qaim rehte hain."
"6715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman apni sharton par qaim rehte hain jab tak wo halal ke mutabiq hon."
"6716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman apni sharton par qaim rehte hain jo haq ke mutabiq hon."
"6717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mein museebatein, bimariyan aur gham badle hain."
"6718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen talaq wali aurat ke liye na rehne ki jagah hai na nafqa."
"6719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqe mein hadd se aage badhne wala rokne wale ki tarah hai."
"6720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maghrib din ka witr hai, pas raat ki namaz ka witr karo."
"6721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maqam-e-Mahmood shafaat hai."
"6722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mukatib ghulam jab tak us ki kitabat ka ek dirham bhi baqi hai ghulam hai."
"6723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mukatib ghulam jitna ada kare utna azad hota hai, us par hadd utni hi qaim hoti hai jitna wo azad hua, aur usay utni hi miras milti hai jitna wo azad hua."
"6724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zyada maal jama karne wale qayamat ke din sab se neeche honge."
"6725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makr aur dhoka aag mein hai."
"6726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makr, dhoka aur khayanat aag mein hai."
"6727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farishte tum mein se kisi par durood bhejte hain jab tak wo apni us namaz ki jagah mein baithe rahe jis mein us ne namaz padhi, jab tak uska wuzu na toote ya na uthe: Ae Allah, us ki maghfirat farma, Ae Allah, us par reham farma."
"6728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farishte aasman mein Allah ke gawah hain aur tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho."
"6729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Badshahi Quraysh mein, qaza Ansar mein, azan Habsha mein aur amanat Azd mein hai."
"6730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jute pehnne wala sawar ke darje mein hai."
"6731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jute pehnne wala sawar hai."
"6732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh dene wala janwar wapas kiya jayega, aur log apni sharton par qaim hain jo haq ke mutabiq hon."
"6733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki raah mein ghore par kharch kare wo us ki tarah hai jo apne donon haath sadqe ke liye phailaye hue ho aur unhein band na kare."
"6734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mahdi meri itrat se hain, Fatima ki aulad se."
"6735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mahdi hum ahl-e-bait se hain, Allah usay ek raat mein durust kar dega."
"6736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mahdi mujh se hain, un ki peshani khuli, naak oonchi; wo zameen ko aise insaf aur adl se bhar denge jaise wo zulm aur sitam se bhar gayi hogi; wo saat saal hukumat karenge."
"6737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mizan Rehman ke haath mein hai, wo kuch qaumon ko buland karta hai aur kuch ko neecha."
"6738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ki maut zeeq-e-janb se ho wo shaheed hai."
"6739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mayyat un kapron mein uthai jayegi jin mein wo marta hai."
"6740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mayyat zinda ke rone par azab diya jata hai; jab wo kahen: Haay mere baazu, haay mere kapre, haay mere madadgar, haay mere pahar, aur is tarah ki baatein, to use hila kar kaha jata hai: Kya tu aisa hi tha?! Kya tu aisa hi tha?!"
"6741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mayyat ko us ke qabr mein us par noha karne ke badle azab diya jata hai."
